  ('zcrm_1579374000178884146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '1-16-26 Kim enrolled in Secure HSA $1250/$448 and is so relieved! She will review the 1Dental and the VSP plans and enroll in those on her own. She was super nice and appreciative. She''s all set with her Welcome Call on Feb. 2nd as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-16 16:55:36', '2026-01-16 16:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178884121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '1-16-26 I called Clara bc received email saying payment didn''t go through. She just got an email as well and will call them. The first payment went though. She''ll take care of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-16 16:22:17', '2026-01-16 16:22:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178884116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117297011', 'Piyush Kansara', NULL, '1-16-26 Parth was cancelled by Anthem due to non-payment. He believed he made the payment successfully but never received confirmation of the payment. He''s on hold with Anthem right now to make it. I checked C4 and they''ve already wiped it out of their system. The enrollment no longer shows up. It shows as cancelled before effective date of 1-1-26. Piyush is calling Parth now to see if he wants me to enroll him for Feb. 1st as a last ditched effort. He''s calling me back shortly. UPDATE - Parth is still on hold to make his payment with Anthem. Hopefully he''ll get through. If not, I let him know we have until Tuesday at 5:00 pm Jan. 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-16 16:11:57', '2026-01-16 16:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178884111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678123', 'Kevin Falardo', NULL, '1-16-26 Kevin called to ask some more great questions. They are ready to move forward and we''ll do so on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-16 15:53:30', '2026-01-16 15:53:30'),
