  ('zcrm_1579374000178841239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177082058', 'Amy Tarwater', NULL, '1/16/26<br>Called to return the members VM about what her membership includes. she wanted to ask a few questions since her welcome call is not for a little while and she wants to bring her son in for a visit. Wanted to know what to do for sick visits so i let her know about the telehealth. also guided her to her ID cards on the app.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-16 13:41:05', '2026-01-16 13:41:05'),
