  ('zcrm_1579374000178841231', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166942005', 'Daniel Shawhan', NULL, '1/16/26<br>Spoke to daniel and he had questions about colonoscopy and how to get one and what his benefits were. LEt him know if it is routine screening preventative then it is covered at 100%. He was asking about different options and ways to save money so we discussed what might work best for him and i sent him a list of in network providers that he can share with his primary who told him if the referred dr was not in network to come back and let them know. Also let him know we can continue communication through the email i sent him if he just has small questions to ask throughout the process. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-16 13:35:53', '2026-01-16 13:36:23'),
