  ('zcrm_1579374000178786071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '1-15-26 Carol will keep her Select Health plan since she deals with migraines. She feels like she get better coverage on that front since it would be pre-x with MCS. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-15 16:45:40', '2026-01-15 16:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178786066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625123', 'Casey Zahorik', NULL, '1-15-26 Casey called to get onto a vision plan. I sent him the info for VSP and he wants glasses every year. He will look that over and likely enroll. He will skip dental since his teeth are good and he only does cleanings. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-15 16:44:30', '2026-01-15 16:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178786056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012048004', 'Paula Slick', NULL, '1-15-26 She is being put onto Repatha which is Tier 3-5. Repatha with Select health shows at about $557 and with Anthem I think about $700 or something crazy. It looks like the best path is to go cash pay and use GoodRX to possibly get a $25 option or worst case $239. This is still cheaper than going with a more expensive plan since they are $200-$300 more per month and then $200 for non-preferred brand. So, she''s be out an additional few hundred more per month.  Her income was showing correctly per the MAGI from her tax form. Her accountant is clueless and doesn''t know what to use or how to guide her with the possible sale of her house this year. So, she''s not getting a tax credit but could get money back in taxes if her income falls below the threshold this coming year 2026.  We also stayed with Cigna to make sure her cardiologist is still in the network. It''s Dr. John McNeill at BCH. I didn''t look it up but she said he''s in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-15 15:56:42', '2026-01-15 16:00:23'),
