  ('zcrm_1579374000179424006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, 'This member was previously on a List Bill and ha MEC + Essentials.  Due to the fact that the employer set up a QSEHRA employees have to be  individual members and submit their monthly charges for reimbursement.  I advised that if member is not an Ind Cont they would not be eligible for the Secure membership.  Member has submitted Tax ID.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-23 08:19:08', '2026-01-23 08:19:08'),
