  ('zcrm_1579374000179375001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know how to "access his benefits".  I asked what he wanted to do and he told me that he was having some pain in his kidney.  I told him how to present and he wanted to know if someone could direct him where to go.  I advised him that for injury or illness he could go anywhere (no network) and to present as cash pay etc.  I told him thst he should start with his Primary Care Doc.  He told me that he was in alot of pain and that he wanted someone to tell him if he should go the the ER.  I told him that the ER was not the place to go for care if it was not life threating.  I told him to be incontact with the Conciergie and that they would help him with the downloading of the APP to access Urgent Care.  Member should have a welcome call to acquaint them with the new benefits and how to use membership,  I will send out invite.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-22 15:23:18', '2026-01-22 15:23:18'),
