  ('zcrm_1579374000179299102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179374002', 'Richard Lambert', NULL, '1-22-26 Richard goes by Burke!  He came to me via Anne and David Tracht. Anne is Burke''s sister. They live in GA. He paid $1000 last year and this year it was going up 40%. So, he''s completely done with that. He was looking at a Multiplan PPO plan for $920 which included dental, vision and hearing. He doesn''t need vision or hearing and we forgot to address dental. He''s 54 and self-employed as a commercial realtor. He sets up different LLC''s for each project due to different investors. He''s setting up the newest LLC now but doesn''t have an EIN yet, so he used in SS# for now. He had surgery on a hernia about 2 years ago and he''s not worried about that happening again. He treats gout with alopurinol. No other pre-x, no other meds and no tobacco. He does his wellness screenings and was interested in learning about HSA. Premium HSA was the best value and he chose $1000/$363 and $125/$25 for March 1st start date. He knows to cancel his other ins for end of Feb. He is very happy and is all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-22 14:54:59', '2026-01-22 14:54:59'),
