  ('zcrm_1579374000179299059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176012061', 'Melissa MoyerBowers', NULL, '1-22-26 Melissa called bc she just learned she can get her mental health counseling at no charge through RMHP and her counselor is in network! The counselor said maybe not to run it through depending on their stipulations. However, I have no idea what RMHP needs to show that it''s necessary. She will give it a whirl. <br>As for MPB and Zion, she just did a Zion Welcome Call which shouldn''t he happening. They don''t her Lee''s correct email address which they are working to fix. She now has the MPB welcome call on Monday and will find out if she can access the Needs Request directly through MPB and perhaps that''s the reason for the email mix up. She might not need a Zion membership portal access separately from MPB. IDK. She will make sure they are all good to go on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-22 13:19:03', '2026-01-22 13:19:03'),
