  ('zcrm_1579374000179299049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179361002', 'Teya Lagatta', NULL, '1-22-26 Teya re-enrolled into Care+ for Feb. 1st start date. She moved off of Jani Osborne and Tilio Lagatta''s membership bc Tilio got benefits from his employer. Teya has an open need for hip pain and her membership has been working well for her to address it. She also might need a small surgery to remove a cyst sometime soon. So, she absolutely didn''t want a lapse in her membership. Patti was graciously able to make it happen for her. I just left a vm with Teya to let Zion know of the membership change and no lapse to make sure there''s no problem moving forward. I told her to call me with questions. Patti says we can''t notify Zion about this because of HIPAA compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-22 12:47:59', '2026-01-22 12:47:59'),
