  ('zcrm_1579374000179288001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179260001', 'Melanie MacDonald', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Care + Plus Tobacco', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-22 06:21:12', '2026-01-22 06:43:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179240108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '1-21-26 With Cigna, Emgality of all types is showing as Tier 3 Preferred Brand and Nurtec as Not Covered.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-21 17:54:17', '2026-01-21 17:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179240094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '1-21-26 Nurtec shows as a Preferred Brand drug with Select Health and Emgality shows as  a Non-Preferred Brand drug. with Select Health. Select Health and Anthem Pathway without Essentials in the name shows up as options for UC Health with Dr. Stacy Dixon. Select Health Value  CO Option Gold at $1525.47 a month. This is Select Health''s ONLY plan with actual drug benefits that will be helpful for Preferred and Non-Preferred Brand meds. Anthem''s site shows Emgality at Tier 2 and Nurtec as Not covered. Tier 2 also says it depends on the plan, if it''s covered. Their Sydney App to price it out per plan isn''t working. I made sure to include Dr. Stacy Dixon at UC Health in the search.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-21 17:12:56', '2026-01-21 17:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179240086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '1-21-26 Carolyn is realizing MCS may not be a good idea bc she thinks she might have a neuromuscular disease and is scheduled to see Dr. Stacy Dixon at UC Health / Anschutz. She also has a Concierge Dr. that helps her with all of her PCP visits. The possible autonomical disease seems to be hereditary in her family. It creates muscle weakness and she calls it clunky. She''s not at quick as she should be and falls more then she should when playing pickle ball.  She might need Emgality or Nurtec to help treat it. Both are very expensive meds. This all may be the cause of her migraines as well.  She doesn''t believe she''ll qualify for a subsidy in 2026. She will need this for April 1st start date. ACA will be the best and only place to go knowing all of this now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-21 16:07:48', '2026-01-21 16:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179225101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176944009', 'Diane Thornton', '1/21/2026', 'How to present herself at the dr office for appt, told cash pay patient...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-21 15:05:21', '2026-01-21 15:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179225096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151124047', 'William Guthrie', '1/21/2026', 'emailed him and his wife on how to get good faith estimates and submit them to zion for sharing that way they can have a better understadning on how to prceed...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-21 15:04:23', '2026-01-21 15:04:23'),
