  ('zcrm_1579374000179240039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179240006', 'Megan Meek', NULL, '1-21-26 I helped her pick the Cigna plan for her needs to begin Feb. 1st. Megan is Kelli Falardo''s employee. We got her signed up late on the 15th to meet the deadline. I believe Kelli Falardo''s business will be paying $400 of the $467 for Megan. So, she doesn''t qualify for a tax credit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-21 12:12:01', '2026-01-21 12:21:55'),
