  ('zcrm_1579374000178943140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161588012', 'Stephanie PageWise', NULL, '1-19-26 Stephanie upgraded to Secure HSA and it looks complete here already. She lost HAB and wants wellness. So, she added the MEC and is self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-19 17:42:12', '2026-01-19 17:42:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178943135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154481297', 'Lisa Rediger', NULL, '12-15-26 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Lance Rediger, Lisa Rediger</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>RMHP Valley Colorado Option Gold</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$4,100</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$19,200</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$3.82 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after $2,932.27 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 8191154800</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/15/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-19 17:19:33', '2026-01-19 17:19:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178943125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141229002', 'Jessica Giles', NULL, '1-19-26 I talked with Jessica to see if changing the IUA would help. She actually quit her job with the church and something else in July 2025. So, she''s been really focused on getting healthy from too much stress. She''s making sure to get proper sleep, changing her diet and not exposing herself to negativity in the world. She''s a person of faith and just praying about her next steps. HAB was super helpful for her. She used the mental health counseling, dentist, labs, well check reimbursements, etc. She''s working with a functional medicine Dr. named Dr. Evans whoc she likes. She at her best as a stay at home mom, home maker, etc. She''s not sure what job will fulfill her needs. She will let me know if/when she''s ready to join again once she feels back in balance and with some income. She was very nice and appreciative of my call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-19 17:10:41', '2026-01-19 17:10:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178943120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '1-19-26 I think Kim chose the wrong Vision plan by accident. I sent her an email inquiring.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-19 16:36:33', '2026-01-19 16:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178943115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '1-19-26 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">1Dental - <a target="_blank" href="http://kimajohnson@mac.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">kimajohnson@mac.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-19 16:36:02', '2026-01-19 16:36:02'),
