  ('zcrm_1579374000178932080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', '1/19/2026', 'email chain with ARM billing issue, they never recived the updated preventitive code billing for her tests on 09/03/2025 so they can not fix the billing without them. explained that she needed to get hospital to send those... RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:22:40', '2026-01-19 14:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178932075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176472047', 'Gopal Krishnan', '1/19/2026', 'email chain with spouce Priya for requested appt. confirmed the first one with her and now working on making her the second appt.... RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:21:14', '2026-01-19 14:21:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178932070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175452047', 'Thomas Levis', '1/19/2026', 'email came in asking if their DOB had been updated from the last request, I responded and asked what the new DOB should be that way we can make sure.. waiting for response... RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:19:50', '2026-01-19 14:19:50'),
