  ('zcrm_1579374000178932062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179018', 'Annie Fisher', '1/19/2026', 'email request in regard to billing concerns "<span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">i''m following up about this issue. Two months ago I changed my monthly payments from a credit card payment to be taken directly from my bank account.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">The first month they were taken from my checking account and that is when I wrote this below letter. I have now switched it over to my savings account, but for some reason the withdrawal on the 2nd month was still taken from my checking account. Can you confirm that I switched that request from my checking to savings account" </span><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">forwarded email to billing... RC </span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:18:20', '2026-01-19 14:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178932057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123843002', 'Ginovelli Silvestre', '1/19/2026', 'having issues with 1admin login.. tried to reset password got a "server error" message. checked with IT said give it 24/48 hours and try it again sent him an emal explaining this.... RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:14:58', '2026-01-19 14:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178946040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137619002', 'Laura Shymkus', NULL, '1/19/26<br>Laura called for some guidance after learning her husband has a stage 3 cancer diagnosis. I walked her through what she needs to do to get a share request going. Told her get treatment plan and estimates and bills for anything related to this diagnosis. Then she can call and request me to get her share request going<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:11:15', '2026-01-19 14:11:15'),
