  ('zcrm_1579374000178926292', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', '1/19/26', 'Alicia called because she has two different sharing requests. I advised her to meet her iua for each instance and to make sure she upload all documentss to zion Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 14:04:00', '2026-01-19 14:04:00'),
