  ('zcrm_1579374000178926243', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175843021', 'Anna Levesque', NULL, '1/19/25<br>Called back she wanted to know how to use her planing the event of a car accident I advice her that her car insurance would be the primary and should be the first one to cover expanses and then the health share would be the secondary AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 13:00:31', '2026-01-19 13:00:31'),
