  ('zcrm_1579374000178946025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176979001', 'Gerona Berdak', NULL, '1/19/26<br>Gerona called after trying to set up her account because she used the same email for her and her husband. i had to get IT to reset the account and then walk her through activating both her and her husband. Now they are logged in and good to go<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 12:40:18', '2026-01-19 12:40:18'),
