  ('zcrm_1579374000178928257', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880001', 'Timothy Wicks', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule the welcome call. Sent an email to do so. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:32:00', '2026-01-19 09:32:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178943027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176543069', 'Earl Richmond', '01/19/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-01-19 09:30:09', '2026-01-19 09:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178946017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173444041', 'Benjamin Larsen', NULL, '1/19/26<br>Ben called for more information on his memberships preventative care features. I explained what is available and how it all works. Let him know that the bloodwork along with an annual visit is covered as long as it is coded preventative and is only routine screening bloodwork. He was curious about if a dermatology screen would be covered under preventative but i let him know that unfortunately it is not and would be out of pocket due to them considering dermatolgy a specialist.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:27:27', '2026-01-19 09:28:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178946009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153834002', 'Alyssa Wicker', NULL, '1/19/26<br>answered her email to add her newborn to the membership. sent the link to make membership changes and explained how to fill it out and about the deadline for her to get that submitted in time to make the change. Will send a reminder tomorrow since that is the deadline of the 20th<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:25:49', '2026-01-19 09:26:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178946001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161729002', 'Nicole Noftz', NULL, '1/19/26<br>Nicole called to reschedule a telehealth visit. I went ahead and transferred her to the schedule and telehealth department at lyric to assist her with that.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:24:16', '2026-01-19 09:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178937018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175614043', 'Anthony Dennis Jr', NULL, '01/19/2026 - Completed WC. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:07:06', '2026-01-19 09:07:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178926137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109365015', 'Ann Parker', NULL, '1/19/25<br>Ann called because she recently went to the er and wanted to know how to use her plan accordingly AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-19 09:01:06', '2026-01-19 09:01:06'),
