  ('zcrm_1579374000178767001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122571002', 'Andrew Thomson', NULL, '1/13/25<br>Andrew called in because he recently had a procedure, he presented his old plansitn card and it was denied because we no longer use planstin. He explained to me that he presented as self pay but his wife Insistead that he provide the mec card. I advised him to call back the billing department and have the rectify that so that he can then open a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-15 08:10:34', '2026-01-15 08:10:34'),
