  ('zcrm_1579374000178760019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172639002', 'Finn Andersson', NULL, 'I received an email from Wendy letting me know that a cancellation that was received after hours on 12/31 was to cancel this new membership, not his aging out of his mothers membership.  I will process this cancellation for 2/26.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-15 07:49:54', '2026-01-15 07:49:54'),
