  ('zcrm_1579374000178760011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145836002', 'Brian Gurinsky', NULL, 'I received cancellation request eff 2/26.  Member cited dissatisfaction with looking at the notes, most of this has to do with Sedera/Savvos not getting back to the member in a timely manner.  I will process, member has already cancelled w/Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-15 07:43:00', '2026-01-15 07:43:00'),
