  ('zcrm_1579374000178674220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '1-14-26 Carol has enrolled in Select Health and has been calling them since Thanksgiving to set up payment. Apparently nobody can reach them including her agent. She will pay $425 with APTC. Otherwise it would be $700. She just has depression and meds, no other pre-x. I quoted her Premium HSA $363/$1000 or $336/$1500. I will waive the $100 enrollment fee since she''s a friend and previously a member with MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 17:05:21', '2026-01-14 17:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674215', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178674180', 'Tyler Scherffius', NULL, '1-14-26 Tyler came to me via Gail Longnecker. The rest of his notes are in his account that is still in Leads. If I converge them it will move him from Leads to Contacts which I don''t want to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:58:26', '2026-01-14 16:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178943145', 'Mary Primo', NULL, '1-14-26 Had to use alternative email - <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://claire@boulderdogmassage.com/"><u>claire@boulderdogmassage.com</u></a>.  I sent her the pricing info directly through the MPB site for both memberships. She''ll discuss it with her husband tonight and let me know tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:45:52', '2026-01-14 16:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178943145', 'Mary Primo', NULL, '1-6-26 Claire came to me via Kayden Wilson. She lives in Longmont, CO and is 40. She wants wellness, mammo, pap, etc. She has ADHD and takes lexipro for mental health. She gets talk therapy benefits through another job. Paying $450 is out of her range. She''s self-employed, no tobacco and maybe would fund an HSA. Her husband has no ins. I discussed Premium HSA and Secure HSA. Looks like we landed on Secure HSA since she likes both traditional and alternative care. $1250/$359 plus $125/$25. Her emails got bounced back so we used an Outlook account. I sent her the overviews for both and pricing for both. She is self-employed and has a part time job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:45:17', '2026-01-15 11:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '1-14-26 Carolyn will need something for April 1st, 2026. She will contact me in early March. I priced out C4 and lowest cost plan is $1082.79. So, she''s open to MCS and will handle any pre-x on her own. Premium HSA is $676/$1000 EC. She''s happy with that and will talk with her financial planner.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:34:26', '2026-01-14 16:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178399002', 'Monique Guilbeau', NULL, '1-14-26 Monique was referred to me by Jane Pulliam. Monique is 58 and husband is 63.  Their premium is going from $600 to $2600 because they earn too much for a subsidy now. They live in Ridgeway, CO. The applied for Freedom Life and were denied. I think they were denied for taking meds for high blood pressure and high cholesterol.  Neither of them use tobacco.  She is self-employed and likes to do her wellness visits. She had an HSA long ago. She was ready to enroll after our first conversation. We connected later in the day and I walked her through the application. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:24:33', '2026-01-14 16:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '1-14-26 Kim called with a few more questions about how to handle her dermatology skin checks and medications. I priced out lamotrigine 100mg 90 days and it''s showing about $12.80 for a 90 day supply. I also told her the virtual mental health can be upgraded to PhD level for $205 1st appt and $100 following. This was she can get her meds renewed. She was happy to hear that. She''ll decide by tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:09:17', '2026-01-14 16:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178674114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130002', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '1-14-26 I sent Tami the instructions to create her C4 account and select me as her agent. She''s about to decide likely between Select Health and Cigna. She will decide by tomorrow and we will meet. I''ll help her enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 16:06:56', '2026-01-14 16:06:56'),
