  ('zcrm_1579374000178680038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '1/14/26<br>Spoke to ryan and his wife katie to explain what exactly the membership offers. they are considering adding her and their kids to the membership so i let them know what the prices were and what the maternity benefits look like as well. they seem to have a good understanding now and will probably add katie to get the 6 month clock going for them because they plan on having another kid in the future. They will also add their other kid later this year when they take the child off of moms benefits<br>AJ <br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-14 13:49:25', '2026-01-14 13:49:25'),
