  ('zcrm_1579374000178665063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156925006', 'Angela Pena', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to make sure that her CC had been updated after she had some issues.  I verified the it was correct.  She also told me that she was told by Reba that Mammograms were shareable by Sedera.  I looked into this and advised her that they might not share in the ultra sound that she gets for dense breasts.  I directed her to the invite that she should have received after enrolling to access the Sedera Member Portal.   Also gave her the Sedera Mbr Svs number to call to have them resend the invite.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-14 13:02:52', '2026-01-14 13:02:52'),
