  ('zcrm_1579374000178674011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050092001', 'Joseph Feran', NULL, '1-14-26 Joe is moving back to CO and he chose Select Health. He wants dental of some kind but doesn''t know what dentist he''ll go to yet. He knows he has to pay in about 10 days but he''ll be moving. So, it''s not ideal. I let him know it''s vital. Not sure if he''ll have trouble reaching Select Health since I''ve heard people can''t reach them. The system wouldn''t let him Pay Now and it says they will call him in 10 days. I don''t trust that. He knows what to do and will let me know if he runs into trouble.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-14 09:34:50', '2026-01-14 09:34:50'),
