  ('zcrm_1579374000178622022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050092001', 'Joseph Feran', NULL, '1-13-26 Joseph is selling his house in FL and moving back to Broomfield. He could''t figure out how to manage the C4 account to get on for Feb. 1st. He has a temporary address in Broomfield until his new home finalizes. His house in FL is slowed down due to the buyer being in the VA and there are extra steps. So, that''s pushing the purchase of his new home back another 10 days. But, he will be in CO and wants CO insurance. We''ll sort it out tomorrow to get on before open enrollment ends.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-13 16:16:29', '2026-01-13 16:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178622010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351427', 'Abigail Hernandez', NULL, '1-13-26 Abigail called just to check in with me to make sure she''s all set for Feb. 1st with Care+ and cancelling her LIfeX membership. I gave her one of the many numbers with LifeX to cancel her plan for Jan. 31st. Gave her the Customer Service # to call. She will do that and her Care+ account looks good to go for Feb. 1st. She asked about her mental health therapist and understands that her current therapist won''t be reimbursable since she''s not part of the network on the platform. She was OK and understands that. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-13 15:46:47', '2026-01-13 15:46:47'),
