  ('zcrm_1579374000178573129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175188001', 'christopher gamblin', NULL, '1/13/26<br>spoke to mary to return missed call. she said she had a welcome call scheduled with susan but did not receive it. I went ahead and gave her some general education and showed her how to find her ID cards and what to do in certain medical situations. She is happy now and knows to call concierge for assistance<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-13 12:17:38', '2026-01-13 14:33:00'),
