  ('zcrm_1579374000178581085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912002', 'Teresa Hostutler', NULL, 'Member called in and left VM to ask about being billed twice in December.  I looked at this and member was billed twice and then changed to List Bill by the system.  I spoke to Vinnie about this and he did not  have an explanation for this.  I can refund member or apply pmt to January 20th billing.  I left VM for member.<br>Update: Member has elected to have us apply the extra pmt to the 1/20 billing (Feb).  I also let her know what her pricing will be on 3/20 when she turns 50.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-13 11:19:05', '2026-01-13 12:01:37'),
