  ('zcrm_1579374000178551189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178551194', 'Sean Chew', NULL, '1-12-26 I helped Debi via video conference and screen sharing to complete the proper C4 application to get approved for Medicaid. He was approved at $12K and information is being sent to Medicaid. Debi was very appreciative. She clicked one wrong button which sent her to CO Connect on her first two attempts. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 21:18:42', '2026-01-12 21:18:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351427', 'Abigail Hernandez', NULL, '1-12-26 Dear Abigail Hernandez<b>,</b><br>Welcome to LifeX Research Corporation. As of <b>01/01/2026</b>, you are officially enrolled in <b>LifeX Cigna EPO $1500 Deductible</b>.<br><br>To get started, activate your Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) by clicking <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://employeewellnesshub.app/login"><u>employeewellnesshub.app</u></a> and enter the email you enrolled in which is: <a target="_blank" href="http://AbbyFHernandez@gmail.com" style="">AbbyFHernandez@gmail.com</a>.<br><br>Once the email is entered, press continue and set a password. After you set a password, it will prompt you to login with your email and password you just set.<br>This portal provides access to wellness resources, important documents, your digital Medical ID Card, and more!<br>The Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) is also where you will complete the health and wellness activities in which you will be compensated for. There will be new features being added for more information regarding your plan each month that will enhance your experience.<br>As part of your LifeX employee onboarding materials, you will receive a welcome letter in the mail from Benefits Health Plan, Inc., including detailed employee benefit information and your Medical ID card after your start date with LifeX. You will also need to complete your onboarding documents through the Enrollment Hub. Please finish those documents here through our secure portal: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://enrollment-hub.com/"><u>Enrollment Hub</u></a><br>If you have questions about...<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Logging into Employee Wellness Hub please email </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:help@lifexresearch.com"><u>help@lifexresearch.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call our support team at 866-844-0562.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Assistance with filling out your onboarding documents through Enrollment Hub email </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:admin@lifexresearch.com"><u>admin@lifexresearch.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call our support team at 866-844-0562.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For questions regarding your plan, or future claims and pre-certification needs please contact Customer Support at </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:customersupport@benefithealthplan.com"><u>customersupport@benefithealthplan.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call 844-580-2474.</span></p></li></ul>All additional resources and contact information is within the Welcome Guide attached to this email.<br>In Good Health,<br><b>LifeX Research Corporation</b>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 18:52:57', '2026-01-12 18:52:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '1-12-26 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">1Dental - <a target="_blank" href="http://shoshana21@gmail.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">shoshana21@gmail.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 18:49:00', '2026-01-12 18:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351324', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, '1-12-26 Dear Kendal Reeves<b>,</b><br>Welcome to LifeX Research Corporation. As of <b>01/01/2026</b>, you are officially enrolled in <b>LifeX Cigna EPO $1500 Deductible</b>.<br><br>To get started, activate your Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) by clicking <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://employeewellnesshub.app/login"><u>employeewellnesshub.app</u></a> selecting Activate Your Account, then Activate by Demographics, and then enter your information.<br>This portal provides access to wellness resources, important documents, your digital Medical ID Card, and more!<br>The Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) is also where you will complete activities—including, but not limited to, surveys and health coaching—for which you will be compensated.<br>As part of your LifeX employee onboarding materials, you will receive a welcome letter in the mail from Benefits Health Plan, Inc., including detailed employee benefit information and your Medical ID card the day before the effective date.<br>For any questions on your Employee Wellness Hub, feel free to contact our customer support team at 866-844-0562 or email <a target="_blank" href="http://help@lifexresearch.com" style="">help@lifexresearch.com</a>. Our support hours are 8 am to 4 pm CT, Monday through Friday.<br>In Good Health,<br><b>LifeX Research Corporation</b>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 18:39:09', '2026-01-12 18:39:09'),
