  ('zcrm_1579374000178551156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '1-12-26 WiIlliam enrolled in RMHP due to his pre-x and super high cost meds. I showed her PharmacyRX and GoodRX. Not sure what drug program RMHP uses that he can tap into as well. They are all set for 2026. They will let me know when their 26 year old daughter needs to join, if her new employer doesn''t offer benefits. That''s TBD at this point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 16:58:44', '2026-01-12 16:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '1-12-26 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">William Choi</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>RMHP Colorado Doctors Plan Colorado Option Gold</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$2,050</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$9,600</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">02/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"> $0.00 </span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 2308005083</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 02/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/12/26</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 16:52:24', '2026-01-12 16:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '1-12-26 Genevieve and William have decided to put Genevieve and 3 kids under age 26 onto Premium HSA for Feb. 1st start date. Their son with the jaw issue they will pay cash $5K for the surgery on their own. It will be cheaper to pay the cash price than to put him on William''s RMHP. They chose Premium HSA EC $676/$1000 $125/$25. Genevieve is self-employed with their own business and used their EIN to enroll for Feb. 1st, 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 16:39:47', '2026-01-12 16:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '1-12-26 Kim Johnson came to me via Jake Johnson, Amy and Mark Johnson! Kim is in Manhattan Beach, CA. She''s 62 and Mark''s x-wife. She''s a 1099 contract worker and earns too much for APTC in CA with $120K and some spousal support for kids. She get skin checks, wellness visits, etc. Zip is 90266. She''s being quoted $1400 for Covered CA and was shocked. She takes lorazapam for mental health and norvad (generic) for hyerptension and amlodipan bisylate 5 mg, no supplements. She doesn''t have any pets, so pet telehealth is irrelevant. We discussed Secure HSA. She''s thrilled about this option! She has a lesion on her pancreas 8 years ago. Since then they just do screenings/surveillance and nothing has been a problem! I quoted her the abdomen MRI with and w/o contrast on Radiology Assist and it''s showing $500 at a location less than 5 miles away. She said she paid $1000 for it with her insurance last year! She''s thrilled to pay for Secure HSA $448/$1250 and $125/$25. She will read up on everything first and call me in the next few days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 15:48:30', '2026-01-14 16:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071246', 'Ann Inai', NULL, '1-12-26 Ann called bc she''s at her Ob/Gyn now for her wellness screening. They want the card and she couldn''t find it. I was able to help her login into the Health Wallet in the MPB.Health app and she was finally able to see it. Her provider is now telling her they aren''t in-network even though it sounds like the dr. showed up on the list according to the above notes. She''ll give them the card and they will proceed with the billing information. She was happy and will call me with any more problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 15:40:56', '2026-01-12 15:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174954035', 'Adrian Montemayor', NULL, '1-12-26 Adrian called to get help with going to the doctor. I guided him to present as self-pay. I also sent him the link to reschedule his Welcome Call since the earliest time was in Feb. but he wants to use his membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 15:28:29', '2026-01-12 15:28:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178551108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131799002', 'Natasha Farrell', NULL, '1-12-26 I left a vm returning Lewis Farrell''s call for Natasha. She needs her member ID for Utah State. I let him know we may need to upgrade her membeship to have a member ID and hopefully appease the school. Hopefully he will call me back and we can discuss the options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-12 14:55:43', '2026-01-12 14:55:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178497591', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129829002', 'James Benvenuto', NULL, '1/12/25<br>James children are still having issues logging into the telehealth portion. I let it know AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:53:31', '2026-01-12 14:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178497586', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155312001', 'Melissa Farrar', NULL, '1/12/25<br>Peter called because he has several un paid bills from a procedure he had, his wife mistakenly advised him to present the mpb at the orthopedics office instead of cash pay and the bill went up by a lot. I advised him to speak with the office and request they processor the claims as self pay because the mec is only for preventative and to upload all bills he has to sedera for a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:51:47', '2026-01-12 14:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178499161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177096017', 'Tony Thorn', NULL, 'Whne enrolling this member chose the "List Bill" option when he was an individual.  The Payment in A123 was voided and since we never received any pmt info this was missed.  I emailed the member explaining what the issue was and advised him that if we did not receive any personal payment information prior to the 20th, his enrollment would be cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-12 14:25:13', '2026-01-12 14:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178554089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176505028', 'richard battaglia', '1/12/2026', 'RX request for spouse Cheryl Land x3 . RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:08:21', '2026-01-12 14:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178534127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176175001', 'Matthew Evans', NULL, '1/12/26<br>Sent the welcome call link in the email that matt requested.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:05:44', '2026-01-12 14:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178534122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '1/12/26<br>michelle reached out to see if a provider was in network which i was able to verify that yes, they are in network.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:05:03', '2026-01-12 14:05:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178534117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135312001', 'Jennifer Lloyd', NULL, '1/12/26<br>jennifer called in to find their ID cards for her and jeffrey. I had to get them to reactivate their accounts then get them logged in to find the ID cards for them . <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 14:04:16', '2026-01-12 14:04:16'),
