  ('zcrm_1579374000178534092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176913001', 'Paul Lindemulder', NULL, '1/12/26<br>Paul and his wife called to get help logging in to the zion portal.I walked them through it and gave them zions number if they have to get the link sent to them to open the portal for the first time<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 13:59:27', '2026-01-12 13:59:27'),
