  ('zcrm_1579374000178534059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687018', 'Douglas Weaver', NULL, '1/12/26<br>michelle reached out through email about signing up for her own membership. I sent her the link and the info she would need to do so<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 13:50:31', '2026-01-12 13:50:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178534038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173223017', 'Susie Runkle', NULL, '1/12/26<br>Susie reached out after daughter injured knee looking for some guidance on how to use membership for this. I informed her if they just need a scan then they could use the telehealth to get that ordered and save the money on the office visit. Also let her know she can get dr notes from there for her daughters school if she needs it, After giving guidance let her know to reach out for any help throughout this process.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 13:49:06', '2026-01-12 13:49:06'),
