  ('zcrm_1579374000178534006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175980001', 'Steven Ahn', NULL, '1/12/26<br>Spoke with ruth after she had trouble reaching us. She is happy now that i got a chance to explain how her membership works and where she can acces most things from. Got her logged into app and gave her member id numbers for her and steven so they can both login. also sent the welcome call link so she can go ahead and get one of those done to help her as well<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-12 12:10:03', '2026-01-12 12:10:03'),
