  ('zcrm_1579374000178420047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071375', 'Heidi Godsil', NULL, '1-5-26 Heidi called for help willing out the healthcare waiver with CU. She''s using the information from her MEC card and will upload a copy of the card to show proof of membership. She''ll keep me posted.  She was very nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-09 14:07:23', '2026-01-09 14:07:23'),
