  ('zcrm_1579374000178420042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080865054', 'Donna Johnston', NULL, '1-9-25 I left Donna a vm from reminder to reach out to her in early Jan. Came to me again via Christie and Mike Dee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-09 13:15:35', '2026-01-09 13:15:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178420013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178551194', 'Sean Chew', NULL, '1-9-26 Debi accidentally went to Colorado Connect and it shows open enrollment is closed. I let her know she needs to try through C4HCO to be in the right place. She''ll use my link and start over. <br><span><br></span>The Colorado Connect shows this - <br><p style="background-color:rgb(230, 243, 216);"><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);background-color:rgb(230, 243, 216);"><b>Sean Michael Chew</b></span></p><span style="color:rgb(66, 75, 90);">SilverEnhanced Savings</span><br><p style="background-color:rgb(238, 238, 238);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(238, 238, 238);"><b>SilverEnhanced Savings is currently closed.</b></span></p><span style="color:rgb(66, 75, 90);">Health insurance plans through Colorado Connect</span><br><span style="color:rgb(66, 75, 90);"><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-09 13:10:27', '2026-01-09 13:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178430074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109518002', 'Elisa Kammeyer', NULL, '1/9/26<br>Elisa called in to find out how to start a share request so i walked her through getting into app and portal so she could begin a share request and upload her documents.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-09 13:09:27', '2026-01-09 13:09:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178452001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724044', 'Brian Cox', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that her and her husband wanted to change their IUA after thinking about it the $5000 was alot of money for them.  I gave them the pricing for the other options and they will be going with the $2500.  I will send out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-09 13:09:11', '2026-01-09 13:09:11'),
