  ('zcrm_1579374000178430046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, '1/9/26<br>helped susan because her ARM account had two separate accounts and one was terminated so when her dr called someone at ARM told the DR she did not have an account. Me and lori spoke and lori is going to fix it and call the dr to make sure they can submit the bill. Texted to update susan about it so she is aware and knows it is being taken care of., <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-09 12:17:50', '2026-01-09 12:17:50'),
