  ('zcrm_1579374000178422062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172735002', 'Gerardo Negrete', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know who his Medical Cost Sharing vendor was.  Secondly he did not know what membership he should change to.  He told me that Christine told him that the price would go up every year however didn''t give him the timeframe of that.  So the 1/1/26 price increase  was a surprise to him.  <br>He told me that he wants to go to the cheapest membership, Christine didn''t give him any information on what to change to just sent to form link.  I told him to be back in touch with Christine to get the specific membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-09 11:12:47', '2026-01-09 11:12:47'),
