  ('zcrm_1579374000178353053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083771001', 'Robert Godfrey', NULL, '1/7/26<br>Robert called in to see what to do after a car accident and for some pediatrician visits they recently paid for. The accident i walked him through the share request process and what to do about that and then as far as his pediatrician goes i explained the preventative care benefit since these were well child visits. Let him know what to do with bills and how to describe what type of coverage this is for the provider. also explained about the PHCS network.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-08 06:52:41', '2026-01-08 06:52:57'),
