  ('zcrm_1579374000178353035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164262002', 'Justin Carr', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Member called after being admitted into the ER wanting to know what to do next. Let him know to present as a cash pay patient and get the itemized bill. Then let him know how to start a share request and that he can reach back out to us for assistance with that once he gets the bill.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-08 06:48:33', '2026-01-08 06:48:33'),
