  ('zcrm_1579374000178302006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, '1-7-26 Talked with Rachel twice and she will stick with Premium Care $500 since she also has Cloud Medical to handle the rest of the smaller wellness items. She will also call the MPB Concierge Team to discuss best path for colposcopy, how to access discounts on the supplements and to download the new MPB.Health app to get up to speed.  I also let her know a Dexascan do bone denisty will be at her cost since she mentioned the cost was $120 and then also said $300. Not sure which one is correct. Either way it''s below the $500. They are concerned about her having osteopenia now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-07 11:40:18', '2026-01-07 11:43:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178283124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '1/7/25<br>Patient advised that dermatology check-up must be presented as <b>self-pay</b>. Informed patient of <b>IUA requirement of $1,250</b>, which must be met before the plan can share in any costs. Clarified that the IUA is <b>not a deductible</b> and applies <b>per medical incident</b>. Advised that if charges do not meet the $1,250 IUA, the visit will be considered an <b>out-of-pocket expense</b>.AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-07 11:30:05', '2026-01-07 11:30:05'),
