  ('zcrm_1579374000178277119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '01.07.25 - Received an email from Lou that Elysa was deneid a sharing request for her perimenopause. Left a VM to discuss. JA<br><span><br></span>Spoke to Ilysa, let her know that perimenopause is not shared by Zion. Reached out to Rachelle to provide feedback on the Zion rep who spent an hour on the phone with Ilysa helping her submit the sharing request. Sent an email to Lyric to address Ilysas concern of the doctor not ordering the necessary blood test since she is not able to obtain them through a 3rd party vendor in NJ. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-07 08:59:37', '2026-01-07 13:21:46'),
