  ('zcrm_1579374000178278029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990092', 'Andrea Perrault', NULL, '01/07/2026 - Spoke to Andrea. Needed confirmation where to send itemized bill. Also that her plan is active. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-07 07:27:17', '2026-01-07 07:29:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178277060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156588002', 'Mary Key Gerlach', 'Spouse Turning 65 Aging into Medicare Eff 03/01/26', '01/07/26- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>01/08/26- Member Mary Key called in regarding the notice.  She stated that she believes her spouse is Aging into Medicare effective April 1, not March 1 as per my letter. She said something to do with the HSA? I directed her to confirm this information with Medicare and to call back when she knows the correct information.  If he does not go into Medicare until April 1, she was requesting if we can extend his Membership until then.  I confirmed with Patti that the Spouse can be extended for one month only.  She will confirm the details and get back to us.<br>2/4/26- Mary Key called to confirm receipt of the Change Form to remove Spouse Aging into Medicare eff 3/1/26 and that it will leave her as Member Only.  I told her we did receive the form and will send her an email verification when it has been processed.<br>2/4-Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse due to going into Medicare.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-07 07:24:36', '2026-02-04 09:08:25'),
