  ('zcrm_1579374000178278010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156171016', 'Tamara Lowe', NULL, '01/07/2026 - Sent e-mail to member asking for name and location of the imaging center in order to determine if it''s in-network. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-07 06:40:40', '2026-01-07 06:40:40'),
