  ('zcrm_1579374000178278003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '01/07/26  Sent request to member to re-send Rx quotes request.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-07 06:15:06', '2026-01-07 06:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178277001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178231018', 'Lucas Eising', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-07 06:12:44', '2026-01-07 06:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176791', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178561001', 'Genevieve Choi', NULL, '1-5-25 Selected me as their broker and will call me soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 20:25:10', '2026-01-06 20:25:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176776', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001538301', 'Brenda Smith', NULL, '1-6-26 Dear Wendy Scipione,<br> <br>The following notice is being sent to your client:<br> <br>Hello BRENDA ARIEL SMITH,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your health insurance insurance with Cigna Healthcare because we did not receive your premium payment. As a result, your coverage will end on <b>October 31, 2025.</b> Please keep this notice as proof your coverage is no longer active.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and hope that, in the future, you may consider us again, for your health insurance needs.<br> <br><b>Termination due to non-payment may result with the following penalties:</b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">You may not be eligible to participate in special enrollment periods to re-enroll your coverage.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">You must repay tax credits you received after your coverage termination date.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">You will be responsible for paying for any treatment or services you get on or after the termination date.</span></p></li></ul> <br>It''s important to understand that you have a right to request a review of this decision. If you feel that this decision has been made in error, you can request a review in writing within <b>30 calendar days</b> of the date of this notice.<br> <br><b>We’re here to help if you have any questions.</b><br>Please talk with your insurance agent or call us directly at <b>1.877.900.1237</b>, Monday – Friday 8:00 a.m. to 8:00 p.m. EST. If you need help reading this notice due to language or disability, help will be provided to you at no cost. For TRS or TTY services, dial <b>711</b>. You can also have documents read to you and some may be sent to you in your language.<br> <br>Sincerely,<br> <br>Cigna Healthcare, Individual and Family Plans', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 20:21:12', '2026-01-06 20:21:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176771', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157910087', 'Lena Wenzel', NULL, '1-6-26 Dear Wendy Scipione,<br> <br>The following notice is being sent to your client:<br> <br>Hello LENA WENZEL,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your medical insurance with Cigna Healthcare. Your policy is no longer in effect as of <b>December 31, 2025</b> due to your request.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.<br> <br>If you''d like to apply again for new coverage, please must contact <b>Connect for Health Colorado®, Colorado''s state-based health insurance marketplace</b>. You can call them directly at <b>1.855.752.6749</b> or visit <span><a href="http://connectforhealthco.com" style="" target="_blank"><b>connectforhealthco.com</b></a></span>.<br> <br> <br>If you need help reading this notice due to language or disability, help will be provided to you at no cost. For TRS or TTY services, dial 711. You can also have documents read to you and some may be sent to you in your language.<br> <br>Sincerely,<br> <br>Cigna Healthcare, Individual and Family Plans<br><b>myCigna® is YOUR Cigna</b>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 20:19:27', '2026-01-06 20:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176739', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '1-6-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Brian Coffey</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Colorado Option Gold Pathway Essentials Std</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$2,050</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$9,600</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">02/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$254.44 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after $461.27 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 3222407850</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 02/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/06/26</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 15:18:27', '2026-01-06 15:18:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176734', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '1-6-26 Brian and I completed his enrollment. I did it on my end bc he wasn''t able to login to his account yet. He received the confirmation email and it includes the phone # to Anthem to set up his auto pay. He will wait until next week to call and he''ll also decide on the best dental plan. Delta Dental costs about $2500 for an implant and 1x per year. 1Dental might be better and shows in network. He''ll have to inquire about the discounts on that front. His older little dog is not doing well and may go to the other side soon. He''s dealing with it well now. He''s also sick but on the mend. He was thinking of going to Mexico to get his dental work done but not sure it''s a good idea now with the world events going on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 15:17:55', '2026-01-06 15:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178252245', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Cynthia called about a cologaurd usage to see what to do about the bill. Gave her the number to call aRM and let her know how those bills are handled<br><span><br></span>AJ.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 14:31:27', '2026-01-06 14:31:27'),
