  ('zcrm_1579374000178252192', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176260028', 'Christine Oentung', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Christine reached out because welcome call link is not working. I let her know they are working on it and i will email her the link when it is back up and running. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 11:26:20', '2026-01-06 11:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176688', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178551194', 'Sean Chew', NULL, '1-6-26 Debi Chew, Sean''s mom thinks Sean will remain under $20K since he''s doing contract work in animation right now and made $15K last year. He''ll likely only earn more if he gets a full time job with benefits. So, she''ll help him apply right away. They''re all set for now. I sent her the instructions for C4 and select me as his agent in case he needs my help in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 11:20:47', '2026-01-06 11:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178176683', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178551194', 'Sean Chew', NULL, '1-6-26 Hi Wendy,<br><br>I got your information from my sister, one of your clients Sheri McCrone.  My son lives in Colorado Springs and is in need of health insurance and I am sure he will need financial assistance.  His name is Sean Michael Chew. DOB 4/05/1995. 10882 Aliso Drive, Colorado Springs, 80925.  Right now he is doing free lance work and estimates he made about $15,000 this year and possibly will make more in 2026 but not much more.  We plugged this information into the website for affordable health care and the lowest was about $350 per month. My sister said that you were very helpful in getting her some financial assistance and I hope you can do the same for my son.  Any advice you could give would be appreciated. I did leave you a voicemail this morning. Feel free to call me if you need anymore information.  Thank you.<br><br>Best,<br><br>Debi Chew<br>805-550-0153', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-06 11:18:54', '2026-01-06 11:18:54'),
