  ('zcrm_1579374000178252173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175689002', 'John Kaminski', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Both members called in since they are new and needed guidance. I answered most of the questions they had and they will still do a welcome call for a refresher. I guided them to the app and their cards for Preventative care and the RX valet benefits. Need to look into a coupon she said was sent to her to get it re sent to her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 11:11:59', '2026-01-06 11:11:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178247162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176597050', 'Ting Xiao', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 11:09:44', '2026-01-06 11:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178252168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176543037', 'Hunter Christensen', NULL, 'Member called to see what to do for kids well child visits, she did not know about PHCS network. We needed to call ARM because there was inconsistent data on the search site so i wanted to see if they worked with the provider or not. Member said they would call back later when ARM was open so we could speak to them. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 10:50:03', '2026-01-06 10:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178252163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175692001', 'Brandon May', NULL, '11/6/26<br>Member reached out because the welcome call link was not working. I let him know they are currently working on it and he will be able to use it shortly. Will also send an email with the link in there with instructions when i am notified it is fixed<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 10:48:00', '2026-01-06 10:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178252158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171268002', 'Dylan Anglin', NULL, '1/6/26<br>spoke to Dylan he was looking for proof of membership for his school. I sent him an email with the proof of membership letter. He said that was all he needed and thank you<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 10:46:43', '2026-01-06 10:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178252153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Shanes spouse called in to ask more about the membership and what it offers. She asked about the difference between us and directly going to Zion. she has a friend interested and i let her know to reach out to Wendy first and see if she can help them get the friend signed up with us if she is interested. I also explained what the membership offers and how to access a few things including all virtual benefits. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 10:44:02', '2026-01-06 10:44:02'),
