  ('zcrm_1579374000178252143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171287002', 'Keith Frana', NULL, '1/6/26<br>Finally got a hold of Keith. He just needed a retrain in what to say when checking if providers use PHCS. Gave him the rundown on what to say. Also gave him some guidance on how to use the membership<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 08:57:55', '2026-01-06 08:57:55'),
