  ('zcrm_1579374000178252074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110168002', 'Bernard Huerre', NULL, '1/5/26<br>Agnes reached out to find out what would be covered for a sonogram. Let her know i need to find out more about that and i will reach back out to call her and update her. Arm says usually sonograms are not covered but the codes would be what it depended on the physician coding it as. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-06 08:04:40', '2026-01-06 08:04:40'),
