  ('zcrm_1579374000178223053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, '1-5-26 I submitted a request to Planstin to cancel David Grigsby''s membership for Feb. 1st bc he''s joining Lisa''s as ES. He wanted to have different IUA''s but I told him that''s not possible. With Zion<span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"> here is the household number, </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">133110191659.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"> The associated emails address is </span><a style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:dvdgrigsby@yahoo.com"><u>dvdgrigsby@yahoo.com</u></a>. I''ll wait for the confirmation from Planstin/Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 22:18:36', '2026-01-05 22:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '1-5-26 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><br>Thanks. I have submitted the reimbursable amounts. They''ve all been approved. I used my wellness, labs, and physical fitness amounts. I wish I had managed a dermatology visit as well. I also changed our IUA amount. <br><br>One interesting and quite confusing part - 2 years ago I did a wellness visit + blood tests. The total cost for each of us, out of pocket was $600. This time I found a different provider for the wellness visit (the last one had their billing taken over by Optum and spent a year trying to get double the money because they had me as insured, and then later an extra $30, which they only relented after a letter from me explaining I paid all up front). The lab apparently was the same that the blood test was sent to. This year, my total bill, including the blood test was under $210. Labcorp was the lab for both. When I tried to do labcorp blood test alone was $80, but instead of using a telemedicine referral, I waited for my wellness visit and they just did the blood test which added about $40 to the total bill. $40-80-300+ is quite a range for a test of similar (same) parameters from the same lab. <br><br>Best,<br><br>Tyler', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 22:05:55', '2026-01-05 22:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '1-5-26 Brian answered but went out of cell service since he''s driving. Brian wanted to review his options for wellness. I sent him the overview of Premium Care and Premium HSA and explained the options and price difference. He''ll review and decide by the 15th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 16:39:02', '2026-01-05 22:05:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716932', 'LouLou Piscatore', NULL, '1-5-26 LouLou called bc her drug card isn''t working. I gave her the Concierge Team # and also told her to inquire about the drug when she calls to get it priced out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 16:35:46', '2026-01-05 16:35:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '1-5-26 Kallie got a denial from Zion stating they aren''t active members. I responded to their Determinations Team and cc''ed Patti to let them know they are currently 100% active and paid since Aug. 1st, 2020. Zion will have to make sure their records are accurate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 16:32:53', '2026-01-05 16:32:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '1-5-26 I also left a vm for Deb outlining what''s written above. I want to make sure she feels better since she was so frustrated and has a lot on her plate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 16:21:17', '2026-01-05 16:21:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '1-5-26 Deb called bc she can finally login and see her plan with UHC/RMHP. However, Joshua isn''t showing up in the system at all. She also should have a $6 credit and only owes $2.69. So, her account "should" be in full already. That shouldn''t be the problem. She''s super duper frustrated with dealing with all entities and has been sent in circles. I''m now talking with Jesse with C4 and he can see C4 sent the information to UHC/RMHP and they sent something back on 12/25/25. So, he has put me on hold while he digs a little deeper to see what''s up. He''s also going to verify the correct plan is being accounted for on all ends.<br>Jesse said he is escalating this for us. He''s sending it to the back office to make sure the carrier has all of the information they need. If not, they''ll resend the file. It could take 2-3 weeks since it''s still open enrollment. If Joshua needs any service he said to keep the records. This is on the carrier to fix and he will have coverage starting Jan. 1st, 2026. The Ref # is 566687Z6K4J6', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 16:00:42', '2026-01-05 16:14:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178223009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '1-5-26 Kallie called to understand what caps exist with a Need. Don had a major health incident before the new year and Kallie panicked bc she read the $125K cap (for pre-x) but thought that was for everything. I let her know as long as he doesn''t have any pre-x on his record that there''s no cap. They''ve also been members since 2020, so no cap is relevant. She was very clear that he definitely didn''t have any pre-x and this came out of nowhere. She was very relieved and has already started the Need to get the process going. Since it happened in 2025 her $1000 IUA should be in effect.  She''s all set for now as they work through it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-05 15:45:28', '2026-01-05 15:45:28'),
