  ('zcrm_1579374000178160082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176764001', 'Lathan Lewis', NULL, 'I received the following email from this member to re-instate her dependents back on the membership.  This should be ok as the change probbaly hasn''t been made yet by Planstin.<br><span><br></span>Hi Patti. Sorry to be a huge pain but i was able to get waivers for both of my kids from their respective schools and therefore cancel their insurance. Would you be able to reinstate them both on my plan starting February? Or should I go through the portal to add then back? <br><br>Lathan', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-05 11:50:00', '2026-01-05 11:50:00'),
