  ('zcrm_1579374000178160038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, 'Member called me from the ER and wanted to know how to present, told me he gave them the PHCS card.  I advised that he is to present as cash pay and if the bill was under his IUA of $5000 he would need to pay it.  If not just pay the $5000 and get a receipt and open a need w/Zion.  Member interested in lowering his IUA.  I will send him out Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-05 09:47:40', '2026-01-05 09:47:40'),
