  ('zcrm_1579374000178160026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation stating that she had other coverage and we were refusing to refund her the 1/26 Share Amount.  As noted below member''s spouse called in on 1/2 wanting to cancel.  They held off on canceling us until  they were charge for other coverage.  Per Karina I will refund the January Share Amount due to member dissatisfaction.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-05 08:12:57', '2026-01-05 08:12:57'),
