  ('zcrm_1579374000178159021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174584002', 'Eric Hansen', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process. The Bank info Member submitted is the same active bank account on file.  After reviewing, the December 20 2025 billing never made it to FTNI, and therefore was never billed.  I reran the payment today, and it declined with the same bank error', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-05 07:25:58', '2026-01-05 07:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178159013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form using an HSA. UPDATE: Member called in and advised me that this was their savings account not an HSA.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-05 07:22:04', '2026-01-07 08:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178166001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067985045', 'Robin Mickle', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4802 Question : Good morning. I had been working with a physician on Cirrus MD last year. I had a follow up this month and went to login and it says we no longer have access. Is there another option for telehealth?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-05 07:20:12', '2026-01-05 07:20:12'),
