  ('zcrm_1579374000178117187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to make sure his Dec 20th payment went through.  I reviewed his account and the card that was charged.  He was ok with that and may want to change back to ACH to avoid the 3% processing fee. Reviewed that billing is on the 20th of each month.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-02 13:26:56', '2026-01-02 13:27:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178122267', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', 'New Membership eff 2/1/26', 'Member &amp; Sp $1250 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 13:26:01', '2026-01-02 13:26:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178122262', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add MEC to the membership eff 2/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 13:24:37', '2026-01-02 13:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178131020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151146001', 'Sarah Alderson', NULL, '01/02/26 - Member called to cancel plan as of 01/01/26. Explained cancellations must be submitted no later than the 20th of the month. She will submit to cancel as of 02/01/26.  SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 13:23:05', '2026-01-02 13:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178131015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '01/02/2026 - Sent coupons to member for 2 rx. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 13:18:10', '2026-01-02 13:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178133006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '1-2-26 Quentin decided to add the MEC since he and Cathy may need colonoscopies this year. I checked the place where they plan to go for this <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://cdhorlando.com/insurances/"><u>https://cdhorlando.com/insurances/</u></a> and it shows the Multiplan network is accepted. He understands HAB is ending and what he''s losing. He''s till going to Dr. Patel as well but not paying as a DPC member anymore. He knows he has until March 1st to submit for reimbursement with HAB. He completed the Member Update form and got to the confirmation page. He will change from Care+ to Secure HSA $1250/$774 for Feb. 2026. He''s all set for him and Cathy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-02 13:16:18', '2026-01-02 13:21:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175790001', 'Sonya Fontaine', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Called back sonya she no longer needed our assistance AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 13:13:12', '2026-01-02 13:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178122257', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update her address, however this was previously submitted &amp; processed on 9/23/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 13:12:00', '2026-01-02 13:12:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155196008', 'Joseph Vandenburg', NULL, '1/2/26<br>Joseph could not log into the zion portal I advised him to speak direclty with zion for further assitance AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 13:11:21', '2026-01-02 13:11:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178122231', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 13:00:22', '2026-01-02 13:00:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178117179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604272', 'Hal Feldman', NULL, 'Member has called in wanting to use his bank account to pay for Igor Khayrulin''s Membership (from a blended family) who has his own membership.  Member submitted a payment form for his Membership today, which was previously done on 12/23/25.  I told him to submit another Payment Update Form with the family member''s name as the Primary Member and then put his bank account as the payment method.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-02 12:59:50', '2026-01-02 12:59:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178133001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678123', 'Kevin Falardo', NULL, '1-2-26 Kelli and Kevin are both self-employed. They just had their baby Koa in May or so of 2025. Kelli is 48 and a completely successful pregnancy. They are considering another baby and prefer not to have a waiting period. So, Premium HSA is the best fit. They are also wanting to offer this to their employee who is 30 and goes between CO and WY. She goes to WY to help her aging parents but works mostly in CO every week. They all do their annual wellness screenings. Dr. Wigglesworth shows up in the network with Centennial Pediatrics. Dr. Rangley showed up in the network as well. They were paying $1000 2 years ago before Kevin lost his job. Now the cost is $1658.88 for 2026 since they won''t get a subsidy and that''s just too much for them. They are all healthy, no pre-x other than Kelli had thyroid issues while she was pregnant with Koa. She''s all set now. They do their wellness screenings. Kelli had an HSA years ago. They use some supplements. They primarily only used Urgent Care this past year for Koa. No tobacco, no meds, etc. Yes, they''s used a little mental healthy. Premium HSA $988/$1000 is what they are considering. Kelli had chosen to pay $400 of their employee, Megan''s plan in 2025 which was about $449. So, Premium HSA would be $363/$1000 and they would happily pay the entire amount. She will discuss this with Kevin over the weekend. They will watch the video. She wants to move quickly in case Kevin wants to explore other paths. She also wants dental and vision. They spent $15K for Kevin''s wisdom teeth since they started growing in the wrong way. Something went awry and they had to do an expensive surgery after the dentist told them he likely didn''t need to do anything unless he experienced pain. So, between their baby and dental surgery they spent a lot of money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-02 12:55:25', '2026-01-02 12:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177067069', 'Tyler VanGemert', NULL, '01/02/2026 - Called member to help schedule appointment for x-ray related to low back and side pain. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 12:55:21', '2026-01-02 12:55:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155196008', 'Joseph Vandenburg', NULL, '01/02/2026 - Transferred member to Acelyn to be resolved. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 12:47:30', '2026-01-02 12:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178072058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221020', 'Addison Lindsey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4800 Question : I’m referring to my previous chat. Will you change the profile name to mine or will I need to create an entirely new account?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 12:44:06', '2026-01-02 12:44:06'),
