  ('zcrm_1579374000178122211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, 'Members spouse called in wanted to cancel the membership because they had other coverage eff 1/1/26.  They did not cancel us and now have 2 coverages.  I explained that our cancellation deadline was the last day of the month.  I will send him ou the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 12:31:08', '2026-01-02 12:31:08'),
