  ('zcrm_1579374000178041075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088337002', 'Teresa Mullaney', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4799 Question : Hello, I’m wondering about pricing for adding my partner to my plan.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 11:15:00', '2026-01-02 11:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178123026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', '1/2/2026', 'logged into app, helped with sending digital id card to their pediatrician for child wellness visit. asked for physical cards, will have them mailed, card requested. boom - Tupac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 10:59:26', '2026-01-02 11:00:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178093075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221020', 'Addison Lindsey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4798 Question : Hi, please see my previous chat. Addison is still listed under my email login and I can not book telehealth.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 10:45:15', '2026-01-02 10:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178123021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165231037', 'Jay Tibball', '1/2/2026', 'She had questions about how sharing works and plan id cards etc, explained in detail. - Tupac and Susan.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 10:43:12', '2026-01-02 10:43:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177689002', 'Vicki L Kensinger', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Informed member that <b>preventive services under Zion HealthShare</b> are available <b>after a six (6) month waiting period</b> from membership start.<br>Explained that preventive services are <b>not subject to the IUA</b> and become eligible for sharing once the waiting period is complete.<br>Advised member to use the <b>Member Advocate team</b> to locate low-cost facilities for preventive services.<br>Confirmed that member understands the waiting period requirement.<br> AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 10:35:48', '2026-01-02 10:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178118008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113526002', 'Laurie Linn', '1/2', 'helped her setup telehealth call', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-01-02 10:31:33', '2026-01-02 10:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178096035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221020', 'Addison Lindsey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4797 Question : I had to take a minute and got cut off from my previous chat. Can you see my previous conversation with Ace?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 10:29:18', '2026-01-02 10:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178122151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130290016', 'Rachel Lehmann', NULL, 'Members father called in and let me know that his daughter had moved back to the state of WA so she is not longer able to be able to be on the Sedera membership.  I advised that I could cancel eff 2/1/26.  I will send out link to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://fpdoctordad@comcast.net/"><u>fpdoctordad@comcast.net</u></a>', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-02 10:27:16', '2026-01-02 10:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178015053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177689002', 'Vicki L Kensinger', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4795 Question : My coverage does not begin until Feb 1. I have an annual well visit scheduled with my Doctor next week. If I reschedule that appointment for sometime after Feb1, would it be covered by my plan?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 10:24:46', '2026-01-02 10:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178015040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221020', 'Addison Lindsey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4794 Question : I am attempting to make a telehealth appointment for the first time and I am listed as a dependent. This is not correct. My family signed up for full coverage of all 3 members and I am not a dependent.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 10:17:00', '2026-01-02 10:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166942005', 'Daniel Shawhan', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Conducted research and identified <b>HUMANITI Hospital de Especialidades Médicas</b> as a facility offering specialty medical care, located at C. 33 S/N entre 56 y 56 A, Frente a Tele Yucatán, Col. Centro, Consultorio No. 217. Appointment hours are Monday through Friday from 10:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. and 4:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m., with Saturday visits available by appointment only. The main contact number is 999-243-8168, and the emergency number is 999-997-4739. Advised that provider research support is generally limited to U.S.-based providers due to the availability of websites, online booking systems, and patient reviews; researching providers in Mexico can be more challenging due to differences in healthcare systems and limited online reviews. Based on experience, many providers in Mexico accept walk-in patients. Noted that this appointment would be<a style="" target="_blank"> self-pay.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 10:15:08', '2026-01-02 10:15:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178117148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178030005', 'Matthew Gilpin', 'Member & Family $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'Member accidentally enrolled in two memberships: The $500 IUA and the $1000 IUA, which is the one they want to keep.  Member submitted a cancellation form for the $500 IUA Membership, which a refund will be processed once the payment has funded.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-01-02 10:14:36', '2026-01-02 10:29:13');
