  ('zcrm_1579374000178089036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176443017', 'Caroline Kinderthain', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4789 Question : Hello, can you help me connect my telehealth?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 07:39:38', '2026-01-02 07:39:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178120035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, '12/31/25<br>responded to a couple of robs emails asking what to do with his receipts and how to submit them. I explained that for his colo receipt he needs to try and get the provider to send directly to ARM and i gave him their iformation and let him know where to find the card. Also, he asked about an ER visit so i walked him through opening up a share request for that. Let him know how to get to his portal and what to do with the documentation he has. let him know what documents to get as well. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:38:01', '2026-01-02 07:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178120030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117190002', 'Bruce Jones', NULL, '12/31/25<br>Kira called in to find out what to do with some receipts she had. I walked her through what to do with which kind of receipt. Let her know the difference in preventative and diagnostic and how the IUA works as opposed to when she can use the ARM card. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:35:47', '2026-01-02 07:35:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178120025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175002', 'Laura Williamson', NULL, '12/31/25<br>Me and susan worked with laura/Suzy (she goes by suzy normally) to help her get logged in. She was having difficulty and after troubleshooting with her we realized she needed to delete the app and re download it due to the new version update that was done. After she did that she was finally able to log in and get to her telehealth like she was trying to do, Everything seemed to be working once we were finished and we let her know to call if she has any other problems. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:32:06', '2026-01-02 07:32:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167582017', 'Zoe Patana-O''Keefe', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Member inquired about canceling membership. Advised member per Zion policy that once a membership is withdrawn, any open sharing requests and all future sharing requests will no longer be eligible for sharing unless the membership is reinstated within thirty (30) days. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:32:05', '2026-01-02 07:32:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178119003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175750010', 'Dianne Brown', NULL, '01/01/2026 - Sent member 5 quotes for his Rx. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:29:56', '2026-01-02 07:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178120006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159349001', 'Chantelle Turner', NULL, '12/31/25<br>Chantelle called in to see how to begin a share request so i walked her through the steps and let her know to reach out if she has any issues throughout the process. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:29:01', '2026-01-02 07:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178120001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961038', 'Steven Barrows', NULL, '12/31/25<br>Steve called in to ask about what happens when he gets to medicare age and some other general health share questions on how things work. I explained he would have to go to medicare after 65 due to government regulations. He also reached out on sales IQ to ask a similar question so i was able to answer him through our phone call because he thought there was some loohole or work around to keep Zion after 65. I advised him that we are told 65 is the cut off and that again is because of the governments rules not ours. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:28:12', '2026-01-02 07:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176443017', 'Caroline Kinderthain', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Sent email to follow up on missed sales iq chat AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:22:10', '2026-01-02 07:22:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178068051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155284108', 'Michael Wellmon', NULL, '1/2/25<br>Micheal reached via sales iq to cancel his plan AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-02 07:18:28', '2026-01-02 07:18:28'),
