  ('zcrm_1579374000178072050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654206', 'Elizabeth Burlingame', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4785 Question : Morning! Annabelle Schultz, our daughter, has her 7 yr physical this am. She will be getting her flu and Covid shots. She will be see at the Pediatric Center, where she has been seen since birth. What number shall we call at the end of the appt to have MPB give a CC to pay for the appt? Thank you!', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-01-02 06:30:26', '2026-01-02 06:30:26'),
