  ('zcrm_1579374000178084054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165338131', 'Hannah Blatter', NULL, '12-31-25 Dear Wendy Scipione,<br> <br>The following notice is being sent to your client:<br> <br>Hello HANNAH MARIE BLATTER,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your medical insurance with Cigna Healthcare. Your policy is no longer in effect as of <b>December 31, 2025</b> due to your request.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.<br> <br>If you''d like to apply again for new coverage, please must contact <b>Connect for Health Colorado®, Colorado''s state-based health insurance marketplace</b>. You can call them directly at <b>1.855.752.6749</b> or visit <span><a href="http://connectforhealthco.com" style="" target="_blank"><b>connectforhealthco.com</b></a></span>.<br> <br> <br>If you need help reading this notice due to language or disability, help will be provided to you at no cost. For TRS or TTY services, dial 711. You can also have documents read to you and some may be sent to you in your language.<br> <br>Sincerely,<br> <br>Cigna Healthcare, Individual and Family Plans<br><b>myCigna® is YOUR Cigna</b><br>Register for an account on the myCigna website.<br>You can search for participating providers, look at your claims and benefits information, request an ID card, and so much more!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-31 15:28:47', '2025-12-31 15:28:47'),
