  ('zcrm_1579374000178084011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '12-31-25 Dear Clara Pickell<b>,</b><br>Welcome to LifeX Research Corporation. As of <b>01/01/2026</b>, you are officially enrolled in <b>LifeX Cigna EPO $500 Deductible</b>.<br><br>To get started, activate your Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) by clicking <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://employeewellnesshub.app/login"><u>employeewellnesshub.app</u></a> and enter the email you enrolled in which is: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://ClaraPickell@live.com/"><u>ClaraPickell@lIve.com</u></a>.<br><br>Once the email is entered, press continue and set a password. After you set a password, it will prompt you to login with your email and password you just set.<br>This portal provides access to wellness resources, important documents, your digital Medical ID Card, and more!<br>The Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) is also where you will complete the health and wellness activities in which you will be compensated for. There will be new features being added for more information regarding your plan each month that will enhance your experience.<br>As part of your LifeX employee onboarding materials, you will receive a welcome letter in the mail from Benefits Health Plan, Inc., including detailed employee benefit information and your Medical ID card the day before the effective date. You will also need to complete your onboarding documents through the Enrollment Hub. Please finish those documents here through our secure portal: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://enrollment-hub.com/"><u>Enrollment Hub</u></a><br>If you have questions about...<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Logging into Employee Wellness Hub please email </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:help@lifexresearch.com"><u>help@lifexresearch.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call our support team at 866-844-0562.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Assistance with filling out your onboarding documents through Enrollment Hub email </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:admin@lifexresearch.com"><u>admin@lifexresearch.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call our support team at 866-844-0562.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For questions regarding your plan, or future claims and pre-certification needs please contact Customer Support at </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="mailto:customersupport@benefithealthplan.com"><u>customersupport@benefithealthplan.com</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> or call 844-580-2474.</span></p></li></ul>All additional resources and contact information is within the Welcome Guide attached to this email.<br>In Good Health,<br><b>LifeX Research Corporation</b>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-31 15:13:47', '2025-12-31 15:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000178084006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062318001', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '12-31-25 Dear Lester Pardoe<b>,</b><br>Welcome to LifeX Research Corporation. As of <b>01/01/2026</b>, you are officially enrolled in <b>LifeX Cigna EPO $1500 Deductible</b>.<br><br>To get started, activate your Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) by clicking <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://employeewellnesshub.app/login"><u>employeewellnesshub.app</u></a> and enter the email you enrolled in which is: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://LPardoe@yahoo.com/"><u>LPardoe@yahoo.com</u></a>.<br><br>Once the email is entered, press continue and set a password. After you set a password, it will prompt you to login with your email and password you just set.<br>This portal provides access to wellness resources, important documents, your digital Medical ID Card, and more!<br>The Employee Wellness Hub (EWH) is also where you will complete the health and wellness activities in which you will be compensated for. There will be new features being added for more information regarding your plan each month that will enhance your experience.<br>As part of your LifeX employee onboarding materials, you will receive a welcome letter in the mail from Benefits Health Plan, Inc., including detailed employee benefit information and your Medical ID card the day before the effective date. You will also need to complete your onboarding documents through the Enrollment Hub. Please finish those documents here through our secure portal: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://enrollment-hub.com/"><u>Enrollment Hub</u></a><br>If you have questions about...<br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Logging into Employee Wellness Hub please email </span><a style="display:inline