  ('zcrm_1579374000177923001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687092', 'Laura Eckhardt', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4759 Question : Where do I view my treatment plan that the Dr. Sent me yesterday?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-30 08:00:30', '2025-12-30 08:00:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177922001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687092', 'Laura Eckhardt', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4758 Question : hi, I received a plan from a doctor yesterday, but can’t figure out where to view', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-30 07:58:47', '2025-12-30 07:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177917001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584155', 'Hali Nurnberg', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4757 Question : Hello, we are traveling in Texas and my 4 year old son (also a member) stuck something up his nose. We went to urgent care and the ER last night and have an ENT appt this afternoon. The total expected bill will be over our IUA (right now we’ve just paid about $500 in fees). What do I need to do to open a claim?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-30 07:53:04', '2025-12-30 07:53:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177903024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '12/30/25 - Received call from Mary Hubbard on behalf of spouse Carl Loven. Received bill from Anesthesiologist for colonoscopy in June,2025. Suggested to re-send bill to ARM as preventive procedure which may then be covered. Member seemed to understand. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-30 07:45:00', '2025-12-30 09:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177903013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174926005', 'Andres Gamboa', NULL, '12/30/25 - Spoke with Brandy Gamboa regarding neurology appointment for son Anthony. Also discussed Rx request x2. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-30 07:16:41', '2025-12-30 07:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177903005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173664001', 'Rebecca Hedden', '12/30 - Sent rx request x2. SW', NULL, 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-30 06:53:04', '2025-12-30 06:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177907001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175749034', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that her CC had been hacked and that she had an updated pmt method for us.  She did not come up as declined so I will send her out the link to update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-30 06:37:51', '2025-12-30 06:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175646163', 'Rivers Rothkamp', NULL, '12-29-25 Wendy,<br><br>I was able to sign Rivers up on her school health insurance until Aug 16.   Our Doctor is in network!<br>We ran out of time for her to see Donald Kipp -- but I am going to schedule with him in Jan for my Sciatica.  Hoping he can help me and be a story to tell Rivers to have him try with her when she is out of school!  <br>Meanwhile, when would I need to reach out to you to look at the exchange for her insurance ending August 16?<br><br>Thanks so much for your help!<br>Hope you and yours had a wonderful Christmas!<br>~Angie', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-29 16:43:24', '2025-12-29 16:43:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '12-29-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy - </span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">I am looking at my EYEMED insurance plan you have previously set up for Gregg and me. I wanted to let you know that Gregg passed on this year on April 3, 2025.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Would it be possible to make the account in my name now?</span><br><br><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thanks,</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Jennifer Hushka</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-29 16:28:35', '2025-12-29 16:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123510012', 'William Klopfenstein', NULL, '12/29/25<br>William called because he wanted to know if the pathology bill is covered his colo. AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 14:50:53', '2025-12-29 14:50:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Joy called because she needed help regarding her EOB. It appears the provider sent in multiple claims of the same appointment and one was not covered AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 14:49:19', '2025-12-29 14:49:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130072002', 'Noel Khan', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Called back Noel no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 14:26:19', '2025-12-29 14:26:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142457002', 'John Sapio', NULL, '12/29/25<br>John called because he recelty changed his plan with us and wanted to know how to go about a dermatology appoitmet. I infomred him to please present as self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 14:18:11', '2025-12-29 14:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163173002', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, 'Member canceling eff 1/1/26 due to getting other coverage.  I will process &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 14:17:54', '2025-12-29 14:17:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157233030', 'Kimberly Ressler', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/26 due to getting employer benefits.  I will process &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 14:08:16', '2025-12-29 14:08:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130072002', 'Noel Khan', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Noel called in to see what to do after her daughter was in the ER. I gave her the rundown on starting a share request and how everything works with all of that. Let her know she can pay the IUA directly to Zion to get the process going and not slow any possible future treatments down.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 14:04:36', '2025-12-29 14:05:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174473002', 'Erik Ogaard', NULL, 'Member submitted Dependent Over 18 Form. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 14:03:16', '2025-12-29 14:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152312040', 'Sanjai Dayal', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 13:58:30', '2025-12-29 13:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221004', 'Shelly Moeller', NULL, 'Member enrolled in error for our membership due to getting a link from Mike Montes.  I will process the cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 13:57:24', '2025-12-29 13:57:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176658001', 'Ivan Myers', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 13:54:48', '2025-12-29 13:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010005', 'Libbie Spielmann', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Responded to her email of her having troubles getting her medication. I let her know that 90 day supplies can be mail ordered and 30 day supplies can be picked up from the pharmacy. Gave her instructions and let her know to reach out for assistnace if needed.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:53:54', '2025-12-29 13:53:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797192', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156925006', 'Angela Pena', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 13:51:35', '2025-12-29 13:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Assiste Douglas with logging into the mpbhealth app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:51:05', '2025-12-29 13:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159788001', 'Patricia Mangold', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/26 due to finding other coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 13:48:37', '2025-12-29 13:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797187', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095968002', 'Regina Piper', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 13:47:56', '2025-12-29 13:47:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171004005', 'Matthew Byrnes', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Responded to his email request to get a new proof of membership letter sent to him. I sent him that and a receipt of his payment for the month. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:46:28', '2025-12-29 13:46:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109673002', 'Aaron Morgan', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Called back Aaron after seeing a missed phone call no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:35:10', '2025-12-29 13:35:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177844035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176877001', 'Drew Mersereau', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4756 Question : Hello, I have a question about if removal of a percutaneous pin from an arm is considered unsharable or if this procedure would be sharable. We were scheduled to have the pin removed from our daughters arm before the end of this year,, however she had a fever the day of the surgery and we are trying to figure out what to do considering the doctor wants to postpone the surgery 4-6 weeks. Any help would be greatly appreciated.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-29 13:28:01', '2025-12-29 13:28:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175918001', 'Jon Kite', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Jon called to see how go about his dermatology appoitment, I explaied to him to present as self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:25:20', '2025-12-29 13:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174149004', 'Matthew Adamo', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Called back no response lvm AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:23:14', '2025-12-29 13:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107450016', 'Tammy Rossi', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled and now wants to cancel her new membership I will process,', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 13:18:38', '2025-12-29 13:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118690002', 'Michael Patland', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Answered a couple of his questions and will ascertain the answer to his last one about RX valet reimburse then get back to him. Let him know his daughter was added and what she is entitled to as a member. Then also asked him to elaborate on his RX valet issues since i had not seen the error he showed us before. He should be able to access his card and be able to give information to pharmacists. I also need to look into how to get him a reimburse or if he can get one for the meds he already paid for but was entitled to RX valet discounts. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:17:51', '2025-12-29 13:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174004005', 'Jessica Litton', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Jessica emailed to ask what the receipt was about for her membership. I let her know what membership she has and to reach out to the advisor with questions about her membership since it is a list bill with a group. Also let her know if she cannot reach advisor we are here to answer any lingering questions.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:14:30', '2025-12-29 13:14:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176275049', 'Martha Lewis', NULL, '12/29/25<br>MArtha reached out in the info mailbox to ask some general membership questions about what she is enrolled in. I let her know and told her reach out to advisor as well. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:13:08', '2025-12-29 13:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165020', 'Brian Black', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Asked us on the info email about tax deductible amounts on the MEC&gt; I let him know the number i was given from Patti on how much the MEC portion costs then i let him know the number and that is the only part that is tax deductible. Also recommended talking to his tax professional as well about this<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:12:08', '2025-12-29 13:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177823062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174012013', 'Lauren Flynn', NULL, '12/29/25 - Sent rx info to member. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:04:27', '2025-12-29 13:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Elizabeth called in to see how to use her telehealth for a foot injury. I walked her through downloading the app and how to access her telehealth. She did not want to use a separate email so i transferred her to the telehealth department to see if they could help her schedule an appointment since she does not want to use a second email for her telehealth account.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:03:58', '2025-12-29 13:10:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154760035', 'Caroline Sumners', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Caroline sent an email to the info email box to see how to cancel so i informed her of the process and sent the link to the form for her to fill out and submit.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:01:33', '2025-12-29 13:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176146001', 'Sarah Starr', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Sarah called because she wanted to do her welcome call and access the mpb health app, I did inform her that she would have to wait for after her start date. I did give her the run down of how the plan works AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 13:00:26', '2025-12-29 13:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687109', 'Lisa Pagel', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Lisa reached out to see how to cancel so i informed her of the process and sent the link to the form for her to fill out and submit.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 12:59:00', '2025-12-29 12:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177823055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', NULL, '12/29/25 - Sent rx to Lena. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 12:58:31', '2025-12-29 12:58:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071246', 'Ann Inai', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Ann called to see what she needed to do for an upcoming appointment with her GYN. I let her know that when she becomes active she will get access to her ARM card that she can show to the provider for them to bill directly. We discussed that her provider was in network and that she should just make sure to double check with them but she should not have any out of pocket costs. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 12:58:15', '2025-12-29 12:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177873047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Spoke to lisa and helped guide her to where the forms were for her to make some changes to her membership. I let her know the prices of a member spouse option and she would like to change to the so i let her know the process of getting hi to cancel and submitting the update form. I will speak with the admin team after she submits it all to make sure they see what is going on and she is trying to just cancel one of their memberships then merge them in the easiest way to avoid changes with logins and such, <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 12:56:26', '2025-12-29 12:56:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177823048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '12/29/25 - Member responded that he will contact the closest center. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 12:46:29', '2025-12-29 12:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177234004', 'Joshua Hamilton', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount (List Bill)', '12/29- KG emailed Member', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 12:42:20', '2025-12-29 12:42:20'),
