  ('zcrm_1579374000177797153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Member called in to check her billing and payment amounts.  I reviewed that Dec 20th was $299 for January 2026 and the next billing would be January 20th for Feb 2026.  She was good with that.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 11:42:12', '2025-12-29 11:42:12'),
