  ('zcrm_1579374000177797143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173239002', 'Megan Callaham', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29- 1s notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30- Member submitted payment update form after hours. I will process', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 11:26:04', '2025-12-30 07:19:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171003002', 'Scott Trench', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI <br>12/31-Member cancelled due to non pmt<br>01/02/26- Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>01/05/26- Member submitted payment update form after hours on 01/03/2026.  Membership has already been cancelled.  Resent Notice of Cancellation email to Member &amp; advisor letting him know that his Membership has already been cancelled, and he must contact Advisor to re enroll.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 11:21:36', '2026-01-05 08:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131331002', 'Derwin Clemens', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; Advisor via AI<br>12/30-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>01/02/26- Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 11:17:41', '2026-01-02 07:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177854019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '12/29/25 - Suggested that they send bills to ARM. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 11:11:58', '2025-12-29 11:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157253073', 'Byron MacDonald', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Melissa called because she recived a bill for her colonospy after checking the ARM portal I informd her that we did not recive that bill AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 11:06:42', '2025-12-29 11:06:42'),
