  ('zcrm_1579374000177797128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount (Green side)', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30- Member submitted new payment form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 11:03:32', '2025-12-30 07:36:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177854007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '12/29/25 - Sent member extensive list of radiology centers. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 11:01:13', '2025-12-29 11:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174009020', 'Charles Wiederhold', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Charles called because he had questions regarding his hsa account.I explained that we only make him eligible for one. He also asked how the iua works I told him it was per-medical incidents and that if it does not reach that IUA then it would be out of pocket. I advised him to see the first obgy that has open availability since his wives concern is dignostic and it would be self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 10:59:38', '2025-12-29 11:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177818029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176764001', 'Lathan Lewis', NULL, '12/29/25<br>Lathan called with concerns regarding pre-existing conditions. He stated he recently had high blood pressure and visited urgent care for treatment and wanted to know if this would be considered a pre-existing condition. I reviewed the plan guidelines with him and advised that it could be subject to a waiting period since he sought urgent care treatment; however, I explained that I am unable to pre-determine eligibility or how it would ultimately be classified.<br>He also expressed concern about his wife, who had lab work done due to symptoms and is worried it could be considered pre-existing if she were later diagnosed with cancer. I reviewed the guidelines with him and advised that if the medical documentation does not correlate the lab work to a cancer diagnosis, it should not be considered pre-existing; however, I clarified that I cannot guarantee how Zion would determine this.<br>Lathan then stated he would like to remove himself from the plan. I advised him to reach out to his advisor for further assistance with making changes to his plan. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 10:58:39', '2025-12-29 10:58:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220001', 'Esther Gryder', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount (Green Side)', '12/29-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/31- Member called in directing me to rerun her payment at 2:00 pm Eastern time so her membership does not cancel.  She is going to the bank to deposit the funds.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:56:02', '2025-12-31 12:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100501002', 'Zarah Avadisian', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/26 due to finding other coverage.  I will process &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 10:56:01', '2025-12-29 10:56:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148499301', 'Dmitry Rozin', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30- Member emailed concierge and billing  after hours on 12/29 stating that he recently changed his billing info. He asked us to rerun it again as it is a new bank account and probably did not recognize this charge since it is the first time we charged the new account.  I will process.<br>01/06/2026- Member''s updated pmt method declined: "No Account".  Leo to contact Member to get a credit card for this payment.  Member can switch back to ACH for the next billing cycle. Leo stm and Patti stm with the conclusion that he submitted an incorrect bank account number. Member gave Patti a Credit Card to run for this payment.  I reran and it was approved.  He will send in a payment update form with the correct bank account number to bill going forward.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:51:48', '2026-01-06 09:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323002', 'Jonathan Cockrill', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30 - 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>01/02/26- Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:48:19', '2026-01-02 07:55:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129877009', 'Diana Miller', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30- Member submitted payment update form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:45:00', '2025-12-30 07:45:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177813048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177199025', 'Catherine Darling', NULL, 'Member elected to cancel her membership prior to start (1/1/26) due to financial reasons.  I will process &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 10:44:39', '2025-12-29 10:44:39'),
