  ('zcrm_1579374000177832006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4754 Question : Good morning. I need assistance identifying a provider in the Encinitas, CA area (92024) who can perform a diagnostic test: "CT Chest Scan with and without Contrast". I usually go to Imaging Healthcare Specialists but they indicated that they do not perform this particular test.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-29 10:33:45', '2025-12-29 10:33:45'),
