  ('zcrm_1579374000177797092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177249018', 'John Dawdy', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care + AND MEC + Essentials', 'Have not processed this new enrollment yet.  Previously Teams Tupac  on Tuesday 12/23 to contact Member to see which product he wants.  Now, the two enrollment fees of $375 have declined. Teams Tupac to let me know as soon as possible which product Member wants and if he wants to waive the $125 fee.  We can only rebill him for Jan 1 because he has declined', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:20:22', '2025-12-29 10:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177797087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177219021', 'Lyndsey Cape', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount & $125 Enrollment Fee', '12/29- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/30- Member submitted same bank info info in payment update form after hours. I will process.<br>01/05/2026- Member''s Enrollment Fee and Share Amount has declined again.  Sent Member &amp; advisor email &amp; left vm to update payment method by 2:00 PM today, or the Membership will be cancelled effective 01/01/26.  Member left voicemail to review.  STM.  She submitted a credit card payment update for this payment.  Told her she can change back to Bank ACH after this payment clears, but we need to have an approved form of payment for her to stay active.  I will process.<br><span><br></span>NOTE: When Member changes back to her bank ACH account, re-enter it as a new form of payment, as A123 has the incorrect bank info (with 3 zero''s - s/b 4 zero''s)', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-29 10:10:56', '2026-01-05 12:00:24'),
