  ('zcrm_1579374000177813023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163178', 'Jasmine Firchau', NULL, 'Member called in because she she has not had any notification from us or Zion.  I advised that her membership would be effective on 1/1/26 and hser membership would show up closer to then.  She wanted a price breakdown of her membership and told me that she just wants a Zion membership.  I told her that she should be in touch with Leslie and that she could guide her as far as what to put on her Change Form.  She told me that Leslie was not taking her calls.  In looking at the notes this member cancelled 5 yrs ago due to looking at the Zion website.   She is not interested in all the add ons', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-29 09:40:28', '2025-12-29 09:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177823017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133527010', 'Dallen Mill', NULL, '12/29/25 - Responded to members request for clarification regarding submitting a sharing request. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-29 09:25:04', '2025-12-29 09:25:04'),
