  ('zcrm_1579374000177743006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008372009', 'Adrianne Middleton', NULL, '12-27-25 Adrianne is moving to Medicare 1/1/26. She cancelled her billing with Cigna and I cancelled her accounts on C4 for dental and medical with Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-27 18:36:59', '2025-12-27 18:36:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177726011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '12-26-25 Called Noah back and he wants to make sure he''s not billed again for HAB. I let him know I''d send an email and cc him on it to make sure they don''t bill his account again. He was very appreciative. They''ve already been planning around the ending of HAB for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-26 16:43:26', '2025-12-26 16:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177726006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '12-26-25 Alicia called to find out why HAB is saying they will renew and bill her again. I let her know I''d make sure she''s not billed again per their previous communications of the membership  ending forever as of Dec. 31st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-26 16:29:07', '2025-12-26 16:29:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177668016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173445005', 'Leslie Jones', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4753 Question : Hello, is my estrogen prescription covered under my plan? Trying to figure out the way to get the best price on it. I also haven’t received any prescription cards or insurance cards in the mail. So I need that information in order to apply it to my prescription please', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 12:56:49', '2025-12-26 12:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177721001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4752 Question : Do we have HSA/FSA dollars each year to spend?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 12:41:17', '2025-12-26 12:41:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177669006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571018', 'Randy Sherer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4751 Question : Good afternoon, our local gym membership needs to be renewed. Our gym ask if our medical share plan has discounted senior programs available called SilverSneaker or Renew Active? Can you please provide any insight if MPB support and have these discount programs available. Thanks…', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 12:24:08', '2025-12-26 12:24:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177720001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571018', 'Randy Sherer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4750 Question : We belong to our local gym and our member needs to be renewed. My wife and I are over 60. The gym ask us if our medical share plan has SilverSneaker or Renew Active available? Can you please provide any insight if those discounted programs are available with our membership at MPB. Thanks…', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 12:15:56', '2025-12-26 12:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177677018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4747 Question : I’m trying to log in to my account and it says I don’t have one. Emails have been sent to my email this year', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 11:38:58', '2025-12-26 11:38:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177694005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4746 Question : Help with dermatologist', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 11:14:12', '2025-12-26 11:14:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177714001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4745 Question : I’m looking for the dermatologist and coverage for me Cathy Jenkins Spouse of Jon Jenkins', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 11:13:31', '2025-12-26 11:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177683005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4744 Question : I have my coverage with my husband Jon and I am looking for the dermatologist and it only shows my husband as eligible. How do I find my coverage?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-26 11:12:20', '2025-12-26 11:12:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177602014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961038', 'Steven Barrows', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4742 Question : Does having mpb.health account for the 20 plus member to remain on this plus medi-share after age 65', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-25 08:58:42', '2025-12-25 08:58:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177620026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077287065', 'Maxwell Brown Abbott', NULL, '12-24-25 2025 Plan:<br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Maxwell Abbott</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$100</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$1,225</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$1.00 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after $381.87 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 7783380003</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/12/24</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-24 16:11:33', '2025-12-24 16:11:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177620021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077287065', 'Maxwell Brown Abbott', NULL, '12-24-25 Dear Wendy Scipione,<br> <br>The following notice is being sent to your client:<br> <br>Hello MAXWELL BROWN ABBOTT,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your medical insurance with Cigna Healthcare. Your policy is no longer in effect as of <b>December 31, 2025</b> due to your request.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.<br> <br>If you''d like to apply again for new coverage, please must contact <b>Connect for Health Colorado®, Colorado''s state-based health insurance marketplace</b>. You can call them directly at <b>1.855.752.6749</b> or visit <span><a href="http://connectforhealthco.com" style="" target="_blank"><b>connectforhealthco.com</b></a></span>.<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-24 16:07:52', '2025-12-24 16:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177620016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '12-24-25 Suzy is requesting to change her end date to Feb. 1st since her new employer ins isn''t starting until Feb 1 or 15. I''m waiting to hear back from Member Services and Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-24 16:06:47', '2025-12-24 16:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177621004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165339002', 'Carla Pulliam', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4741 Question : Hi! Happy Holidays. I''m trying to remove a dependent from my account. Pls lmk how.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-24 10:25:33', '2025-12-24 10:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177582114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149941002', 'Brian Erickson', NULL, '12/24/25<br>Provider called to verify benefits. I let the provider know they are active and when the membership began. Also let the provider know how the membership works. They said this is for diagnostic services so i explained the difference in how things work for preventative and diagnostic. I explained the IUa and how things would work with that depending on where cheryl is in the treatment process for the visit she is trying to schedule. Provider was satisfied and i gave my name for them to reference these notes if they call back<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-24 09:27:56', '2025-12-24 09:27:56'),
