  ('zcrm_1579374000177495108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170673010', 'Richard Liebert', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/23- The Dec 20th billing did not bill.  Member emailed Patti to say he owes his share amount.  Patti ran the payment and it declined.  <br>12/24- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/29 &amp; 12/30 - 3rd &amp; 4th notices sent via AI</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/31-Member cancelled due to non pmt</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/31- Member replied to billing email at 12:13 PM directing us to rerun using card ending 8369. I will process.</span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-23 14:02:48', '2025-12-31 10:16:21'),
