  ('zcrm_1579374000177427036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507139', 'Penny Dias', NULL, '12/23/25<br>Called Zion with her after Planstin Tranferred her to me because she wanted to know what to do about an upcoming MRI that is related to an older share request. We both let her know if she is able to postpone the procedure then she might not have to pay up front by sending in an estimate and seeing if they would add this to the old share request she already has for this treatment or if she has to start a new one and meet the IUA again. Zion will be following up with her then she will know what to do and i will follow up with penny to make sure they called her back to deal with this. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-23 09:42:22', '2025-12-23 09:42:22'),
