  ('zcrm_1579374000177351495', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177389001', 'Kayden Wilson', NULL, '12-22-25 12-22-25 Abby is turning 26 in Dec. and will lose her health ins. She will not get an APTC bc her mom passed away in Jan. of 2025. She''s unemployed and was also not approved by Medicaid bc she got $40K from a life insurance policy that her mom had from work. She was in CA and now in CO. She broke her leg in 2021 and had the hardware removed in 2025. All is well on that front. DOB 12-14-99. She needs something for Jan. 2026. She and her significant other, Kayden Wilson were referred to me by Bryce Wilson who is an MPB member. They really want MPB but missed the deadline for Jan. 1st. So, Abby signed up for LX for Jan. Then she and Kayden joined Care+ for Feb. 2026 onward. Kayden is 28. They want to join Cloud Medical since they heard good things about Cloud. They do take supplements and can benefit from the discounts. Kayden was also in some car accident but no long term problems. I''m not sure when that happened. Kayden is a personal assistant for his job.  They chose $344/$2500 CARE+ for EO with Kayden Wilson as primary. Kayden is on LHS right now but jus learned that they have a cap at $1M per incident which he''s not happy about.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-23 00:02:48', '2025-12-23 00:03:38'),
