  ('zcrm_1579374000177351482', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351427', 'Abigail Hernandez', NULL, '12-22-25 Abby is turning 26 in Dec. and will lose her health ins. She will not get an APTC bc her mom passed away in Jan. of 2025. She''s unemployed and was also not approved by Medicaid bc she got $40K from a life insurance policy that her mom had from work. She was in CA and now in CO. She broke her leg in 2021 and had the hardware removed in 2025. All is well on that front. DOB 12-14-99. She needs something for Jan. 2026. She and her significant other, Kayden Wilson were referred to me by Bryce Wilson who is an MPB member. They really want MPB but missed the deadline for Jan. 1st. So, Abby signed up for LX for Jan. Then she and Kayden joined Care+ for Feb. 2026 onward. Kayden is 28. They want to join Cloud Medical since they heard good things about Cloud. They do take supplements and can benefit from the discounts. Kayden was also in some car accident but no long term problems. I''m not sure when that happened. Kayden is a personal assistant for his job.  They chose $344/$2500 CARE+ for EO with Kayden Wilson as primary.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 23:59:35', '2025-12-22 23:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351419', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177140038', 'Christopher Hazen', NULL, '12-19-25 Also, Chris hiked in the Dolomites and really likes that this concept really fits into the Libertarian mindset. He runs a land trust and he''s working on getting that done by the end of the year which is quite complex. Anyhow, he enrolled and is good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 23:23:02', '2025-12-22 23:23:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351406', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177165001', 'Linda Robinson', NULL, '12-19-25 Linda came to me via Debra Madsen and lives in Carbondale, CO.  Linda was out on the hill the first time I called her. She works for Aspen Ski Co. She was going to have to pay $520 with $2500 ded and $7K mop. Plus her rent is going up. She needs to find something more sustainable. She had 2 knee replacements 4 years ago and 3 years ago. The first was in 2021 and 2nd in 2022. She takes Ambien as needed. No tobacco. She''s also on a statin which she plans to get off asap. She doesn''t believe she needs it and has already changed her diet and obviously exercises plenty while teaching skiing. She likes to do wellness. Yes, she''s a 1099 when she works for Debra Madsen. She''s choosing Premium HSA $1000/$363. She was So, So happy to talk with me. She was lost and spinning trying to find something that would work for her. She was happy that I made is easy and quick as well. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 23:14:59', '2025-12-22 23:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351378', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176750022', 'Kari Kiker', NULL, '12-17-25 Kari is 58 and husband is 60.  Live in Aspen. They were referred to me by Andre MPitsos. They are both independent contractors and W2 also. They have 2 kids who are older and currently on their own ins. 1 is in Bozeman, MT and works for REI. They tend to do their own blood work at a local health fair. No meds, no tobacco and did Cologuard recently and mammo turned out well. They don''t have any immediate wellness needs and prefer Care+ for the first year at $668/$1250, $125/$25. They are all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 23:00:41', '2025-12-22 23:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351373', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176760017', 'Michael Check', NULL, '12-17-25 Mike Check is 56 and active. He was referred to me via Val Yaw. They play tennis together.  He''s self-employed as a Primary Care Dr. in Snowmass Village. He''s been getting HSA plans with Anthem for years at $1200-$1300. He doesn''t go to the Dr. and does blood work in his own. He did a colonoscopy this year and doesn''t need one again for another 10 years. He has Menier''s disease which is an inner ear disorder. He also takes truvada as a preventive method to protect against sexually transmitted diseases. He doesn''t have any of that to worry about. He wears a Woops fitness tracker. He also does some test to include 65 blood markers as a way to stay on top of his health. He chose Care+ $318/$2500 and $125/$25 for EO Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:56:38', '2025-12-22 22:56:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351368', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176734033', 'Monique Cardillo', NULL, '12-22-25 Monique knows something went wrong with her payment and requested the payment update form. I sent it to her. She should be taking care of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:50:32', '2025-12-22 22:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351360', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176751037', 'Koffi Kponvi', NULL, '12-16-25 Koffi works with Finray Solar. He''s 48 and lives in Philadelphia, PA. He''s solo. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and no wellness. He goes to the gym, plays tennis 2-3x per week. He did have a colonoscopy last year and all was good. He wants a Jan. 1st start date. He enrolled on the Finray Solar site. Finray, Darrell Porter will pay $100 towards the cost of his membership and payroll deduct the rest. He chose Secure HSA. I wasn''t finding Penn Medicine in the PHCS network. He knows that. He also wanted dental and vision which I sent. Otherwise, he''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:46:07', '2025-12-22 22:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351355', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173671001', 'Anne White', NULL, '12-16-25 Anne decided to change her mind and join Zion directly through her employer. She was able to move from 1099 to W2 and access Zion through True Nature Healing Arts Foundation. She worked with their benefits guy, Larry Smith. The new contribution amount is $300/$1250 IUA a month with fewer benefits. Her cost will only be $45 per month since the employer is paying the rest. She''s also joining a local DPC for $120 per month. It''s something like that. Daniel Adams with Planstin told her MPB and Zion/Planstin are merging. So, choosing to bypass MPB was no problem since it''s all one and the same soon. This is not public information yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:41:40', '2025-12-22 22:41:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351350', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177102001', 'Emily Swenson', NULL, '12-16-25 Emmy was previously a member when she was married to Mathieu Shields. It was too much to manage with her husband and kids. But, now that she''s divorced and ready to focus on her own health and wellness, she''s excited to become a member again. The kids are on their dad''s plan. She''s healthy. She''s a hair stylist in Boulder. She wants her annual well checks. Regular insurance is just not realistic anymore. She takes progesterone. She watched the video. I discussed Premium HSA and Secure HSA. She chose Secure HSA $2500/$289. She''s happy to have the human element back in her healthcare solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:35:29', '2025-12-22 22:35:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351345', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351324', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, '12-16-25 Kendal has chosen LX instead of Care+ for Jan. 1st onward. She''s an employee of Florie Glusman. Florie is paying for her plan. She chose Cigna EPO $1500 at $369. She''s healthy and answered no to the medical questions. She also is a graduate at Gerogia College and State University with her OTD degree. We completed her LX app with my new GA state license.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:28:28', '2025-12-22 22:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351319', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163173002', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, '12-22-25 I resent the cancellation link for her Care+ membership to make sure she takes care of that by Dec. 30th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:20:28', '2025-12-22 22:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177140038', 'Christopher Hazen', NULL, '12-16-25 Chris 57 and wife 59 found me via their family member, Robert Mitchell who is a cousin and living in SS. They live in Telluride! They are a small biz owner with an S-Corp and they might choose to include employees. They are super healthy, no tobacco. Chris'' wife has a thyroid issue and that''s it. Yes, they do their wellness visits, no supplements. They fund their HSA and try to max it out. They like traditional and alternative medicine. They watched the video. They want a Jan. 1st start date. They enrolled successfully into Secure HSA ES $2500/$646. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 22:13:21', '2025-12-22 22:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351282', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724020', 'Kenneth Schaedle', NULL, '12-17-25 Enrolled successfully into Premium Care at $1500/$777. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 17:50:14', '2025-12-22 17:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724020', 'Kenneth Schaedle', NULL, '12-15-25 Ken and Sue are facing a $1800-$2200 with Bronze HSA plan options for 2026. Sue is 60 and Ken is 53 and Mika is 19. Ken is not employed. Sue has   contract W2 work, no self-employment. They are mostly healthy. One of them has hypothyroid and takes synthroid. The other has slight arthritis in the knee and meniscus. They already use GoodRX. They watched the video. We discussed Premium Care $1000/$877 or $1500/$777.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 17:49:16', '2025-12-22 17:49:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351259', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '12-22-25 From Carrie,  "I''ve made the decision to cancel MPowering as I simply don''t use the benefits it has to offer. <br>I wanted to let you know I am calling Mpowering to initiate this cancellation. <br>Thank you for your service these past years <br><br>Wishing you a wonderful holiday and new year!<br>Carrie"<br><span><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 17:23:46', '2025-12-22 17:23:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351254', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '12-22-25 Karen updated her cc into due to fraud. We discussed the HA Co-Op but they already have Premium Care that they are happy with and it gives them more benefits for a better price. They also pay $270 a month for a DPC and they love that and get their labs super cheap through the DPC. She wants the updated information on Premium Care which I will send now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 17:08:58', '2025-12-22 17:08:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176443053', 'Lisa LeVerrier', NULL, '12-22-25 I submitted a ticket for this, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy, I was thinking about when we filled out that application on the phone together and I don’t think there was a place for me to put my husband‘s pre-existing conditions. I remember putting mine but not anything about his. Let me know if we need to do anything to change that.</span><br><br>Lisa C. LeVerrier"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 15:29:05', '2025-12-22 15:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177327085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174846005', 'Michael R Shannon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4731 Question : Our plan starts Jan 1st, but shortly after the new year, we will need to get a self-pay abdomen ultrasound on my 8 year old daughter. Do you have any recommended clinics or places in our area? The big health systems are super expensive!', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-22 14:39:15', '2025-12-22 14:39:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, '12/22/25<br>elizabeth called because she forgot her meds at home. I tranferred her to lyric to see if she could get another prescription written for her<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 14:37:51', '2025-12-22 14:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113526002', 'Laurie Linn', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Laurie called to see if the shingles shot was covered and i confirmed for her that it was underneath preventative care<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 14:36:12', '2025-12-22 14:36:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168201002', 'Emily Armstrong', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Emily called to see what to do for well child visits. They have been paying for all of them. I let them know that is considered preventative care so she should get all of those bills gathered and i will help her submit them to get a reimburse<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 14:35:32', '2025-12-22 14:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152095002', 'Richard Luhr', NULL, '12/22/25<br>spoke to cheryl about how preventative care works and explained to her how billing and appointments work. I let her know how annual visits work along with the bloodwork<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 14:15:48', '2025-12-22 14:15:48'),
