  ('zcrm_1579374000177318031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459001', 'Karin Fourie', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4729 Question : Karin Fourie - have a question about my coverage.. My doctor''s office is saying the overall plan is in network, but the plan I selected only covers essentials which does not include my annual exam. I am confused, I thought annual check is preventative and 100% covered. What is the best way to determine here what is covered and what is not. They want me to do a pre-pay before my visit, they said they will have to call to see what is covered, but not understanding if I have coverage, why I need a prepay... :-( what steps do i need to follow to understand what is covered or not. I am not in a position to spend 5+ hours for every appointment I make to try and figure out what is covered and what is not', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-22 13:31:46', '2025-12-22 13:31:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177302464', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177224005', 'Shanna Davis', 'Member & Ch $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 13:31:38', '2025-12-22 13:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177302456', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177221020', 'Addison Lindsey', 'Member & Fam $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 13:28:59', '2025-12-22 13:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177317018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459001', 'Karin Fourie', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4728 Question : What does my coverage include? My doctor is telling me that the plan I selected only covers essentials and that does not include my annual checkup which is preventative, which I understood is 100% covered.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-22 13:27:23', '2025-12-22 13:27:23'),
