  ('zcrm_1579374000177368026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171404002', 'Gary Rose', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Gary called to see about a STD check and what would be covered. In his situation it would have been a diagnostic type screening so he could not use any preventative care and they probably would have not covered that one either. I let him know what his options are and he decided to go to the planned parenthood he was already at since they work with people for low price options on things like that.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 12:39:47', '2025-12-22 12:39:47'),
