  ('zcrm_1579374000177368016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176273003', 'Clarence Burnett', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Clarence''s wife called to make sure everything was set up as far as pay method and everything. She wanted to know if they needed to do anything for his membership to start on the 1st. I looked at the account and saw that they had a card on file and are set to go active on Jan 1 2025. I let her know that and she was good to go after i explained how to use the preventative care part of her MEC and that she can use primary care etc. through telehealth. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 12:16:38', '2025-12-22 12:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137202002', 'Kristianne Goff', NULL, '12/22/25<br>responded to her email and answered her questions about upcoming price changes, how to start a share request, and how her membership works. Let her know if she is still not sure or needs any guidance to just respond to the email or try calling us again. Also let her know to give us some better times to try and call her since we have been unsuccessful in reaching her so far on the phone.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 12:14:13', '2025-12-22 12:14:13'),
