  ('zcrm_1579374000177368006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Robert called in to ask how to start a share request for an ER bill he just got for his son. Walked through getting him logged in and over to the Zion portal and showed him how to start a need. He was able to finish up once we reached the part for him to upload documents. Said he would call back if he ran into any issues. <br>AJ<br><span><br></span><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 12:05:02', '2025-12-22 12:05:02'),
