  ('zcrm_1579374000177302131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169726005', 'Gregory Walzer', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/30- Member submitted payment update form with same card info after hours. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 11:14:45', '2025-12-30 07:11:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177302126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168054002', 'Cynthia McKay', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/23- Member submitted payment update form after hours.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 11:13:42', '2025-12-23 08:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678123', 'Kevin Falardo', NULL, '12-22-25 Kelli reached out and wants a Jan. 1st start date.  She said the following, "Hi Wendy,<br><br>I thought we were able to get insurance through January 15th, that''s what everything says open enrollment is through?<br><br>Regardless, I don''t have a life change event, I''ve been trying to get insurance for 6 months, have been working with Allstate, but I''ve reached my limit as they are not responsive, and I cannot get help. I just need to get insurance as soon as possible at this point. What options do we have? I have an employee and have myself and my husband and son that need policies.<br><br>Thank you for your help,<br>Kelli"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 11:12:52', '2025-12-22 11:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177302121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/29 &amp; 12/30 - 3rd &amp; 4th notices sent via AI</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/31-Member cancelled due to non pmt</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">01/02/26- Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em</span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 11:12:31', '2026-01-02 07:51:32'),
