  ('zcrm_1579374000177302111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160011002', 'Kara Chanasyk', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/23- Member submitted payment update form  with same card info on file after hours. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 11:10:01', '2025-12-23 08:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177302106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159240001', 'Elliot Ash', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/29- Member submitted payment update form after hours 12/26.  I will process.When I entered the new AMEX card info, it said "invalid card". I will email the member. Member submitted a new payment method form. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 11:08:33', '2025-12-29 08:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '12-22-25 Karen inquired about an IUA change she tried to do outside of the change period for the MPB  Group which is now June 1st, April 21-May 18 to make the change. She didn''t re-submit her request for the change in the spring, so now the next opportunity to do so is the dates I listed above. She''s also inquiring about HA Co-Op per the email they sent. I sent her a bunch of information to review. We can discuss a possible upgrade to her current membership to give her the ACA wellness visits again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 11:03:29', '2025-12-22 11:03:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177368001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974121', 'Maria Crompton', NULL, '12/22/25<br>Called back to help with login issues and return her VM. Did not answer so i left VM and tried to explain how to login to the app from there. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 10:55:05', '2025-12-22 10:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177351014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162402001', 'Ariel Tidwell', NULL, '12-22-25 Ariel has stated that there''s proper money in her account for Patti to run it tomorrow. Patti will do so. Patti''s asking that she changes her payment method to a cc so the payment will work and the decline is the next day rather than waiting 3 days to discover it''s not working. The payment cannot be split in the month for each month moving forward. That was Ariel''s desire.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-22 10:53:05', '2025-12-22 10:53:05'),
