  ('zcrm_1579374000177302080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146813069', 'Peter Wickersham', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/29 &amp; 12/30 - 3rd &amp; 4th notices sent via AI</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">12/31-Member cancelled due to non pmt</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">01/02-26- Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">01/07/26- Member left voice message after hours about the cancellation. They were out of town, then they got sick, and did not see the four emails we sent (said we usually send emails to both emails on file ?( we never do that) then the card on file was closed due to fraud several months back. She was not sure why it was still going through and just now declined for December billing.  There is no record of a Payment Update on file. Therefore, I told her that she must contact Advisor to re-enroll with her new card.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(49, 57, 73);"><br></span>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 10:35:19', '2026-01-07 08:38:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177301413', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175749034', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Spoke to member she will reschedule the welcome call after her start date of January 1, 2026. Sent an email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-22 10:34:43', '2025-12-22 10:34:43'),
