  ('zcrm_1579374000177302050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113648002', 'Charles White', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/23- Member submitted payment update form after hours.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 10:24:40', '2025-12-23 08:04:37'),
