  ('zcrm_1579374000177302045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112660002', 'Timothy Rennert', 'Decline of 01/26 Share Amount', '12/22- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm AI<br>12/29- Member replied to billing email after hours on 12/26 stating he maxed out his credit limit, so the payment declined.  He stated it was OK to rerun the payment.  I will process. Member later submitted a payment update form per Zac with the same card information.  I will mark as disregard as I have already run the payment earlier with the same card info. I called Member back because the Cognito form he submitted was a different card number.  He said the one I reran should go through, but if it doesn''t, I can use the new cognito form with card ending 5776.  Also, he said going forward, to use card ending 5776 for future payments. I updated A123', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-22 10:23:25', '2025-12-29 13:13:17'),
