  ('zcrm_1579374000177340009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459001', 'Karin Fourie', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4717 Question : GM, I need assistance with an appointment I am trying to schedule. According to MPB health my doctor is in-network (2 chats with concierge). My doctor is telling me that they cannot determine if my coverage is in-network or not and are treating my appointment as out-of-network. I have no idea where to go from here to determine if the doctor is actually in-network or not. Last time I reached out, I was told to confirm with my doctor, my doctor is telling me to confirm with my insurance... I need some guidance here pls... I understand this is not full coverage, but this is preventative services and the first time I am using my coverage in 2 years, it shouldn''t be this hard :-(', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-22 09:11:24', '2025-12-22 09:11:24'),
