  ('zcrm_1579374000177260001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491027', 'Allison McFee', NULL, 'Member called in on 12/19 end of day to update payment method.  I directed her to the pmt Update form on the Website.  However after a couple of attempts I did not receive the info.  I then sent the link via email which I got.  I will update prior to billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-20 16:15:15', '2025-12-20 16:15:15'),
