  ('zcrm_1579374000177143004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687018', 'Douglas Weaver', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4711 Question : I was wondering if I am zionshare or sedona or none to swtich my plan', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-19 14:22:44', '2025-12-19 14:22:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177113023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060523080', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-19-25 VSP Enrollment - <br>Dear Danna Hinz,<br>Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a> or e-mail us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a>. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.<br>Here is what you need to know.<br><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in the Pri mary Applicant section. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN. Please note: While your vision insurance is effective on the date noted below, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in the system through the network providers. Please make sure your provider is able to verify benefits before you schedule an appointment.  <br><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For billing information and ID cards, please register for your Ameritas Member Portal Account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3Do6A9WQ0LhgoniJYpy2kHlfDXjCcDDZHhpd-2D5qe3861-5FhlHYn94e1y8vlmYnjFOWq-5FFmHD9Uxg02mdfa0caMZuIm4m8K8ofKDm1YaBm8f1mpWlQ-5FJZ1pujbApzHa4GJpzBR9ZnH99naCmv6V6GjCB5O08jppt5ukX2-2DXgowodGxC7qUVGcnDIo8lceA39FDKK&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=6V2AdM5ZaNyftinsoDs1Fc7OwILZNs2mxHe4aaS9gMXPd6OPmiv1sa4zLHA_ofXz&amp;s=-5TNZ6M7PdJX5ImZmX389u11B1su93m0I4Q5oJwZyLU&amp;e="><u>https://www.ameritas.com/sign-in/</u></a></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have an EyeMed policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your EyeMed Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN: Register here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3D9mQ6RpiwOjTRIM0Sq-2D3joGYrO2ewJ-5F3DpM-2DwJN0JfXyQZ0IKu7VXXzlcsMcuVeXXl8diX1fZSllpcfuG1vNlfTPfvjPoSw2zAPSdaksQ68liIGm58uKpowWxwsDRpx5DByLMkoSwcyganW5xoUZ-2Dc9mkG-2DeWQ-2DMOO9hto0p3IY1KrFqjAB6s3HC2fe51C1jK&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=6V2AdM5ZaNyftinsoDs1Fc7OwILZNs2mxHe4aaS9gMXPd6OPmiv1sa4zLHA_ofXz&amp;s=vT7nBp3lyaD2KJYBbZtenLDmt_T-lWMyoHlsY0-y8oE&amp;e="><u>www.eyemedvisioncare.com/member/</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have a VSP policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your VSP Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN. Create an account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3DkyG4x-5F-2520-2DJ2Woot6vBMPQETf6HeY0zNi0qM9bRkfXqgKkh98DCcznVjF4uJ6FJTm8RhzEM45i1D05XW0t1tpsqmjjVhAGfo5QT27SpyXmJDATs0qDoVAnLMtNjfWPN6Z4O7OU-2DJ4UjM9iDa2GJ-2DeAv-2Dv-2Dv-5F9uNE3KqgoNtEeR3CS4-3D&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=6V2AdM5ZaNyftinsoDs1Fc7OwILZNs2mxHe4aaS9gMXPd6OPmiv1sa4zLHA_ofXz&amp;s=AcFveUGQGSONNFUQooWVg6iMOU-5ER8aiQAyXphG0pY&amp;e="><u>www.vsp.com</u></a></p></li></ul><b>Ameritas </b>(ID cards and billing):<br>5900 O Street Lincoln, NE 68510<br>Customer Service 866-619-6095<br>Fax: 402-309-2598<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com"><u>SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com</u></a><br><b>EyeMed</b> (verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-521-3605<br><b>VSP </b>(verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-877-7195<br>Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a separa te transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. <br>Your specific coverage information is as follows:<br><br>Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan A<br>Who’s covered: Applicant + One<br>Effective Date: 12/19/2025<br>Carrier: Ameritas<br>Monthly Charge: <b>$29.38</b><br><br>Policy Number: <b>300173595</b><br>Agent Info: <b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b> <br>Questions? Call (844)833-8440<br><br>©2025 Direct Benefits Inc, All rights reserved. <br>You are receiving this email from filling out an e-enrollment application form on the Direct Benefits website. <br>Our mailing address is: <br>Direct Benefits Inc, 7900 International Drive, Suite 1040, Bloomington, MN 55425<br>CA Agency License: 600496<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-19 14:22:14', '2025-12-19 14:22:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177078337', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177124063', 'Michelle Feenstra', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-19 14:20:58', '2025-12-19 14:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177113018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026023246', 'Kristy Barber', NULL, '12-19-25 Kristy called to understand what is best for 2026. She used HAB for dental, nutrition, gym but hasn''t done much beyond that and may not have time to do so. She mentioned she uses She Scan instead of a mammogram. They don''t use any radiation but they use ultrasound and not sure what else. Cash pay is $200 and no ins accepted. She has  a hysterectomy and did a colonoscopy at age 44 in 2024. Ins wouldn''t cover it bc she was too young and she did it before HAB, so she paid for it. She doesn''t need pap screening that often bc of her hysterectomy. She also now chooses to stay out of the health care system as much as possible now bc "they peddle things she doesn''t need or want."  So, she''s happy to keep her membership as is and save the $107 per month. She''s never bothered with funding an HSA either. All set for now and knows her current membership is called Premium Care and paying $299/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-19 14:20:11', '2025-12-19 14:20:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177077212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145346174', 'Scott Garcia', NULL, '12/19/25<br>Susan called in earlier and spojke with our susan on concierge.She grabbed me to come help since they were in a situation where they could not find in network options for colo/mammo anywhere near her. I got on the call and let susan know after doing a search myself that i will need to reach out to ARM and speak with them to see exactly what we could do for her. I know when they have no options in a 50+ mile radius then ARM will work with anyone close by and they might have to pay up front and get reimbursed. I will keep susan updated as i go through this process. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-19 14:19:41', '2025-12-19 14:19:41'),
