  ('zcrm_1579374000177077124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166726002', 'Roman Garcia', NULL, '12/19/25<br>Romans employer reached out through sales IQ to see if the spouse of romans was added to the membership yet. We lete him know he has to submit the form since it is a list bill. I gave him the link to the change form for him to put romans info in so our team can make the changes for him.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-19 12:29:49', '2025-12-19 12:29:49'),
