  ('zcrm_1579374000177078205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176537001', 'Philip Skinner', 'Decline of Enrollment Fee $125 & 01/26 Share Amount', '12/19-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm<br>12/22- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm (On the voicemail, I told the Member that the enrollment fee was rerun on 12/20 billing date thru the same bank account and must be received by Wednesday, December 24th, 2025) Told Member we need a new payment method and that his enrollment is pending upon receipt. We need to run Share Amount too.<br>12/24- 3rd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm. Member submitted payment update form. I will process. Enrollment Fee was approved.  Went to bill Share Amount and it declined on the AMEXcard.  Sent member an email notifying him that the Enrollment Fee was approved, however the Share Amount declined and to submit another payment method.<br>12/29- Member replied to the billing email after hours on 12/26 asking if there was a way he can make the payment online.  He stated he would put space on the card now if I could run the charge asap.  I left Member a voice mail today to submit another credit card, as the one he has used AMEX 1006 has declined several times.  I also followed up with an email to the Member &amp; advisor.<br>12/30- Member submitted payment update form. I will process. The new Credit Card Declined.  Sent Member Email.<br>12/31- Member replied to the billing email after hours stating the money is on the current card and to charge again ASAP. I will process.<br>01/05/26- Member''s Visa ending 5358 has declined.  Sent Member &amp; advisor email and vm to update payment method by today at 12:00 PM  to avoid cancellation effective 01/01/26.  Did not receive pmt update form.  Membership cancelled.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-19 12:12:18', '2026-01-05 11:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177079059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118212001', 'Rustin Glass', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove dependents from membership and also increase IUA to $5000 eff 1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-19 12:12:10', '2025-12-19 12:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177078197', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177127007', 'Matthew O''Malley', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-19 12:00:51', '2025-12-19 12:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177077100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165349024', 'Christopher Jaffe', NULL, '12/19/25<br>Called Benjamin to f/u with him after he experienced issues with urgent care telhealth. Did not answer so i left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-19 11:58:25', '2025-12-19 11:58:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177078189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177140006', 'William Wielgus', 'Member & Sp $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-19 11:55:58', '2025-12-19 11:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000177077095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152489002', 'James Kaiser', NULL, '12/19/25<br>Provider reached out on sales IQ to see what the benefits were. I explained how our program works and they seemed to understand everything once i was done. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-19 11:49:56', '2025-12-19 11:49:56'),
