  ('zcrm_1579374000177077090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830025', 'Julie Gibson-Clark', NULL, '12/19/25<br>Julie reached out through sales IQ to ask where her orders were for an ultrasound she just got ordered through the telehealth. I let her know if she does not see the order in her portal then we can call lyric and ask them to reach out to the dr to make sure he does post them or get them re sent to her. I gave her the number and she called them to get the orders either re sent or for them to show her where they are located if she just cannot find them. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-19 11:47:16', '2025-12-19 11:47:16'),
