  ('zcrm_1579374000176947047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '12/18/25<br>called to find out if she went to several dr''s before learning the problem could that be eligible for sharing. I let her know to save the bills and submit themn for a share request and then we can get a determination and find out if they would share on that or not. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-18 13:48:43', '2025-12-18 13:48:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176947042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856035', 'Maia Toll', NULL, '12/18/25<br>returned her VM by sending email like she requested to give her the number for ARM since she is out of town in case she wants to call ARm herself to find out more about a DEXA scan. I let her know they can tell her if it can be covered or not and we can help with that call if she needs. She is out of country so again phone calls might be hard to arrange with Maia until she gets back,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-18 13:47:13', '2025-12-18 13:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176947037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129548001', 'Jill Finn', NULL, '12/18/25<br>Jill called to see what is covered for an annual visit. I let her know it is the visit and the associated bloodwork. She got a bill from the pahtology department so i let her know first she would want to try and get them to send the bill directly to ARM but if for whatever reason they give her trouble let us know and we can assist with getting the bill processed with ARM. She is going to try and get the provider to send it and reach out if she has troubles. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-18 13:38:46', '2025-12-18 13:38:46'),
