  ('zcrm_1579374000176947006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000272', 'Katelyn Doty', NULL, '12/18/25<br>Katelyn called to see what she needed to do to upgrade so she can utilize an HSA. I let her know after looking at her account she is enrolled already in the secure HSA so she should be good to go . LEt her know to speak with Wendy in case there waw any changes that she helped her with that might have been contradictory to what i saw in E123. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-18 11:58:45', '2025-12-18 11:58:45'),
