  ('zcrm_1579374000176952006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163173002', 'Kendal Reeves', NULL, '12-18-25 Signature Documents Received<br>Order Details<br>Purchases:<br>LifeX Cigna EPO $1500 Deductible<br>Active Date: January 1, 2026<br>Research Associate Name:<br>Kendal Reeves<br>Research Associate ID:<br>686098049<br>First Billing Date:<br>December 18, 2025<br>Second Draft Date:<br>January 15, 2026<br><b>Completed</b>!<br>The following member has completed the signature documents for their LifeX employment.<br><br>Name: Kendal Reeves<br>Member ID: 686098049<br><br><b>Important Reminders</b><br>Once the first payment has been made successfully, the Research Association will be sent to Benefit Health Plan Inc within 3 business days. Approximately 1 day before the effective date a welcome email will be sent to the Research Associate giving them access to their Personal Health Dashboard (PHD) which will have their temporary medical ID card, contact information, health plan information, and benefits access. The Research Associate will be able to use their benefits immediately on the effective date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-18 11:41:45', '2025-12-18 11:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176945020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176932001', 'Robert Tseng', 'Member & Family MEC + Essentials', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-18 11:40:38', '2025-12-18 11:40:38'),
