  ('zcrm_1579374000176942009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Ch $1250 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-18 11:25:22', '2025-12-18 11:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176942001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change IUA to $1250 and also add child to membership prior to start date of 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-18 11:21:15', '2025-12-18 11:21:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176941001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159254002', 'Marcelle McGee', NULL, '12.18.25 - Marcelle is having an issue with Sedera not approving her sharing request for her surgery. They are stating that she needs to provide more records from the 1st and 2nd physicians, to which she states the 3rd physician provided all of it. Her biggest concern is the lack of communication. Marcelle requested a call with the needs coordinator and that is not available until Tuesday. Her Surgery is tomorow. I am getting intouch with Juliet at Sedera. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-18 11:14:47', '2025-12-18 11:14:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176897032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, '12-17 and 12-18 Emmy is ready to re-enroll now that she''s gotten divorced and will only have to manage her account, not the rest of the family. She and I have missed each other. I left her a vm today and yesterday to complete the application. She owns her own hair salon in downtown Boulder. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. VM''s may not be a good way to reach her according to her vm message. I sent an email as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-18 11:14:45', '2025-12-18 11:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176937001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '12/18/25<br>Mailan texted to see if she had teledoc. I let her know yes she does and where to find it. <br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-12-18 11:12:17', '2025-12-18 11:12:17');
