  ('zcrm_1579374000176860003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '12.18.25 - Valerie reached out to see the status of her claim with MSEAP. MSEAP approved 12 sessions to get reimbursed to the provider, but the provider only billed for 7 sessions. Sherry advised that Valerie reaches out to her directly for guidance on how to proceed with the provider on the remiander of the 5 sessions. Provided contact info. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-18 09:14:58', '2025-12-18 09:14:58'),
