  ('zcrm_1579374000176721034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, '12/17/25<br><br>Jennifer called regarding lab work completed at Quest earlier this year. She received the EOB from ARM and has been attempting to pay the remaining balance. Quest is not accepting the EOB and has requested that ARM contact them directly. Follow-up needed to confirm whether the issue has been<a style="" target="_blank"> resolved.AC</a><br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-17 14:47:05', '2025-12-17 14:47:05'),
