  ('zcrm_1579374000176721019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165196002', 'Paul DiCicco', '12/17/25', '<br>Paul called requesting to be seen at Tri River Family Health Center. When he presented his insurance card, he was informed that they do not accept his plan. He asked that I verify whether the provider is in network.<br>I guided him to the MultiPlan website, where the facility is listed as participating. However, I also pointed out the disclaimer at the bottom of the page, which states that members must call to confirm participation, as providers have the final say on whether they participate in the network. Additionally, even if the provider is listed on the website, reimbursement cannot be guaranteed if the provider chooses to proceed.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-17 14:34:57', '2025-12-17 14:34:57'),
