  ('zcrm_1579374000176698311', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, '12/17/25<br>Elizabeth called in after having troubles linking up with the dr for telehealth video visit. I called her and then did a 3 way call with lyric directly and half way through we lost elizabeth on the call. Lyric is going to call her directly to get her linked up with the dr and before end of day if she does not call back i will f.u to make sure she spoke to someone or call lyric again with her if she has not. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-17 13:44:54', '2025-12-17 13:44:54'),
