  ('zcrm_1579374000176741013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164436001', 'Shelby Carter', NULL, '12-17-25 Hank and his wife chose to upgrade to Secure HSA bc they have a 12 month old who will be doing well checks and they do them too. Pediatric Partners shows up in the search but <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">Pediatric Partners is part of Valley View and they are not showing that they accept PHCS or Multiplan. They will call and find out. They upgraded for Jan. 1st at $1250/$817 MF. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-17 10:00:22', '2025-12-17 10:00:22'),
