  ('zcrm_1579374000176698083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125366002', 'Jorge Hernandez', NULL, '12/17/25<br>Sent Brenda a f/u message due to not being able to connect with her through phone call. Having issues calling out to her and will attempt later today but will also pursue communicating with her through text to update her on the questions she asked. She obviously asked multiple people here about this after checking the notes and speaking with Patti so i am just going to verify and repeat what everyone else has told her so far in that she has to re-enroll and unfortunately, the pre existing condition clause will re-start for her because they did not cancel properly and switch her membership. They did not answer Patti when she initially informed them of their membership canceling so their membership lapsed due to primary member aging into medicare. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-17 08:50:55', '2025-12-17 08:50:55'),
