  ('zcrm_1579374000176698042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082414002', 'Trinity Bieker', NULL, '12/17/25<br>Trinity reached out on salesIQ to request a new ID card since her wallet was stolen. I let her know that i ordered a new one to be shipped to her as well as guided her to her digital card in her app. After showing all of that i let her know if it is an emergency and she needs a card and can not access the digital one and does not have the physical one we could send her a temporary digital one. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-17 08:11:42', '2025-12-17 08:11:42'),
