  ('zcrm_1579374000176653069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154586421', 'Cody Rogers', NULL, '12-16-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">codylrgs@gmail.com just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 23:58:44', '2025-12-16 23:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176653062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005566009', 'Helen Gemmill', NULL, '12-16-25 Hello Wendy, <br><br>This request is complete. The member and family eligibility is scheduled to end 1/1/2026.<br><span><br></span><br>Kind regards, <br>LA WANDA OATES<br><b>CUSTOMER CARE COORDINATOR</b><br>800.606.1135<br>239.422.8482<br><span><a style="" target="_blank"> HealthAccessSolutions.com</a></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 23:48:18', '2025-12-16 23:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176653051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-16-25 Hi Wendy, <br>I looked into our records and Dave doesn''t need a colonoscopy until 2028 and I''m good until 2032 so we are going to stay with the current plan. <br>I think that you said that I don''t need to do anything if we are staying in the same plan?<br><br>I am also signing up for VSP today. <br><br>Thank you for all of your help every year!<br><br>Danna', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 23:28:55', '2025-12-16 23:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176653026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '12-16-25 Brian sat next to a woman who grew up with his sister who passed away. It''s approaching the anniversary of her passing and his sister and this woman were incredibly close friends. She''s the one friend that Brian had never met. He was in her seat at first by accident. Crazy small world!  <br>He wants to review his ins. He got a payout in 2025 from the passing of his sister. That was just completed and once he reports it to Medicaid he''ll have a life change event. So, we have until the end of the month to get him on for 2026 for C4. I have him scheduled for Friday but he''s flexible if we need to move the appt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 16:35:58', '2025-12-16 17:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176653021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033237', 'Isaac Perington', NULL, '12-16-25 Julie and I talked about the best option for Isaac and determined Care+ will suit him best for price and protection for accident, injury, illness and no wellness. He will likely go with $2500/$203 for Jan. 1st start date. I just sent him information to review and offered him a date to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 16:26:22', '2025-12-17 11:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176576502', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111778002', 'Lin Qian', NULL, '12/16/25<br>Lin called to get more info on her membership so i will send her the brochyure along with the price sheet. She also needed to open her zion portal so we called zion together to get that opened for her. Also she requested a proof of membership letter. I will send her taht attached in the email as well<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-16 14:57:16', '2025-12-16 14:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176576460', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166942005', 'Daniel Shawhan', NULL, '12/16/25<br>Daniel called to find out how to find things on the website and where to locate things. I gave him a basic tour and he was happy after that <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-16 14:55:36', '2025-12-16 14:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176576453', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160692002', 'Charles Ritenour', NULL, '12/16/25<br>charles called in to find out more about SNIP nutrition and how to access it so i walked him through how to find it and use it. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-16 14:54:30', '2025-12-16 14:54:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176593025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160692002', 'Charles Ritenour', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4680 Question : i''m trying to schedule an annual physical for myself. The first few doctor offices i tried calling require a Meet and Greet Apt before i can have a physical appointment. Is there a doctor''s office that doesn''t require an initial apt to be able to make a physical apt?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-16 14:53:21', '2025-12-16 14:53:21'),
