  ('zcrm_1579374000176653009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143664002', 'Mary Ellen Francescani', NULL, '12-16-25 Mary Ellen chose to upgrade to Secure HSA for Jan. 1st. She will set up a HSA as well and maximize that. She''s bummed to lose the HAB for the mental health benefits and everything else. All set for now. I checked and an see her submission for the upgrade.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-16 14:28:36', '2025-12-16 14:28:36'),
