  ('zcrm_1579374000176480113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137618019', 'Jared Kaban', NULL, '12.16.25 - Risa called stating that Zion is rejecting all of her bills, from what she described they seem as alternative care in nature. Zion is also treating her headaches and achilies heel as a pre-x, but she states she''s never had those sympton and is upset that none of her bills are getting covered. Jared had a colonoscopy, but they were not able to submit the bills within the 6 month time frame due to a death in the family. The Zion Rep told her that it should not be a problem, but it was denied anyway. I advised that she can appeal. Will contact Rachelle for further details and instructions. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-16 07:56:59', '2025-12-16 07:56:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176550017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141699001', 'James Grose', NULL, '12/16/25 - Responded to vm message regarding a diabetes prevention program covered in their insurance. Unfortunately, it is not covered. Suggested a local hospital offering such service at no cost. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-16 07:56:21', '2025-12-16 07:56:21'),
