  ('zcrm_1579374000176473269', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175187153', 'Amy Anderson', NULL, '12-15-25 Call 844-833-8440 or go to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://directvisioninsurance.com/"><u>https://directvisioninsurance.com</u></a><br>Dear Amy Anderson,<br>Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a> or e-mail us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a>. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.<br>Here is what you need to know.<br><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in the P rimary Applicant section. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN. Please note: While your vision insurance is effective on the date noted below, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in the system through the network providers. Please make sure your provider is able to verify benefits before you schedule an appointment.  <br><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For billing information and ID cards, please register for your Ameritas Member Portal A