;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have a VSP policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your VSP Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN. Create an account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__track.smtpsendmail.com_6009018_c-3Fp-3D0ZZO-25204-2Daoj0J2weEjP7jczr1Iyj5MzoDhp9I-2D3DAETqyp-2DI4SAyAROHteL77He2IA5E3ovU-5FavDJY-5FYmuSK6bZfa5JyKcK0VyKG0Bg-2Dm4uSmp9AumF7dbITWvDjL0xWH51aaIa-5FIYm797Ut7Kz3WxZ-5FfDDBY7fbn51uicFMf1il4-3D&amp;d=DwMCAg&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=pGc8Rudk_ymVZbf4OU1cpCAFI-O5y8myvw-YLKRzwDQnEzxtt9fe9PY95Ix7hB1j&amp;s=EKotSh1HLsA4NXlIkNV6Zxo4zqHeTKknLoWCP6rVvIs&amp;e="><u>www.vsp.com</u></a></p></li></ul><b>Ameritas </b>(ID cards and billing):<br>5900 O Street Lincoln, NE 68510<br>Customer Service 866-619-6095<br>Fax: 402-309-2598<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com"><u>SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com</u></a><br><b>EyeMed</b> (verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-521-3605<br><b>VSP </b>(verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-877-7195<br>Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a sepa rate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. <br>Your specific coverage information is as follows:<br><br>Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan A<br>Who’s covered: Applicant<br>Effective Date: 12/16/2025<br>Carrier: Ameritas<br>Monthly Charge: <b>$15.97</b><br><br>Policy Number: <b>300173078</b><br>Agent Info: <b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b> <br>Questions? Call (844)833-8440', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-15 23:57:25', '2025-12-15 23:57:25'),
