  ('zcrm_1579374000176473075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154481297', 'Lisa Rediger', NULL, '12-15-25 Lisa wants the RMHP Valley CO Option Gold and just needs to get their address changed. One said Rd and the other said Road for their address which put them in 2 different households for years. She called C4 to get it fixed and here''s what she says. I''ll email a response to her.<br><span><br></span><span style="color:rgb(100, 100, 100);background-color:rgb(218, 235, 250);">I called, got the address updated and she just went ahead and enrolled me. Will my automatic withdrawal still apply or is there something I need to do? Happy December 15!</span><br><span style="color:rgb(100, 100, 100);background-color:rgb(218, 235, 250);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(100, 100, 100);background-color:rgb(218, 235, 250);"><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-15 12:36:48', '2025-12-15 12:36:48'),
