  ('zcrm_1579374000176480052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', NULL, '12.15.25 Assisted with APP log in, and provider search. Advsied to ensure provider is withing PHCS prior to care. Zion Healthshare request denied for back paid, transferred to Zion for an explanation. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-15 12:34:45', '2025-12-15 12:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176452209', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130459001', 'Karin Fourie', NULL, '12/15/25<br>Karin reached out on salesIQ to ask what preventative is covered and to see what to do in order to get an annual visit,bloodowork, and a mammo. I walked her through the process and going to her primary to get the mammo ordered and the bloodwork. I checked for her dr and the dr was in network so i let her know to double check with the provider taht they are still in PHCS and then she can proceed from there. Also let her know to reach out if she needs help with any of that<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-15 12:33:26', '2025-12-15 15:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176422005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169910081', 'John Carlock', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4662 Question : I have a procedure coming up in January and I need to know what I need to do to see if I can have the costs shared.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-15 12:31:30', '2025-12-15 12:31:30'),
