  ('zcrm_1579374000176473065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175646163', 'Rivers Rothkamp', NULL, '12-15-25 Angie called back and wants to pause to figure out more of the unknowns. She''s still a member with MPB. She can wait until Jan. 15th for a Feb. 1st start date with C4. She can get onto her school''s plan until April is she wants. If she''s on her school''s plan then she will have a SEP to join at that time. Her income will be higher likely but she may also be ready to do the surgery. Rivers can''t decide if she even wants the surgery bc she''s trying to figure out what she wants to do after she graduates. She has many decisions to make. Nobody has been able to help her with her hip dysplasia. Angie might try calling Donald Kipp to see if that''s a viable route or not. She''s be in touch with me soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-15 12:08:18', '2025-12-15 12:08:18'),
