  ('zcrm_1579374000176440024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155365021', 'Scott Trossen', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to chage IUA to $2500 frm $5000 eff 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-15 07:16:15', '2025-12-15 07:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176440014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104184', '(Ronald) Shaefer Welch', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-15 07:10:45', '2025-12-15 07:10:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176437017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176224002', 'chad landwehr', 'Member & Family $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-15 07:09:06', '2025-12-15 07:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176440001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104184', '(Ronald) Shaefer Welch', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse eff 1/1/26 due to her getting Employer Coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-15 07:06:40', '2025-12-15 07:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176437006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176391010', 'Paul Scriffiny', 'Member & Children $2500 IUA Secure HSA + Tobacco', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-15 06:59:21', '2025-12-15 07:03:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176437001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173757019', 'Heidi Queen', NULL, 'Member left voicemail after hours on Sunday  12/14 stating she needs to cancel her Membership and did not receive the cancellation link.  I resent her the one that I emailed on 12/4 to the email address on file, which is different than the one she requested it to be sent to via the voicemail.  I will follow up with a call to her this afternoon in CA.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-15 06:53:15', '2025-12-15 06:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176392021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '12/12/25<br>Spoke to anna about her cancer diagnosis and let her know the process from here.Informed her she would need to get any bills that are related to this, a treatment plan, and any good faith estimates for upcoming procedures. After that then she can get her share request going and pay her IUA. Also let her know we are here to help through this process and also sent her a proof of membership letter like she requested.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-14 10:54:43', '2025-12-14 10:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176392016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158820002', 'William Whitehead', NULL, '12/12/25<br><span><br></span>Continued answering questions about receipts and how to get them and made sure he got his proof of membership and receipts i sent him.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-14 10:52:16', '2025-12-14 10:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176392001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173156001', 'David Schwank', NULL, '12/12/25<br>Called jill back after she called in and spoke to susan. I updated her letting her know herOB/GYN is in network but i could not reach Dr Hess. This is not a problem due to OB/GYN being an MD and can take care of the primary care needs so she might not need to go to Dr. hess anymore since she was only going to him for an annual visit and she can get everything done at one place with DR asher(OB/GYN)<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-14 09:39:07', '2025-12-14 09:39:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266303', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176910001', 'Kate Spencer', NULL, '12-12-25 Kate and James Spencer are both 43 and both self-employed. They have a 5 and 8 year old. They have a RMHP Bronze plan now that''s in the $900''s but will be going up to $2000''s in 2026. She''s always been curious about health shares but never felt the need to take the plunge since they were getting good subsidies still. Now that their cost is going up dramatically they are totally open to it. She also explores Christian Healthshare Ministeries. Her husband likes the concept of  having the PHCS network. However, it''s not good up there. Cash pay will be way better. Also CHSM is $287 per family member = $1148. MPB is a little cheaper and removes the network limitations. Dave has gurd and uses an inhaler. That''s it for pre-x for the entire family. No tobacco, yes for supplements. T.hey are interested in Secure HSA or Premium HSA with Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 23:20:18', '2025-12-18 10:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266293', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071198', 'John Tompkins', NULL, '12-12-25 Izzy called and wants to nail down the price of her meds. She has 4. She really wants to use the drug program with the MEC. Now looking at my notes I see the costs were cheaper than most any drug program. I forgot we went through this already. Ugh... I''ll send her my resources while I wait for Julia to provide the drug list.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 23:07:38', '2025-12-12 23:07:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266266', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '12-12-25 Lisa and I talked many times bc she''s really not pleased with her options. So, I think she was hoping for some magic to happen. She doesn''t want RMHP ever again bc of they way they treated her with her one health issue. However, she wanted to keep Dr. Zoya Karimov and Dr.  Deepthi Kagolan. The internal dr. was not showing up in any plans except RMHP. So, she will have to find a new one which she is super bummed about. After much go around she finally chose the Anthem CO Option Gold Pathway Essentials. This gives her the free mental health that she also wants. It gives her some co-pays for Dr. visits and labs but not for imaging or scans. She''s nervous about that part costing a lot. She likes the idea of MCS but since she has something going on right now it''s not a good idea. She watched the 9 min video and my interview with Cory. She gave me the ultimate compliment saying she was surprised that I appear so much younger than she thought.... She thought I look like I''m in my 30''s! Woot, woot! She made my day. She''s all set for now once she pays. <br>OH, we also selected the Delta Dental Clear Plan for $62 a month. She needs 3 cleanings per year and perhaps fillings, etc. She couldn''t load the details on her phone and she doesn''t have a computer. So, I shared them as best as I could and enrolled for her. She paid with a credit card and has a Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:58:47', '2025-12-12 22:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266261', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176266236', 'Barbara Colombo', NULL, '12-12-25 Barb enrolled successfully into Secure HSA. I believe she chose $1250/$448. All set for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:49:43', '2025-12-12 22:49:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266231', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176473019', 'Joe Wolfson', NULL, '12-12-25 We discussed Secure HSA or Care+ since he''s in FL. He had an ER visit after a concussion for jujitsu accident and had a panic attack. He also likes to use the chiro bc of his activities. Joe will be 34 soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:47:18', '2025-12-12 22:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176473019', 'Joe Wolfson', NULL, '12-12-25 Alan and Joe seem to be confused by our conversation. I''ve responded accordingly. But, here''s where they stand until they understand there''s no additional $290 for wellness!<br><span><br></span>Wendy – thank you for being so generous with your time. Joe has decided to stick with the ACA plan. He is concerned about being rushed to a decision, and important factors were the updated pricing and the $290 per month Wellness charges, which we weren’t previously aware of. Nonetheless, we are appreciative for the time you devoted to working with us, and will keep you in mind as the future unfolds.<br>Al Wolfson', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:39:01', '2025-12-12 22:39:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176473019', 'Joe Wolfson', NULL, '12-12-25 Joe is 33.  This is from Alan, Joe''s father.<br>Wendy – I watched the video. I’ve heard of cost – sharing plans in the past. It would be a radical departure for Joe, to be sure. Having coverage is very important to him, but he has been reluctant to move away from the ObamaCare platform out of fear that the alternative coverage would not be there when he needed it. However, his current plan is very costly, and appears to about to become significantly costlier yet.<br>As it happens, Joe is very healthy. He is 33 years old, is single, stands about 6’ tall, and weighs about 200 pounds. He works out at a gym three times a week, is an avid bike rider, and is an enthusiastic purple belt in Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.<br>As to pre-existing conditions, Joe was diagnosed with bipolar disorder at the age of 18. He had various manic episodes over the ensuing 7 years or so. However, with our support, he has weathered that storm, and hasn’t had an episode for the past 7-8 years. He manages his illness, takes his medication, and has ongoing relationships with his PCP, a counselor, and a psychiatrist. Our formal parental support has largely ceased, and Joe has taken complete responsibility for managing his illness himself.<br>Joe has a moving business, Acceleration Moving Solutions, LLC, which he manages as a sole proprietor. He started the business about ten years ago. He has no formal employees, but rather a group of independent contractors. The business has three trucks. He is a meticulous and careful businessman, and derives a significant  portion of his moves from repeat customers and referrals.<br>I listened to the video with great interest. <u>He would be most concerned about the coverage being there when he needed it. </u> That is an issue which I’m sure he’ll bring up during the conversation. I would think he’d also like to know how it works, and how easy it would be to utilize and manage. I’m sure he’ll want to know how long this plan has been operatiing, how many members there are, whether it is in good standing legally, and what threats to its business model there have been or might be. Based on his fact pattern, he’ll want to get an idea of what this will cost him each year. I’d like him to go through the video prior to our meeting tomorrow, but he might not be able to do that. Regardless, I will take him through it after, if not able to before.<br>I just thought I’d send this to you in anticipation of our discussion tomorrow. We’ll look forward to your call at 1PM EST tomorrow.<br>Thanks,<br>Al Wolfson<br>941-400-5003<br>Joe Wolfson<br>941-504-6152', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:37:34', '2025-12-12 22:37:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '<span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">12-12-25 Julie called bc she wants to know how to Isaac. She believes he has HAB that''s ending. But, she says he''s paying $200 per month for his membership. He might have gotten a membership directly with Zion bc his age group it looks like $219 /1250 for 2026. I don''t show him as having MPB or HAB.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:28:32', '2025-12-12 22:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033237', 'Isaac Perington', NULL, '12-12-25 Julie called bc she wants to know how to Isaac. She believes he has HAB that''s ending. But, she says he''s paying $200 per month for his membership. He might have gotten a membership directly with Zion bc his age group it looks like $219 /1250 for 2026. I don''t show him as having MPB or HAB. He''s living in Bozeman, MT. Sounds like he has allergies and some ear issues.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:27:55', '2025-12-12 22:30:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '12-11-25 Anna called distraught with a new and scary diagnosis of breast cancer. It''s stage 1, so hopefully super manageable. She wanted to know the process for how to handle this. I coached her and she''ll work with the Concierge Team. Ugh... She was so appreciative of my support.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 22:21:18', '2025-12-12 22:21:18'),
