  ('zcrm_1579374000176266128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '12-12-25 Lorie chose the same plan for the entire family. But, Stephen T and Christian are 26 and 28. They need to be on their own plans. So, we did 3 groups to accommodate the entire family. They are set for 2026 once they make their binder payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 20:44:39', '2025-12-12 20:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '12-12-25 Order Details<br>Purchases:<br>LifeX Cigna EPO $500 Deductible<br>Active Date: January 1, 2026<br>Research Associate Name:<br>Clara Pickell<br>Research Associate ID:<br>686010179<br>First Billing Date:<br>December 11, 2025<br>Second Draft Date:<br>January 15, 2026<br>Completed!<br>The following member has completed the signature documents for their LifeX employment.<br><br>Name: Clara Pickell<br>Member ID: 686010179<br><br><b>Important Reminders</b><br>Once the first payment has been made successfully, the Research Association will be sent to Benefit Health Plan Inc within 3 business days. Approximately 1 day before the effective date a welcome email will be sent to the Research Associate giving them access to their Personal Health Dashboard (PHD) which will have their temporary medical ID card, contact information, health plan information, and benefits access. The Research Associate will be able to use their benefits immediately on the effective date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 18:36:14', '2025-12-12 18:36:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168356026', 'Heidi Kloser', NULL, '12-12-25 Heidi chose the gold plan for $1 but now her ded and mop are significantly higher. I''m making sure that''s what she really wants.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 17:09:55', '2025-12-12 17:09:55'),
