  ('zcrm_1579374000176266108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '12-12-25 Lorie will search for hospitals via the carrier websites to see if the hospitals they want will be in the networks for the plans they are contemplating. Hopefully it works for her for the Anthem Essentials plan. That''s what they''ll probably choose. She will text me with her decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 17:02:26', '2025-12-12 17:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176273028', 'Dawson Wetlaufer', NULL, '12-12-25 Dawson enrolled through his employer Daniel Sorcinelli. Employer is paying. He chose Care+ for $1250/$268 for Jan. 1st start date. He travels a bit as well. He''s from Iowa. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 16:51:50', '2025-12-12 16:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176283069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '12.12.25 Member was advised via text the best way to handle bills with Zion is to obtain a bill or a good faith estimate and submit it to the member portal for payment. This is not insurance and the hospital can not call Zion or MPB for prior authorization. The Concierge can not log into his chart with the doctor or Zion portal to upload the bills on his behalf. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-12 15:10:29', '2025-12-12 15:10:29'),
