  ('zcrm_1579374000176231253', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130797002', 'Ashley Bryant', NULL, 'Susan asked me to handle this member as she had questions about her HSA.  I spoke to her and she said that she had gone through some paperwork and that her account had been through "someone else".  So she has been taken care of.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-12 14:15:10', '2025-12-12 14:15:10'),
