  ('zcrm_1579374000176266051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165320', 'Sherry Remick', NULL, '12-12-25 She kept her income at $32K. She lost her ESL classes that she was teaching since the tariffs went into place. It was mostly Chinese students. The classes have disappeared. It was a toss up between the Cigna Gold and Bronze $0 ded. She went with the bronze to save a little money. We will have to hike together again soon too! All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 12:40:43', '2025-12-12 12:40:43'),
