  ('zcrm_1579374000176228332', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175404001', 'Jonathan Hicklin', 'Decline of Enrollment Fee $125', '12/12- STM regarding the decline.  He has a filter on this bank account and the transaction has to be approved.  Said it is OK to rerun payment and he will approve it for this transaction, an for all future transactions.  Asked me to send them the Payment Update Form to have on hand if they want to change the payment method.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-12 12:04:57', '2025-12-12 12:04:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176231207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, 'Members spouse submitted update address form this has been processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-12 12:00:33', '2025-12-12 12:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176252158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '12/12/25<br>Scott called in a little upset because he said he got wrong info from concierge. He was under the understandgin that they could go to a dermatologist to get a visual check as long as no biopsies or anything else was done other than a visual check. I let him know you can get a visual check when you go for your yearly physical but unfortunately going to a dermatologist is a specialist so the visit would not be covered and would be out of pocket. He thought since a gastro dr does your colo then a dermatologist should be able to do a visual check fo ryou. I let him know i understand but we use the ACA guidelines for what is included for preventative care and that is all dictated by ARM since they pay the bills. Let him know i would update the team and make sure all info is the same that we give to members from all of us on concierge.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-12 11:50:45', '2025-12-12 11:50:45'),
