  ('zcrm_1579374000176283047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949002', 'Jay Andre', NULL, '12.12.25 Member stated that he still did not receive reimbursement for the 1st bill. I could not find it in the mailbox, and asked him to resend to send to ARM. He also received an additional bill for blood work - that he will send. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-12 11:21:11', '2025-12-12 11:21:11'),
