  ('zcrm_1579374000176266036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '12-12-25 Merryl upgraded her membership from Premium Care to Premium HSA. She completed the form just now and will pay $363/$1000. She looked at ACA in NC and it was going to be $800-$900 a month. So, she''ll stay put. She was super confused by HAB and the co-op. She said the price was $250 which doesn''t seem accurate but it didn''t include any wellness that she wants. She''s happy now and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 10:27:46', '2025-12-12 10:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176283042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, '12.12.25 - Sent change of address form and confirmed that nothing changes on her members (new since she had to re-enroll) due to husband aging out. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-12 10:19:43', '2025-12-12 10:19:43'),
