  ('zcrm_1579374000176283025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149941002', 'Brian Erickson', NULL, '12.12.25 - Julie has a colo scheduled, but the doctor never heard of MPB. Advised to see if they are in the PHCS network and balance billing. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-12 09:58:37', '2025-12-12 09:58:37'),
