  ('zcrm_1579374000176283017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '12.12.25 - ARM sent the bill for pediatric care to the doctors office, instead of the member (reimbursement). The pediatrician stated they did not receive it, but do not check the mail. Advised the member to ask them to check and call us back in the event they still do not have it. Jennifer also had shingles and went to a naturapathic doctor for treatment, advised to open a sharing request for determination. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-12 09:48:46', '2025-12-12 09:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176252077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141795002', 'Stephen Hillmer', NULL, '12/12/25<br>Called to see if Stephen filled out the new PHI form and sent it in to Sedera so Julia can speak with them in order to assist with his appeal. He did not answer so i left a VM and will try again later<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-12 09:42:43', '2025-12-12 09:42:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176266031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '12-12-25 Left vm for Cynthia to confirm her question in her email. Account looks all set with Cigna again per her request.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 09:40:55', '2025-12-12 09:40:55'),
