  ('zcrm_1579374000176252064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176147007', 'Kelly Wilhelm', NULL, '12/12/25<br>Called kelly back to help answer some lingering questions she had and i helped educate her on the membership and how everything works. She was happy after we spoke and felt more comfortable with her choice to join us<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-12 09:38:45', '2025-12-12 09:38:45'),
