  ('zcrm_1579374000176266026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '12-12-25 The Select Health plan gives her way more benefits with co-pays than her previous plan that was going to cost her about $150 or so. I forget already. But this will give her co-pays. We adjusted her income from $39,300 to $41,000 for 2026. She doesn''t want to owe money at the end of the year. She was super sweet and appreciative. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-12 09:27:06', '2025-12-12 09:27:06'),
