  ('zcrm_1579374000176228001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176147007', 'Kelly Wilhelm', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-12 06:29:02', '2025-12-12 06:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175892226', 'Jacob Bosse', NULL, '12-11-25 Jacob is all set.<br><br>He went with the Gold CO Opt Anthem plan &amp; did want to add the Anthem dental cheap plan.  (We walked through it &amp; that was important to him -- even w/discussion.)  <br><br>He may add vision later (which the site says he can do anytime of year) at the phone number on Connect for Health''s website w/same day coverage.<br><br>His small business employer (max 15 employees) is looking to provide healthcare at some point.  We talked about what happens if their plan is considered "affordable" regarding subsidies, etc.  He understands it''ll be important to be aware of the implications.  We talked about being proactive and dovetailing the cancellation if/when he learns about his employer''s choice and that start date.<br><br>Anyway, I think he''s set for now.  He gets paid on the 17th &amp; knows he must go in &amp; pay or he could be stuck with a later effective date than his 1/1/2025 choice, or miss open enrollment altogether if he somehow forgot to "pay later".<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 22:04:44', '2025-12-11 22:04:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153956002', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '12-11-25 Jenny got nervous because she has some allergy stuff, ear stuff, etc. that she might need support for. I let her know pre-x is shareable up to $25K in her 2nd year. We''re weeks away from that and she had no idea about the tiered sharing anymore. She was relived. However, I will look up what it says about allergies and send it to her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 17:27:30', '2025-12-11 17:27:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128033', 'Stephen Whitelande', NULL, '12-11-25 Emma is enrolling in Secure HSA EF $1250/$817. Using EIN for self-employment with Stephen who is the business owner. Jan. 1st effective date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 17:12:15', '2025-12-11 17:14:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '12-11-25 Completed LX app for $500 ded and $889 per month. Clara will complete the questionnaires. They submitted their cc to pay, chose email for communications and physical card. Jan. 1st, 2026 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 16:28:14', '2025-12-11 16:28:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128033', 'Stephen Whitelande', NULL, '12-11-25 I will call Emma at 5:00 to help her enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 15:34:20', '2025-12-11 15:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176266236', 'Barbara Colombo', NULL, '12-11-25  Turns out Barb I know from BSU!  It just hit me as we were talking once I learned she''s in Boulder. Crazy small world. She hosted Eduardo and us at her house for a class. She''s paying $825 for her Kaiser plan with $8500 ded and $9700 mop. She barely ever goes to the drs., no meds, no tobacco. She takes HRT and pays for that on her own. She does some wellness like mammo. She had her friend Theresa join the call to help her. Theresa will explain how HSA works. Barb is leaning towards Secure HSA since she likes alternative care options. She earns to much for an APTC. She knows she has to decide by Dec. 15th for C4. So, she will let me know her decision before then via phone or email. She thought she recognized me as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 15:29:35', '2025-12-11 15:29:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176181006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', '12/11', 'got him logged into app, telehealth was glitching (lyric''s fault, they will email me when resolved) got lyric to schedule potential virtual primary care visit so steve can get his medication (visit will be confirmed most likely from monday 12/15 10am-3pm est.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-11 15:20:58', '2025-12-11 15:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176181001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135244018', 'Ross Muscolino', '12/11', 'basically gave nevada a welcome call, and sent her email with member guidelines, got her logged into app and explained how to use network search (emailed her link for search with instructions) and basically explained whole plan.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-11 15:19:24', '2025-12-11 15:19:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176122061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069918001', 'Joseph Hatch', NULL, '12/11/25<br>helped annie with letting her know what to do for a share request. She has an upcoming orthopedic procedure so i let her know she would be able to pay the IUA to zion in order to get the procedure going since zion will begin paying the providers directly<br>aJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 15:05:23', '2025-12-15 12:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176122056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176073001', 'Dustin Holcomb', NULL, '12/11/25<br>answered his call but nothing was said when i greeted him so i do not think the connection was good<br>aJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 15:03:09', '2025-12-11 15:03:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176122051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163033002', 'Rhyan Hauter-Sims', NULL, '12/11/25<br>She sent a message back saying she needs to start a new request but is having trouble since the old one os still going but the pregnancy failed. now she is pregnant again. i gave her the number to zion and let her know we can call with her if she needs to get them to stop the old request so she can start a new one<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 15:02:25', '2025-12-11 15:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176122046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161633002', 'Daniel Tomkinson', NULL, '12/11/25<br>Answered his questions about what to do for a share request<br>aJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 15:00:42', '2025-12-11 15:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176178001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173862004', 'Krystii Melaine', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4640 Question : Hello, I have new coverage and I think it has discounts on vitamins, but I can''t find where to shop for those discounted vitamins.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-11 14:58:41', '2025-12-11 14:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176122038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158820002', 'William Whitehead', NULL, '12/11/25<br>Answered bills email about what is tax deductible in his membership<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 14:57:58', '2025-12-11 14:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176120066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064218045', 'Eric Lipp', NULL, '12.11.25 - Spoke with Rachelle from Planstin. Zion is waiting on the doctor to send medical records, and the doctor is taking a long time to provide. Both parties advised Steve that the fastest way to obtain them would be to request them directly from the doctor. Zion is only communicating to the members via email moving forward. Eric had a concern of having the need to request payment for a procedure that he needs to receive every 6 months. Advised him that the best way to move forward would be to obtain a good faith estimate in the future and submit to Zion before hand. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-11 14:42:41', '2025-12-11 14:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-11-25 Rob wants to keep his drs. He has 6 and they are in the Pathway plans, not Essentials. He didn''t want the Mountain Enhanced plans since he was only given 11 of his 20 PT appointments bc some 3rd party connected with Anthem told him he doesn''t need them even though his surgeon wrote a very strong letter requesting them. So ridiculous!  He wants to fund the HSA and knows all bronze plans are compliant. But, he prefers to bring his mop down to $8300 or $16,600 instead of $21K!  He''s all set for 2026.  He put their income at $103K. He can do so by depreciating.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 14:36:33', '2025-12-11 14:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176137009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-11-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Robert Mitchell, Samuel Mitchell, Marjorie Mitchell</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Bronze Pathway 8300 for HSA</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$16,600</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$16,600</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$0 (after deductible)</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$1,027.02 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after $1,954.55 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 6900990048</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/11/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 14:32:29', '2025-12-11 14:32:29'),
