  ('zcrm_1579374000176137001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128017', 'Kelly Locke', NULL, '12-11-25 Kelly and Karen are choosing Premium HSA $1500/$895. They chose this due to no limitations on sharing year 4 and beyond. They are less concerned about alternative. They are including their 20 year old daughter named Kira. Karen just takes meds for thyroid, constipation and hormones.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 13:31:06', '2025-12-11 13:31:45'),
