  ('zcrm_1579374000176098012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '12/11/25<br>Sent email to follow up on eap reinburmenst AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 13:00:36', '2025-12-11 13:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176096006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176230002', 'Michael Lowe', NULL, '12-11-25 Mike came to me via Andrew Chapman. He''s 58 and lives in Glenwood Springs, CO. He''s solo. He''s a teacher for CO River something. He''s at a conference right now in TN. He''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds and no wellness, no desire for colonoscopy. He prefers a mix of alternative and traditional with a leaning towards traditional. His ins was $1250 a month last year! He had melanoma and it''s completed removed. This happened in Sept. 2025 and follow up Nov. 2025. It''s 100% removed. He understands pre-x clause. He makes about $90K. But, he brings in about $12K her month but has a huge mortgage and expenses, so he can''t afford $1250 a month and 10K mop, etc. He wants to enroll in Care+ and we will get it done tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 12:59:33', '2025-12-11 12:59:33'),
