  ('zcrm_1579374000176012126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176137034', 'Clara Pickell', NULL, '12-11-25 Clara and her husband will review the LX $500-$1500 ded options and the Care+ since they don''t bother with wellness visits. Actually Premium Care looks a little cheaper and includes mammo and colonoscopy which sounds like it doesn''t matter to them. Husband has high blood pressure but that''s it for both of them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 12:22:26', '2025-12-11 12:22:26'),
