  ('zcrm_1579374000176012104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142598002', 'Heather Bingaman', NULL, '12-11-25 Heather wants to upgrade to Secure HSA. She also just enrolled in Delta Dental with her girls for Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 11:46:42', '2025-12-11 11:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176012099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078963251', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, '12-11-25 Denise called C4 and got her address changed to her new address with Zip code 80118. We found the RMHP she has now and would like to keep since it has co-pays for Dr. visits. The cheaper one she chose included nothing until she spent $10K. She''s happier with this plan and ok with spending the $231.43 for 2026 at $45K income.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 11:42:17', '2025-12-11 11:42:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000176043020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173156001', 'David Schwank', NULL, '12/11//25<br>The OBGYN Jill wanted to know about is in network Dr Majdouline. I am still working on finding out if Dr, Hess is but the OB/GYN i think was more important to her and i will update Jill with that since she can probably get the primary care done there with the OB/GYN since she is a MD.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-11 11:39:16', '2025-12-11 11:39:16'),
