  ('zcrm_1579374000176012022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176042001', 'Harry Bowers II', NULL, '12-10-25 Melissa went had a bunch of MRIs to make sure everything in her neck is looking good. They aren''t doing the brain scan bc that''s too many at once. They are confident nothing is going to be  a problem. If so, we put Melissa as secondary and we can remove her next year if need be. I told her to double check with her doctor about if she got hurt during ski accident if that will be connected to the neck issue as pre-x. UPDATE, Melissa decided to go onto C4 instead to be safe with her neck stuff. There''s a RMHP CO Option Gold for 2026<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-11 09:19:37', '2025-12-11 09:56:14'),
