  ('zcrm_1579374000176006001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172698008', 'Teresa Hubbard', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know if it is OK to change her start date from Jan 1 2026 to Feb 1 2026.  She also was inquiring about changing her IUA level. I told her it is best to speak with her Advisor about any plan changes.  I am sending her the Member Change Form because she definitely wants to change the start date.  Told her to submit that before the 19th so we do not bill her for January.  She will speak with the Advisor to review the IUA changes.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-11 07:56:44', '2025-12-11 07:56:44'),
