  ('zcrm_1579374000175892292', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175892262', 'Michelle Zlakowski', NULL, '12-10-25 <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://michelle.zlakowski@gmail.com/"><u>michelle.zlakowski@gmail.com</u></a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.<br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 23:39:57', '2025-12-10 23:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892216', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060863094', 'Jenn Dempsey', NULL, '12-10-25 <br><p style="">Dear <span style=" margin-inline-start:20px;">Wendy Scipione</span>,</p><p style="">Jennifer Dempsey has asked that you no longer work on his or her behalf to purchase insurance through Connect for Health Colorado®.</p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 23:16:55', '2025-12-10 23:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175892179', 'Ann Winslow', NULL, '12-10-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br>I wanted to let you know that I accepted a full-time position with my contract client today, and thankfully they provide health benefits.<br>I will keep your name on file, but need to cancel our appt tomorrow.<br><br>Thank you,<br>Ann', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 23:15:19', '2025-12-10 23:15:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175892179', 'Ann Winslow', NULL, '11-24-25 Hi Wendy,<br>I got your name from Emily Cope, and I''m wondering if you are still helping people get health insurance. I''m an independent contractor and don''t love my current plan.<br><br>Thank you,<br>Ann Winslow<br>720-272-1523', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 23:15:04', '2025-12-10 23:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007131', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '12-10-25 See other account for current info.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 22:27:52', '2025-12-10 22:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442195', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '12-10-25 Hello from the snowy midwest! Hoping you''ve gotten some of the white stuff. Ok, it''s official. Moving forward with leaving my position effective March 31. For timing purposes, what is the best time to let you/team know and move forward with MPowering Benefits again? Please advise. Thanks so much. kas<br><br>--<br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Kristin Smith, MPH</span><br><a style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:kristin.smith12@gmail.com"><u>kristin.smith12@gmail.com</u></a><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">612-803-2543</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 22:26:55', '2025-12-10 22:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '12-10-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">William Bjornholm, Cynthia Franceus</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$1,900</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$6,700</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>$306.55 /month </b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">after $2,106.94 financial help</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 5490038360</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/10/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 22:17:33', '2025-12-10 22:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '12-10-25 Hi Wendy,<br><br>We looked more closely at the Kaiser plan and it''s not going to work for us.<br><br>Can we switch back to the Cigna plan we were on?  <br><br>We did make a payment to Kaiser but since it''s not the 15th yet can we switch? <br><br>Kaiser has no oncologists in their network and I am a cancer survivor<br><br>Thank you<br>Cynthia', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 21:59:53', '2025-12-10 21:59:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176734033', 'Monique Cardillo', NULL, '12-10-25 Monique is the girlfriend of Jacob Cook. She is 35 and will be living in Jackson Hole, WY. She''s healthy, no tobacco, no meds. She''s mostly W2 employee. She does some yoga teaching on the side. She wants the wellness screenings to be included possibly for pap screening. She will review Care+ and Secure HSA and we are meeting next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 20:54:49', '2025-12-10 20:54:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175892091', 'Deborah Cook', NULL, '12-10-25 Deb Cook came to me via Krista Rogers. Deb also lives in NM. But, she''s calling to help her 26 year old son get set up since he''ll be turning 26 in Feb. I have all of his notes on under Jacob Cook. After I helped Jacob enroll and gave proper credit to Krista Rogers then Jake referred his girlfriend who was there as well. She might want to join. She''s 35. They will both be living in Jackson Hole, WY. But, I let him know he will get a $100 referral payment for referring Monique. He was super psyched. Then after all of that Deb asked about the removal of the $100 enrollment fee that Leo had mentioned when he spoke with her on the 1 day that was Live. UGH! I had to break it to her that is not available and was a mistake. It was very unfortunate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 20:50:36', '2025-12-10 20:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, '12-10-25 Bruce wants to understand the option of including the MEC for an extra $64. He''s a member of Nextera who was just bought by Kerix. Due to the change he''s now charged $600 2x per year for hormone treatment. However he said he doesn''t have a Dr. visit and the hormone cream is an additional $150. So, he wasn''t able to tell me what the $600 was really for. If he can get an itemized bill he might be able to submit it as a new Need since it really costs $750 and will be ongoing 2x a year. He was also wanting to do the math to see if adding the MEC will make sense financially. He doesn''t need  a colonoscopy any time soon and most of his wellness is done through Nextera. So, he''ll review the ACA wellness benefits and decide if it''s worth it or not. He says he''s not in a high tax bracket. So, may not be worthwhile. He was then VERY complimentary of my knowledge and professionalism. He super appreciates my call back as always. He mentioned Mark Cuban''s site for good prices on meds for some things. He''s 63 and will be on Medicare not too long from now. He totally appreciates the amount of care and savings he''s had with my help and MPB. He was also amazed by the lowering of the price back in June for 2025-2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 19:56:05', '2025-12-10 19:56:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '12-10-25 Eric called and asked a bunch of questions about upgrading to Premium HSA and what''s included. Jill is really wanting dr. visits. Adding Redirect will be $271 a month. She gets sinus infections about 2X per year and wants to be able to do that. The math makes no sense to do so. He will discuss with Jill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 16:31:17', '2025-12-10 16:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175892013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176443053', 'Lisa LeVerrier', NULL, '12-10-25 Lisa added David to the call and he asked his questions. They are all set with colonoscopies for many years. David needs one in 4 years maybe. He''s planning to do Cologuard in the meantime. He has skin dermatitis and unders the pre-x clause. He also mentioned ADHD. They will call their doctors to see if they accept the PHCS/MultiPlan PPO network. I found Dr. Pezzullo-Burgs in the PHCS network. I have not found Dr. Trivedi or Dr. Rogovin. She will inquire. We will talk on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 15:47:06', '2025-12-10 15:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175939065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109795001', 'Elise Schadauer', '12/10 Elise returned my call', 'I spoke to Elise today about aging out. She will not be converting to  our Essentials membership. She will process the cancellation in January per Michele''s email to her.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-12-10 15:45:27', '2025-12-10 15:46:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175939060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772201', 'Adlai McMahon', NULL, '12-10-25 Adlai is estimating $113,002 for 2026 but could be higher.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 15:06:09', '2025-12-10 15:06:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175922219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130562001', 'Philip Ender', NULL, '12/10/25<br>Asnwered esther email about login issues being solved<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-10 15:05:59', '2025-12-10 15:05:59'),
