  ('zcrm_1579374000175939035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '12-20-25 Christine is still confused where to submit things. She still has the Planstin card that rejected her labs. I left her a vm letting her know to submit screening labs to HAB and to throw out her Planstin card. Other labs will be at her cost. Told her to call me with further questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 12:43:35', '2025-12-10 12:43:35'),
