  ('zcrm_1579374000175939030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '12-20-25 Shoshana and Sam will most likely upgrade to Premium HSA from Premium Care bc losing HAB for Jan. 1st. They want to set up the HSA and will use the wellness benefits. They will have an easy time since they are in Boulder County. Sam let me know he has Tourette''s syndrome diagnosed at age 17. He believes there are better medications out there now and wants to explore that. They also asked about neuropsychological testing for their son. I read them the section from the Sharing Guidelines and it will share up to $3K! They are thrilled. They will pay the first $1000 for their IUA and get their son tested.  I showed them how to update their membership if they wish. They''ll get it done right away and put the difference in savings from HAB to their HSA instead. <br><span style="color:rgb(67, 79, 207);"><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 12:36:08', '2025-12-10 12:36:08'),
