  ('zcrm_1579374000175896024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153173005', 'Peter Ernst', NULL, 'Member called in after hours and left a VM asking about the breakdown of the membership between Family Members.  His spouse is being offered Benefits thru her employer and he wanted to compare prices.  I advised him of the deadline if he does want to remove her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-10 10:05:32', '2025-12-10 10:05:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175927026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173835018', 'Michael Saxton', '12/10', 'questions about hsa, advised him that im not a tax professional or accountant, but i''ve heard good things about hsa bank.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-10 09:50:54', '2025-12-10 09:50:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175939014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175874017', 'William Tighe', NULL, '12-10-25 Bill is healthy, 39, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Lives in Snowmass Village, CO. He does his wellness screenings. He''s self-employed with a property management business and W2 employed as well. He chose Secure HSA $2500/$289 and added Rachel Brisson Middleton as the referring member.  He will set up his welcome call after Jan. 1st. He''s not too interested in the telehealth but he will follow through on all of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 09:50:52', '2025-12-10 09:51:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175939009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175937004', 'Douglas Haslinger', NULL, '12-10-25 Quinn will remain on her own current insurance plan due to the above information she shared yesterday. She''s fine with doing that. She was prescribed a solution a year ago by a doctor to help treat her obesity. She totally understands and prefers to be on the safe side. She''s enrolling the rest of the family EC into Secure HSA $1250 / $603 for Jan. 1st start date. Her husband is self-employed and they will likely fund the HSA as well. She scheduled her Welcome Call already and was super efficient. All set for Jan. 1st, 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-10 09:48:13', '2025-12-10 09:56:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175943001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130565001', 'Stephen Resch, Jr', NULL, '12.10.25 - Tami emailed asking if she needed to renew her membership. No and also provided the review link. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-10 09:47:01', '2025-12-10 09:47:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175879097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174883002', 'Matthew Lame', NULL, 'Spoke to member he will reschedule the welcome call after his start date of January 1, 2026. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-10 09:41:15', '2025-12-10 09:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175927021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', '12/10', 'questions about wellness exam and there was followup reccomendations, calling about coverage for those things. ordered labs (metabolic) - <br><span><br></span><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Complete blood count (NO DIFFERENTIAL)</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Comprehensive Metabolic Panel</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Follicle stimulating hormone</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">hemaglobin a1c blood level\</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">lipid panel</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">thyroid stimulating hormone</span></p></li></ol><p style="">(which of these are preventive and which are diagnostic)</p><p style=""><span><br></span></p><p style="">Labs</p><p style=""><span><br></span></p><p style="">other questions:</p><p style="">1. Reccomended colonoscopy - good to go - dr cale sebald (holland hospital</p><p style="">2. had annual well womans visit yesterday and wants to go for annual wellness visit. - annual wellness fine</p><p style="">3. family history of breast cancer - high risk breast appointment - genetic screening and consultation - Preventive?? - no</p><p style="">4. has iud, needs replacement , first put in july 2021 (lasts 3 years overdue)</p><p style=""><span><br></span></p><p style="">let her know holland hospital on westpark way in network for labs but to call first, also gave her email for sending lab cpt codes</p>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-10 09:40:07', '2025-12-10 09:40:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175879085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172773002', 'Kay Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-10 09:36:05', '2025-12-10 09:36:05'),
