  ('zcrm_1579374000175922006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, '12/10/25<br>Called but had difficulty hearing anything on the other end. Sent a text to let her know we can access her services through the web version and she does not have to use the app if she does not want to. Will call again later today to try and speak since i texted to try and set up a time after not being able to reach through the phone.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-10 08:57:58', '2025-12-10 09:55:35'),
