  ('zcrm_1579374000175896006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108507002', 'Daria Volkova', NULL, 'Member submitted a Change Form to update her address and to ask if we had added her newborn daughter that was born in 2/25.  Her daughter was added, however she gave no indication that she had a new address so that was not updated.  I will update that now  daughter already added.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-10 08:00:47', '2025-12-10 08:00:47'),
