  ('zcrm_1579374000175876026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170614002', 'Susan Duffy', NULL, '12/10/25 - Sent Patrick  e-mail re: active with MPB and does he want us to make his doctor''s appt. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-10 06:44:58', '2025-12-10 06:46:30'),
