  ('zcrm_1579374000175747230', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170144016', 'Christopher Harding', NULL, '12-9-25 Chris and Danielle are able to get onto Danielle''s work plan through school district. She''s a substitute teacher and can work pretty much every day if she wants. They have 600 subs on the list and there''s still enough people out that she can work as much as she wants. They will pay $669 per month for family of 3 with $4K ded indiv/$8K family and $6K mop indiv/$12K family. Chris will be aging into Medicare this year and I''ll connect him with A and A.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 16:31:12', '2025-12-09 16:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175747218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157412021', 'Christopher Ochs', NULL, '12-9-25 Chris called to verify his HAB benefits with $4500 for colonoscopy and other wellness in up to 3 visits. He''s happy and going to follow through with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 15:28:22', '2025-12-09 15:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175747213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175843021', 'Anna Levesque', NULL, '12-9-25 Looks like I missed adding some notes from our first call. But, Anna has a herniated disc and fully understands there will be no sharing for that in year one. They chose Premium HSA because there are no limits year 4 onward. They live in Asheville, NC. Their Dr. Adcock is not in the network nor their Family Health Centers place. I checked their site and they don''''t accept the PHCS or Multiplan network. Therefore, Andrew and Anna are willing to choose a new PCP for wellness. I sent them the list to review. They had also researched Sedera on their own first but wanted the wellness aspect that''s not included by going directly. They joined Premium HSA $1500/$655 $125/$25 for Jan. 1st, 2026. Came via Amos Shuman and they tracked it on the enrollment. Anna has her own business and EIN. They are using the money market savings acct to pay and hoping that''s fine. It worked on their end. They were very appreciative for my patience and willingness to answer all of their questions. All set and super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 15:12:08', '2025-12-09 21:39:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175785120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '12.09.25 - telehealth issue resolved. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 15:08:55', '2025-12-09 15:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175785115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125612010', 'Philip Tallman', NULL, '12.09.25 - Phillip has high blood pressure and cholesterol wanted to know how to proceed, advised of the IUA and present as cash pay. If test are ordered, call the concierge for best prices. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 15:04:29', '2025-12-09 15:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175785110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155318072', 'Randall Mosser', NULL, '12.09.25 - Spoke to Lori - reimburment is process and check will go out either today or the 15th. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 14:58:13', '2025-12-09 14:58:13'),
