  ('zcrm_1579374000175744317', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '(Green side) Member called in to inquire about current share amount and IUA.  He also told me his Teledoc is discontinued.  He wanted to know the prices for the other IUA levels. I gave him his current levels and the  1250 and 2500 IUA prices and told him to contact Wendy to review any plan changes and to submit before the 19th before billing if he wants to make a change. Sent him an email with Wendy''s information to follow up', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-09 14:41:19', '2025-12-09 14:41:19'),
