  ('zcrm_1579374000175755060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091190002', 'Robert Anderson', '12/09', 'wanted to use telehealth, thought we still had cirrus, could not log into app because of her play store login (she no have it). gave her lyric''s number and let her know they may not be able to schedule her without her logging into app or member portal.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-09 13:49:05', '2025-12-09 13:49:05'),
