  ('zcrm_1579374000175747198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '12-9-25 I talked with Cynthia about how to help Chris get his colonoscopy for a set price by Dec. 31st. They can get it for $1300 in Wheatridge at Lutherans and she''s happy about that. If they wait the process will be different with the MEC. We are still waiting to find out what''s wrong with their virtual healtcare membership not working.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 13:31:12', '2025-12-09 13:31:12'),
