  ('zcrm_1579374000175768090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '12/9/25 - Informed member of the possible reason she could not sign onto the MPB Health app. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-09 13:19:30', '2025-12-09 13:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175747193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071092', 'Colleen Irvin', NULL, '12-9-25  They called and asked a few more questions about sharing when other ins is involved such as car insurance. I explained that all other ins comes first and the will duke it out with the insurance company and health sharing will pay after that point. She also asked about a preventive PET scan which she understands will be at her cost if she wants to do one per her dr. who just likes to get a baseline and is super conservative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 13:18:51', '2025-12-09 13:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175785089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '12.09.25 Member needed URL for web version of the app. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 13:11:45', '2025-12-09 13:11:45'),
