  ('zcrm_1579374000175785067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142011002', 'Jonathan Chan', NULL, '12.09.25 - Jenny emailed blood work bill asking how to proceed. Advised if it''s preventive, provide the ARM card and if diagnostic then she is self pay. Also asked about food alergy test, we need to more details (type of test) to help with pricing as there are several avialble on laboratory assist. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 12:30:12', '2025-12-09 12:30:12'),
