  ('zcrm_1579374000175747188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175019', 'Juliann Jordan', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about the prices to possibly add her husband to membership &amp; also what the $5000 IUA would cost.  I told her that this change would have to come from her employer since she is on a list bill.  I gave her the deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-09 12:27:33', '2025-12-09 12:27:33'),
