  ('zcrm_1579374000175747175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128033', 'Stephen Whitelande', NULL, '12-9-25 Emma and Stephen want to find out the cost of wellness and 1 immuization for their 2 year old. They learned cash pay for wellness at Aspen Medical Care is $400 plus 30% discount = $280. But, they will now call and ask about the PPO price and out of network for PHCS/Multiplan and if there will be a balance bill or not. They definitely want to fund the HSA. They earn about $200K per year and were getting a $600 APTC. They were wanting to wait to see if gov approved the extended covid relief tax credits. They definitely no longer qualify at $200K. They will keep me posted and we can enroll between appointments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-09 12:04:16', '2025-12-09 12:04:16'),
