  ('zcrm_1579374000175785031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081595012', 'Aron Groner', NULL, '12.09.25 Nechama is experiencing paid for varicose veins pain, according to the guidelines - she would need to meet her IUA and submit for sharing. Advised to obtain the good faith estimate and present as cash pay patient. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-09 11:52:03', '2025-12-09 11:52:03'),
