  ('zcrm_1579374000175646109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '12-8-25 I found Dr. Degado showing in the network on Anthem''s site. The gold plan is way better than the bronze plans at the similar price range. The only downfall is the PT is ded and then co-ins. Connie put in her payment information already and will check on the payment before Jan. 1st. She will be turning 65 in 2026 and will have to be removed and that will change the payment amount for Eduardo and Fernanda.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 14:58:45', '2025-12-08 14:58:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175703001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176659017', 'Candace Lucas', NULL, '12.8.25:  Candace emailed they are ready to enroll on the 12/15. I responded that will work and she asked for a 4:00 p.m. session, to which I agreed.  I explained what documents and information she will need to enroll in the SECURE HSA plan for her and her family. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-12-08 14:51:48', '2025-12-08 14:51:48'),
