  ('zcrm_1579374000175646083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, '12-8-25 She hates apps and didn''t want to access her account via an app. I confirmed that she can do everything she needs on the computer. Julia will have someone from the Concierge reach out and help walk her through how to do everything online. I also left her a vm letting her know all of this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 13:38:19', '2025-12-08 13:38:19'),
