  ('zcrm_1579374000175620125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', NULL, '12/8/25<br>Sean called to see how the 12 visits from MSEAP would be handled, by the year or by the date you sign up. I let him know how they would handle that but also let him know that MSEAP will not be one of our vendors after the end of the year so if he has any visits left he should try and use them<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 11:50:14', '2025-12-08 11:50:14'),
