  ('zcrm_1579374000175646053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144228001', 'Cynthia Franceus', NULL, '12-8-25 I discovered Repatha and Trulicity are Not in Kaiser''s drug list. They are both ok with using other drugs. This way they save about $300 per month vs the Cigna plan they had from last year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 11:36:11', '2025-12-08 11:38:43'),
