  ('zcrm_1579374000175620100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172427004', 'Dale Bickert', NULL, '12/8/25<br>Dale called back and left a Vm requesting ID cards to give to his dr. I sent him some temp ones since he is not able to get into his health wallet section to get a copy of his card. I will reach out to It then see what the issue is with his login. Then i WIll update Dale<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 11:29:14', '2025-12-08 11:29:14'),
