  ('zcrm_1579374000175646021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130216002', 'Montanah Matthies', NULL, '12-8-25 <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Hi Wendy,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">I wanted to touch base with you regarding my coverage that I obtained through you. I have recently moved to Germany, so I will no longer need the coverage as I have to obtain German health coverage instead. Can you please advise what I need to do to terminate the coverage? I know the Health Access Solutions plan is not being renewed, and I''ve cancelled my OneDental coverage, so I just need to cancel the health share plan.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span></p><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">--</span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Thanks,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Montanah Matthies</span></p><p style=""><a style=" display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:montanahmatthies@gmail.com"><u>montanahmatthies@gmail.com</u></a></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">970.309.5409</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 10:45:45', '2025-12-08 10:45:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175646011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083258001', 'Jonathan Atwell', NULL, '12-8-25 Jonathan called to make sure he''s making a good decision. His Anthem medical and dental were auto renewed. I looked up other options and Select Health has some cheaper options. But, he decided his Anthem plan has been working well for him. He''s mostly concerned about keeping Steadmans with Dr. Hackett. I couldn''t find Dr. Scheffel in the system at all. PT is better with Anthem. Everything else looks cheaper with Select Health. But. he chose to keep Anthem since he knows it works. He might get married this year and also might move to TriCare this year. He was super appreciative to have my help since this is all so confusing. He feels better after talking with me that he''ll leave it as is. He also spent 10 hrs trying to get his plan reactivated when Athem/C4 couldn''t agree on who cancelled his plan for a payment issue. They finally reinstated it after they tried to refund 10 months of payments. He will make sure that doesn''t happen again. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 10:43:57', '2025-12-08 10:43:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164754002', 'Catherine Rottinghaus', '12/08', 'sharing request on mammogram and app login issues, questions resolved', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-08 10:40:35', '2025-12-08 10:40:35'),
