  ('zcrm_1579374000175620087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132391010', 'Robert Skubiak', NULL, 'Members spouse called in and told me that they wanted to cancel as they have other coverage.  I directed them to speak with Jane and that I will email link to Cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-08 10:13:57', '2025-12-08 10:13:57'),
