  ('zcrm_1579374000175646001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162402001', 'Ariel Tidwell', NULL, '12-4-25 Ariel reached out the next day and finally found all of the communications and wants her membership re-activated. I haven''t heard back from Sedera yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-08 10:09:07', '2025-12-08 10:09:07'),
