  ('zcrm_1579374000175621013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125254010', 'Francoise Bunnell', NULL, '12/8/25 -Member called. Son is having trouble signing into telehealth. Send into to IT. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 10:03:40', '2025-12-08 10:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175620063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172427004', 'Dale Bickert', NULL, '12/8/25<br>Dale called to get some labs and find out if a provider was in network. I let him know it is best practice to double check with the provider even if we see them on the search to make sure they are still in network. Also showed him how to use jason health to get some cheaper blood test. he is new and already got referrals for everything from his primary so i just showed him where to go to get the services done<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 10:02:15', '2025-12-08 10:02:15'),
