  ('zcrm_1579374000175621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173862021', 'Bruce Gauker', '12/08/25', 'We attempted to call Beth x2. Unable to hear her. Sent e-mail to husband Bruce in order to resolve the issue with signing Beth onto MPB app. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 09:37:44', '2025-12-08 09:37:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175620001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', NULL, '12/8/25<br>Val called in after finding out that the prescription he had gotten changed for a weight loss med was not sent to where he was getting it filled with the right information. I connected him with lyric in a 3 way call so we could figure out the issue. Lyric was able to ensure that they would fix the prescription and would call VAl back when that was all taken care of. He also wanted to fix the phone block issue and the people at lyric also helped with that. They walked val through taking off the blocker they have on toll free numbers and also let him know that if this does not work he will need to reach out to his phone provider so they could remove the block because we will not be able to do anything for him.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-08 09:32:09', '2025-12-08 09:32:09'),
