  ('zcrm_1579374000175412261', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122567002', 'Alexandra Novo', NULL, '12-5-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">1Dental - <a target="_blank" href="http://alexandraxnovo@gmail.com" style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">alexandraxnovo@gmail.com</a> just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 23:21:09', '2025-12-05 23:21:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412248', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071092', 'Colleen Irvin', NULL, '12-5-25 Alex and Colleen came to me via Melissa and Lee Bowers (couple that lives in Marble). Alex and Colleen live in Basalt and are skiers of course. They are 61 for Alex and 54 for Colleen with a 16 and 19 year old. They have W2 and both have 1099 self employment. Colleen had breast cancer in 2018 which was cured by 2020. She now takes tamoxifine to prevent any future breast cancer as an estrogen blocker. She''s taking it by choice not as a treatment to cancer. Alex had bladder cancer and melanoma 4 years ago. Bladder cancer recurred 3 years ago in Dec. 2022. It was treated and he''s been cancer free since Dec. 2022. He does regular screenings to make sure nothing comes back for his bladder. The melanoma was in situ, on the surface. It was removed 100% effectively in May 2021. His daughter has swollen lymph nodes and had a shoulder surgery bc she''s an athlete. This was 10 months ago. She will get ins through school and be added to MPB as secondary if they choose tihs path. I will inquire about the above concerns for them to see in writing. They want to keep Dr. Borchers and Dr. Chamberlin. They aren''t showing up in the search so they will call the provider and inquire. Otherwise, they can opt for out of network pricing with the PPO rates.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 23:00:55', '2025-12-05 23:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412225', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176459022', 'Robin Yost', NULL, '12-5-25 I sent Robin an email to connect with her. Tupac offered this helpful information as well.<br>"Hi Wendy, someone had booked a meeting with me by the name of Robin Yost, I found out through looking up the member that referred her (Anne White) that you were her friend''s advisor. I figured you are probably pretty busy, so I made sure she got the full presentation and confirmed network status of her preferred imaging center for mammograms as well. Reccomended her Secure HSA and went over pricing and deadline, etc. Finally I let her know that you would be her advisor and to contact you before signing up, I also provided her your contact info as well."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 22:06:04', '2025-12-05 22:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '12-5-25 Hello Wendy,<br><br>Thank you for reaching out to us. This request is completed. Member''s eligibility will end effective 1/1/2026.<br><br><br><br>Kind regards,<br><br>LA WANDA OATES', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 21:34:47', '2025-12-05 21:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128033', 'Stephen Whitelande', NULL, '12-5-25 Emma is interested in enrolling and wants pricing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 21:27:09', '2025-12-05 21:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '12-5-25 I explained what''s included in Secure HSA and what will be ending with HAB. She enrolled in HA Co-Op not understanding that she was duplicating what she already has with Secure HSA. So, she asked me to cancel her HA. I sent an email to HA and cc''ed her on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 21:25:31', '2025-12-05 21:25:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '12-5-25 Date: 2025-12-05 12:19:58<br> <br>Dear Ashley Coburn,<br>This email confirms that your application has been received for processing in your selected Health insurance plan.<br>I, Wendy Scipione, or one of my colleagues with Wendy Scipione / Health Insurance will be confirming your enrollment with Cigna.<br><b>If, after you are fully enrolled, you receive a notice of cancelation for non payment, then please let us know so that any payment issues can be fixed before a lapse in coverage. </b>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 21:18:43', '2025-12-05 21:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154586421', 'Cody Rogers', NULL, '12-5-25 From Cigna, Hello CODY LEE ROGERS,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your medical insurance with Cigna Healthcare. Your policy is no longer in effect as of <b>November 30, 2025</b> due to your request.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.<br> <br>If you''d like to apply again for new coverage, please must contact <b>Connect for Health Colorado®, Colorado''s state-based health insurance marketplace</b>. You can call them directly at <b>1.855.752.6749</b> or visit <span><a href="http://connectforhealthco.com" style="" target="_blank"><b>connectforhealthco.com</b></a></span>.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 20:57:05', '2025-12-05 20:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779247', 'Todd Wells', NULL, '12-5-25 I had to inquire about pro status for his cycling per his email here, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Basically I was a professional cyclist for 20+ years and now I do some coaching(paid by USA Cycling) and jump in a few races(pro category). I am not paid by any of my sponsors but do receive product and occasionally win prize money. I''m 50 years old so I''m not making a living off of this but do remain active in the sport."</span><br><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);"><br></span><i>"Hi Wendy,</i><br><br><i>After some investigation, sounds like the designation of "professional" doesn''t turn on whether the member competes for a living or even whether they largely rely on the activity for income (prize money is income):  if you earn income as a direct result of the athlete''s activity in the sport.</i><br><br><i>I can tell you that Zion will require letters stating that he was not paid.</i><br><br><i>Sounds like something he will want to evaluate carefully.</i><br><br><i>Let me know if you have any other questions.</i><br><br><i>All good things,</i><br><br><i>Rachelle"</i><br><span><br></span>So, we are talking on Monday to move him to Premium HSA most likely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 20:40:48', '2025-12-05 20:40:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157361311', 'Joshua Phillips', NULL, '12-5-25  <br><p style="">December 5, 2025 at 7:17 AM</p><p style=""><span><br></span></p><p style="">Dear <span style=" margin-inline-start:20px;">Wendy Scipione</span>,</p><p style="">Joshua Phillips has asked that you no longer work on his or her behalf to purchase insurance through Connect for Health Colorado®.</p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 20:26:23', '2025-12-05 20:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175412105', 'Molly Johnson', NULL, '12-5-25 Molly was super nice. She''s a licensed dog sitter according to Cari. I didn''t have a chance to ask her about it. But, the price turns out better than she was expecting. The proposal showed $120. It was the only gold plan to pick from. So, I believe we have the correct one. She submitted her payment and will also follow up to complete the auto pay. Super nice and complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 18:30:26', '2025-12-05 18:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175412105', 'Molly Johnson', NULL, '12-5-25 Molly is Cari''s client who needed help with C4. We got her enrolled as follows:<br><span><br></span><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Molly Johnson</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Colorado Option Gold Pathway Std</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$2,050</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$9,600</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/