  ('zcrm_1579374000175412084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227248', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '12-5-25 We updated her income to $2744.50 mo for Jerome and $1186 mo for her to equal $47,166 per year. That gave them a big APTC $1437.35 and the $80 CAP. She was very nice. I sent her proof and gave her the # to call Anthem to set up auto pay in 7-10 days. Good to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 16:31:10', '2025-12-05 16:31:10'),
