  ('zcrm_1579374000175412074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '12-5-25 Left vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 16:12:07', '2025-12-05 16:12:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177113120', 'Mark Micucci', NULL, '12-5-25 Mark is interested in Secure HSA but his wife is getting offered a job with benefits. They are waiting to see what those benefits will look like for him. He''s hoping to know in the next week or so. I let him know he has a little longer to choose, until the 20th in case he doesn''t have an answer fast enough. I explained the wellness benefit and HSA. He does wellness. He had an MRI on his knee and it was a meniscus tear that no longer has pain. No meds, no tobacco. Secure HSA EO $1250/$359 or $2500/$289.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 16:06:57', '2025-12-05 16:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175412064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '12-5-25 We are scheduled for Dec. 12th to review her options for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 15:56:37', '2025-12-05 15:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175361614', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176459022', 'Robin Yost', '12/05', 'she''s 48, daughter is 17, her women''s imaging center is in network, heard of us through her friend anne white, she is self employed (closet designer). No preex, wants preventive care, potentially has thermographic and ultrasound for mammograms (dense tissue, etc). will refer back to wendy.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-05 15:13:19', '2025-12-05 15:13:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175389093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173762035', 'John Dzurka', NULL, '12/5/25<br>John called in to open his Zion portal for the first time since he is a new member. Zion originally told him to call us to get his password but i let him know we need to reach out to Zion in order for them to help him register and open his portal since he is new. We got him set up and in the portal and he also made sure to give his wife email to Zion so they could make sure she has an individual login for her portal as well.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 14:30:30', '2025-12-05 14:30:30'),
