  ('zcrm_1579374000175412059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '12-5-25 Carol decided to upgrade to Secure HSA since she''s getting pressured to do all of the normal ACA compliant wellness screenings. She has a colonscopy scheduled for Jan. 9th. She should have her digital card by then if she doesn''t have the physical card. But, she can call the Concierge to get what she needs before the visit. Care+ is $668 and moving to Secure HSA for $774 in 2026. She''s all set and completed the online form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-05 13:17:55', '2025-12-05 13:17:55'),
