  ('zcrm_1579374000175389032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148931008', 'Im Sampen', NULL, '12/5/25<br>Responded to Im''s email about a yearly visit costing over $1000. Let Im know that a yearly visit is included with the membership since they have the preventative care. going to work with Im to see why the last visit cost so much then i will help make sure Im can get  a yearly visit that they are entitiled to. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 11:42:55', '2025-12-05 11:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175389027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131624019', 'Charles Evers Whyte', NULL, '12/5/25<br>Pia called to request her member ID number since she did not have it and could not find it. I gave her the info she needed so she could sign up for some program she was trying to sign up for. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 11:40:38', '2025-12-05 11:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175358183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155861001', 'Lynne McCarren', NULL, 'Member called in and asked where she could submit her invoices for concussion &amp; Tick bite.  I explained that they would be separate situations and that she would be responsible for $2500 IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-05 11:38:54', '2025-12-05 11:38:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175389020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172262002', 'Suzanne Caldwell', NULL, '12/5/25<br>Sent email to f/u with her on the price problem with her progesterone. I needed all the details of the medication to verify the quote. She responded letting me know the problme has since been taken care of and she is good to go. Will let us know if she needs any help with anything else.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 11:33:44', '2025-12-05 11:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175389015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, '12/5/25<br>Michael called to make sure his wife and daughters birthdays and genders were correct because Zion had some wrong info. The birthdays were all correct but the gender is wrong for his daughter Francesca. Will find out how to help him get that info changed. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 11:32:33', '2025-12-05 11:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175389010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '11/5/25<br>Macay called because he got a call from us just following up with him, I let him know if it was urgent they would reach back out, He understood and i let him know to reach back out if he misses a connection attempt again and i can assist and make sure he is connected. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-05 11:18:05', '2025-12-05 11:18:05'),
