  ('zcrm_1579374000175281242', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175303002', 'Amanda DeKrey', NULL, '12-4-25 Mandy and Jesse came to me via Troy Wells. Mandy is 41 and Jesse is 39. Live in Durango. Watched video. They are  self-employed with an EIN. No pre-x, no tobacco. Mandy takes lexipro and hydroxizine from psychiatrist. Yes, for wellness and HSA and traditional. Secure HSA was the best price point and gives them everything they want. She watched the video also. She chose to enroll in Secure HSA $2500/$488.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 22:58:28', '2025-12-04 22:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170144016', 'Christopher Harding', NULL, '12-4-25 Chris will be going onto Medicare in 1 year from April. Lives in SS, CO. Hasn''t been on Enbrel for 4 months now and Dr. seems to believe he was misdiagnosed and does not have rheumatoid arthritis. He''s Very happy about this. He''s on the Kaiser KP CO Option Gold. He''s expecting to make about $120K with family of 3. Not close to the $106, 600 APTC cutoff. His 15 yr old daughter is super healthy and 52 yr old wife Danielle is also healthy. He was facing a massive price increase for the family. I suggested we move wife and daughter to MCS and Premium HSA $1000/$676 or $1500/$615. He really likes this idea and is thinking maybe he''d like to join as well. He has a history of kidney stones that have been taken care of and has high blood pressure and cholesterol. I told him these are often exempt from pre-x but now handled on a case per case basis. Their total amount would be $988 instead of about $2K. He will discuss it with his wife and might take his chances for the brief time before Medicare. They have rental income they can use as proof of self-employment. Chris alone on his Kaiser KP CO Option Gold plan will be $1193.85 His wife Daniell was subbing today and couldn''t be on the call but should be able to join next week to finalize their options. Alexis had a calcium deposit in her knee and it''s been checked out and nothing more to do. All is well on that front.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 22:36:36', '2025-12-04 22:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '12-4-25 <br><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Madeleine BlanchardCupolo</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>KP Select CO Gold 1500/20</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$1,500</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$8,500</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);