  ('zcrm_1579374000175281183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '12-4-25 Jennah removed me as her agent on C4 but has an MCS plan with MPB. I sent her an email. I''m not sure what she''s doing. Perhaps she''s getting help for her significant other or something? IDK.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 22:17:53', '2025-12-04 22:17:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171119022', 'Ashley Coburn', NULL, '12-4-25 Hi Wendy,<br><br>Thanks! I just finished enrolling for the dental plan.<br><br>Kindly,<br>Ashley<br><br>Ashley Coburn, PhD <br>Postdoctoral Psychologist<br>Center for Effective Treatment<br>1137 Pearl St., Suite 203<br>Boulder, CO 80302<br>Phone: 720-502-0893<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://www.effectivetreatment.com/"><u>DrCoburn@EffectiveTreatment.com</u></a><br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://www.effectivetreatment.com/"><u>www.EffectiveTreatment.com</u></a>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 21:55:28', '2025-12-04 21:55:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145372007', 'Amy Kopf', NULL, '12-4-25 I resent Amy the options to upgrade to Secure HSA if she''s self employed since she wants more wellness benefits. We''ll see if she responds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 21:46:53', '2025-12-04 21:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '12-4-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"Thanks Wendy. My dad dies on Saturday and the last month I have been preoccupied. He was 95 and a great and long life. "  She doesn''t need to do anything moving forward. So, she''s all set.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 20:57:22', '2025-12-04 20:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176266236', 'Barbara Colombo', NULL, '12-4-25 Barb is almost 60 and was referred by Sheryl Hadley. She was with Kaiser for a very long time. She runs a photography business called 11-11 Productions Photography and earns about $120K, so too much for APTC. Her plan is about $600 now and going up to $800-$900 for 2026. She''s single, healthy, self-employed. I sent her the video to watch and we will talk next week to discuss it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 20:18:34', '2025-12-04 20:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '12-4-25 I left a vm at the end of the day, 5:15.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 20:11:03', '2025-12-04 20:11:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166640002', 'Gina Hale', NULL, '12-4-25 Gina is getting an Ambetter plan with ACA for only $77 for her and her husband. This will save her a lot of money. She felt uncomfortable going in as self-pay without a card. But, she did one oncology screening for $150 and 1 urgent care visit. She completed the for that Patti sent already. She was super nice and all set to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 17:05:40', '2025-12-04 17:05:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081351009', 'Brian Egan', NULL, '12-4-25 Shannon left me a vm to let me know they will leave their membership active on all fronts. So, there''s nothing more to do. I sent her a text back since it''s just about 5:00 and let her know I received her vm and made note. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 16:58:08', '2025-12-04 16:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134180005', 'Lisa Ben-Zeev', NULL, '12-4-25 Lisa needs some dental work. I sent her Delta Dental info. She couldn''t get the link to work. I sent it again. She may need some cavities worked on. I shared the Clear Plan which she can join for Jan. 1st and her dentist accepts it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 16:56:54', '2025-12-04 16:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157412021', 'Christopher Ochs', NULL, '12-4-25 Chris will keep his Premium Care membership as is. He''ll do the rest of his wellness items and submit to Health Access by Dec. 31st. I showed him how to schedule his colonoscopy and hopefully get that done before 2026 to utilize HAB. He''s going to work on that and is happy to learn he had many false alarms of increased costs. Now it will only be $299/$1000 and saving $107 for any wellness stuff next year. He''s happy and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 16:34:25', '2025-12-04 16:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174988002', 'Jeffrey Moore', NULL, '12.4.25 - Jeff could not log into the app due to his start date being in the future. Notified him by email. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-04 14:58:41', '2025-12-04 14:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175314138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032001', 'Kyle Robinson', '12/04', 'had telehealth, couldn''t get his prescriptions sent over to his pharmacy, got him transferred to lyric', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-12-04 14:57:21', '2025-12-04 14:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170701029', 'Jessica Wenger McPhaul', NULL, '12.04.25 - Jessica was not able to get the labs from her app. Spoke to Lyric. They attempted to reach out to discuss. Will call her back again. JA<br><span><br></span>', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-04 14:46:42', '2025-12-04 14:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175257241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175340002', 'Lisa Byrd', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-04 14:21:09', '2025-12-04 14:21:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '12-24-25 Julie and Nelson understand the preventive with Premium Care and the $600 and $2500 dollar amounts. They do have 10-12 employees that they were thinking of Health Access Co-Op for the wellness benefits. But, they are happy with their current membership and don''t plan to go down that path now. They also wanted to understand what makes  a FTE for their employees. Julie did good due diligence on that front knowing a group of 3+ gets them the wellness benefits again. Anyhow, they are all set for now with no plan of moving.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 14:21:05', '2025-12-04 14:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175291096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154220002', 'Cynthia Pepper', NULL, '12/4/25<br>Cynthia called to see if she needed to do anything due to the new year coming up. I let her know as long as she is not trying to make changes then she is good to go<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-04 14:12:55', '2025-12-04 14:12:55'),
