  ('zcrm_1579374000175257236', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175298005', 'Rakesh Shishodia', NULL, 'Sent email to Advisor regarding correction of Dependent/Spouse First Name. It shows the same name as the Primary Member.<br>12/5- Leslie replied to my email with the correct member details.  I will update as follows:<br><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Member : </span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Rakesh Shishodia</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">02/15/1970</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Male</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Spouse</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Renu Shishodia</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">02/22/1972</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Female</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thanks.</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Leslie</span></p>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-04 14:00:08', '2025-12-05 07:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175253593', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166955002', 'Joseph Rakoski', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-04 13:59:09', '2025-12-04 13:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175253588', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166955002', 'Joseph Rakoski', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Request to remove spouse from the membership eff 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-04 13:57:50', '2025-12-04 13:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175253581', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133663012', 'Steven Hitchcock', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-04 13:51:38', '2025-12-04 13:51:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175281085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129038011', 'Matthew Mason', NULL, '12-4-25 I called him Alex this time. I foget which is correct, Alex or Matthew. Oh well. He was SUPER cool and appreciative of my call and support in helping him with everything. He just got nervous that the MCS wouldn''t share the cost if anything happens. He''s choosing to go as self-pay and no ins or MCS at all. He and his wife are looking for new jobs and possibly with benefits. He didn''t like the fine print with MCS that there are no guarantees and read some bad reviews. So, he''s willing to take the risk of not having anything and just paying the cash price. It was still more money then he felt comfortable spending each month as well. He will absolutely contact me in the future if he has any desire to sign up for anything down the road. All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-04 13:47:58', '2025-12-04 13:47:58'),
