  ('zcrm_1579374000175149065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089271002', 'Kimberly Jarman', '12/3/25', 'Kimberly called to see if hormone and hrt treatment is eligible for a sharing request, I explained that as long as she follows all the guidelines and reached her IUA she can open a sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 21:35:46', '2025-12-03 21:35:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175149060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170743002', 'James Robinson', '12/3/25', 'James called because his daughter was being charged for her obgyn appointment it appears that one part was coded as non preventative AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 21:32:17', '2025-12-03 21:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175187188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175187153', 'Amy Anderson', NULL, '12-3-25 Amy was not comfortable with MCS. She''d rather pay $1049 instead of $300-$450 per month. They earn too much for an APTC. She''s all set for 2026.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 21:29:26', '2025-12-03 21:33:12'),
