  ('zcrm_1579374000175149045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179001', 'Roxanne Olsen', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Roxanna called because her provider refuses to bill the ARM card. I let her know that i would contact ARM to see if they can make an exception for her. So that she can pay out of pocket and then get reinburment AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 21:19:12', '2025-12-03 21:19:12'),
