  ('zcrm_1579374000175228001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174258021', 'Chad Smith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4594 Question : I can''t seem to remove myself off this plan', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-12-03 13:30:14', '2025-12-03 13:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175144082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174031002', 'Cheryl Roth', NULL, '12/3 member inquired about 4 towns near her to see if we have any in network drs or facilities for an annual wellness or mammogram. I emailed her back that I didn''t findy any in network. She had left a voicemail. I left her a voicemail as well. DM<br>Also let her know that Dr. Rebecca Pestle was NOT in network.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 13:25:52', '2025-12-03 13:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175143202', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165020', 'Brian Black', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-03 13:23:30', '2025-12-03 13:23:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175139031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174480001', 'Boyd Rowe', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Sp $1250 Secure HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-03 13:19:25', '2025-12-03 13:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175139026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174480001', 'Boyd Rowe', NULL, 'Member put in Change Form to change membership prior to starting on 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-03 13:17:56', '2025-12-03 13:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175187060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, '12-3-25 Jill will consider upgrading to Secure HSA from Care+ with the loss of HAB. She''s self-employed and knows her Dr. is in the network. She''s keep me posted. She knows the prices with the $2500 IUA. She''s also thinking towards her daughter''s possible need for a plan in Oct. She has Type 1 diabetes and needs the insulin and pump etc. I suspect those prices will be down well enough by Oct. of 2026. We will explore options at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 13:17:16', '2025-12-03 13:17:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175143194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175203018', 'Jonathan Klein', 'Member & Spouse $1250 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-03 13:16:31', '2025-12-03 13:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175146139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583032', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Erin called requesting more info about a "free" visit to go see an eye dr. I was not sure what she was referring to and recommended she speak with her advisor in case this is a benefit added on we are not aware of.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 13:11:23', '2025-12-03 13:11:23'),
