  ('zcrm_1579374000175146080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411196', 'Jeremy Stollings', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Jeremy called because he had a recent hospital visit and a scan coming up. I explained the IUA/share request process. Let him know to get the itemized bills so he could upload those and begin a share request. He will reach out if he runs into trouble through the process as well as i will follow up with him.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 12:09:43', '2025-12-03 12:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175144077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045932033', 'Jonathan Masters', NULL, '12/3 member sent a request in chat to update the membership- delete one of his family members. Emailed him the update form. DM<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 12:06:54', '2025-12-03 12:06:54'),
