  ('zcrm_1579374000175187035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, '12-3-25 Ashley called and now I understand her bill started at $12K and she got it down to $10K of which $8K was the colonoscopy! The other part was her women''s wellness visit and a hearing check. She got HAB to reimburse her for $3900. Part of the bill was wellness and part diagnostic. So, she will submit the rest as a Need with the help of the Concierge to see if they''ll share a portion. She went to St. Jay Hospital in the NE Kingdom and their rates are through the roof! She''ll keep working on it when she gets home.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 12:00:13', '2025-12-03 12:00:13'),
