  ('zcrm_1579374000175146050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170998024', 'Satish Turlapati', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Satish called to find out what to do for his wife who needs a mammogram. LEt him know the process of billing and checking they are in network, He had a provider and i was looking to verify they are in network but there was some inconsistent data so i will call to clear it up and if his options are not in network i will let him know what options are closest to him, verified his number and will call him back about this<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 11:34:02', '2025-12-03 11:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175146045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Jenne called after the telehealth department texted her trying to get in touch with her. I was able to get her connected with them and they let her know that she had a block or something on the phone not allowing the calls from lyric to go through. They helped her change her settings and also noted the fact that this was why they could not reach her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 11:32:20', '2025-12-03 11:32:20'),
