  ('zcrm_1579374000175187019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175212001', 'Julie Barker', NULL, '12-3-25 Julie will choose Premium Care $1000/$299 plus $125/$25 for EO Jan. 1st start.  She''s got very well educated on all of it and has an excellent grasp. She''s super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 11:16:31', '2025-12-03 11:28:16'),
