  ('zcrm_1579374000175187011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, '12-3-25 Ashley was able to get the bill down by 25% by paying right away. They removed 1 polyp and changed it from preventive to diagnostic. So, I''ve instructed her to create a new Need to get it shared above her IUA. If some part is coded as wellness she can try to submit that part to HAB as well. Not sure if the entire bill is diagnostic. She will press on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 10:01:15', '2025-12-03 10:01:15'),
