  ('zcrm_1579374000175187001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163424002', 'Kendra Campbell', NULL, '12-23-25 Kendra is super bummed that HAB is ending. That''s why she joined this membership with Care+ and Middleway. She understands she''ll have to pay for her wellness. She''s about to get her colonoscopy done next week, did a mammo/thermo, bone density, yoga, etc. She will do her dental and vision and doesn''t need nutrition. Her Care+ goes up to $318 from $300 and then her cost for Middleway Wellness. She understands and will press on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-03 09:45:43', '2025-12-03 09:45:43'),
