  ('zcrm_1579374000175146030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106317002', 'Kathryn Reishus', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Kathryn called to find out more info on a bill for a mammo. We called Arm together and it seems like she has not submitted the bill properly. Lori let Kathryn know that she will personally assist her with that. Lori gave Kathryn her email address and they will speak about this particular mammo to try and get her reimbursed because the provider is making kethryn pay up front due to them just starting to use the PHCS network.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 09:17:13', '2025-12-03 09:17:13'),
