  ('zcrm_1579374000175146025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173395005', 'Colt Reents', NULL, '12/3/25<br>Colt called to get more info on how the membership works. he wanted an ID card and I let him know we usually send one out with just the member ID on it and a little more info. Since he is on the Care + he does not really need a card since he does not have the preventative care and if it is something that will go towards a share request he would be cash pay and would not want to give the provider an Id card and possibly confuse them into thinking he has insurance and not giving the cash/self pay discount.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-03 07:52:26', '2025-12-03 07:52:26'),
