  ('zcrm_1579374000175122026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175122031', 'Sarah Sturm', NULL, '12-2-25 Hi Wendy!<br><br>So we decided to stick with the marketplace insurance for next year. We are nervous about making the switch especially as we are trying to get pregnant and it’s a little too scary!<br><br>Sorry for taking your time, but I appreciate your help. Perhaps we can move forward next time!<br><br>Sarah Zoey Sturm', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 23:42:36', '2025-12-02 23:42:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175122021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '12-2-25 1Dental Enrollment - <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">ben@home-renu.com just purchased a plan from your link! You will earn commission once the member is active beyond the 30-day trial period.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 23:37:12', '2025-12-02 23:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175122006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '12-2-25 Hello,<br><br>Thank you for reaching out!<br><br>We have moved Cynthia''s next billing date to January 1, 2027. The plan is active now, so she is free to begin using her benefits immediately. <br><br>Please let us know if you have any additional questions or concerns. We are always happy to help!<br><br><br>Best Regards,<br> <br>Kristi<br>Customer Service Representative<br>Careington -<a style="" target="_blank"> 1Dentalbroker.com</a><br>1.855.329.6305 | <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:customerservice@1dentalbroker.com"><u>customerservice@1dentalbroker.com</u></a><span></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 23:00:05', '2025-12-02 23:00:05'),
