  ('zcrm_1579374000175049072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095683010', 'John Wells', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Called John to follow up on his reibursment on vaccines Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:45:20', '2025-12-02 13:45:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Jenne called back after it looks like Ace made a f/u call. I let her know we were just following up with her about the telehealth appointment to see if everything is all set for her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:39:44', '2025-12-02 13:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172262002', 'Suzanne Caldwell', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Suzanne called to find out more about payment dates and when the money comes out of her account for her membership. I let her know between 20-25 is when that usually happens every month. She was also having trouble logging in and i was able to help her with that.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:37:44', '2025-12-02 13:37:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173818039', 'Nicole Janky', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Nicole called to get a little more clarification on what her membership offers her. I walked her through a lot of different factors and let her know how it is all interconnected. After that she called back to ask a few more questions about who sedera was and how we are connected. Explained the difference between us and how we operate with them<br>]AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:35:48', '2025-12-02 13:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175039219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175085011', 'Lourdes Sauceda', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium Care', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-02 13:34:51', '2025-12-02 13:34:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111990002', 'John Hill', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Called John to follow up on sharing request I was unable to leave a message AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:32:30', '2025-12-02 13:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168235002', 'Andrew Swisher', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Called Andrew to follow up on a sharing request he said that he is all set at this time AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:21:49', '2025-12-02 13:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Followed up with patient regarding mammogram billing. Asked if the bill has been sent to ARM and requested confirmation so we can follow up accordingly. Awaiting patient response.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:17:18', '2025-12-02 13:17:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169605002', 'Maria Davila', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Maria called in to ask for the BiN number for some prescriptions. I let her know with the Care+ the only BIN number we could give would be after we quoted her on the medications so i would have needed to know the names of the drugs before she went to the pharmacy. She thought it worked differently, thanked me and said goodbye<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:17:17', '2025-12-02 13:17:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175032044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '12/2 I called both Simon Med Imaging and PAHS to confirm they are in network. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 13:08:35', '2025-12-02 13:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723002', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Sent email to follow up on her sharing request AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 12:54:53', '2025-12-02 12:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175032039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148499301', 'Dmitry Rozin', NULL, '12/2 Caitlin left a voicemail about billing. Called her back and had a ? on coverage for a pregnancy visit this morning.<br>Transferred her to Megan at Zion. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 12:43:49', '2025-12-02 12:43:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054209', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099847002', 'Dena Pierre', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change membership to the Direct eff 1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:41:04', '2025-12-02 12:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113835002', 'Terry Draper', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Shelly called because she wanted to know if a colo and a mammogram is covered. I explained that it is covered under her preventative portion of the plan Ac <br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 12:38:15', '2025-12-02 12:38:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111981002', 'Michelle King', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Ch $1250 Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:33:52', '2025-12-02 12:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111981002', 'Michelle King', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to removed spouse from the membership eff 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:33:17', '2025-12-02 12:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175032034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '12/2 member emailed a request to find out who is in network for colonoscopies and shingles. Emailed her back that Simon Med Imaging in Littleton is in network for colonoscopies and PAHS in Highland Ranch is in network for shingles vaccines. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 12:25:43', '2025-12-02 12:25:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175053077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '12-2-25 Sheryl is all set. I just called back just in case. She is also referring her friend Barb Colombo to me. She was excited to hear that she could earn $100 referral fee is Barb joins!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 12:23:25', '2025-12-02 20:50:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175053072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175113002', 'Carrie Kudrna', NULL, '12-2-25 Karrie came referred by Laura Talley and wants a Jan. 1st start date with MPB.  She will be available this afternoon and will watch the video before we talk again. She''s ready to get this done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 12:18:19', '2025-12-02 12:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054184', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:17:12', '2025-12-02 12:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054179', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to increase his IUA to $2500 eff 1/1/26. I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:16:48', '2025-12-02 12:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175053062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', NULL, '12-2-25 Leave her membership as Care+. She wants thermograms and some labs. She doesn''t want the other ACA benefits. She will lose HAB and save $107 per month. Her new total amount will be $381/$1250. She''s happy with that and doesn''t need to do anything for 2026. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 12:08:03', '2025-12-02 12:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175039195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175088002', 'Jeffrey Houchin', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-02 12:03:59', '2025-12-02 12:03:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159433019', 'Julie Mader', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium HSA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 12:00:09', '2025-12-02 12:00:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159433019', 'Julie Mader', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to switch to the Premium HSA membership eff 1/1/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 11:56:31', '2025-12-02 11:56:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175053044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081351009', 'Brian Egan', NULL, '12-2-25 Shannon is geting ins through her employer. She thinks it''s free for her and possibly $320 for her husband. She wants to keep Nextera bc she really likes her dr. She can be removed from this MPB membership. Brian''s cost will be $299 for Premium Care instead of $320. The employer ins is about $7500 ded and $10K mop probably. She has to look closer. This would be $1000 per incident instead. She will discuss it with Brian. It sounds like she understood what I was saying. She''ll call me back with her decision by Dec. 15th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 11:49:39', '2025-12-02 11:49:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175039167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175084018', 'Kevin Henderson', 'Member & Children $5000 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-12-02 11:47:37', '2025-12-02 11:47:37');
