  ('zcrm_1579374000175053032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162327044', 'Anna Martin', NULL, '12-2-25 Anna chose Kaiser to keep her costs close to what she was paying in 2025. Keeping income at $42,700 with $950 Ded and $3350 mop per individual.  She''s OK with Kaiser since her son was on it this year and she used it years ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 11:35:59', '2025-12-02 11:35:59'),
