  ('zcrm_1579374000175032019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, '12/2 member left a VM. Says she has been having issues reaching telehealth. I called Lyric and talked with Hailey.<br>She recommended that I call the member and tell her to take her spam block off. I called member and informed her to take her spam block off. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 10:38:52', '2025-12-02 10:38:52'),
