  ('zcrm_1579374000175053004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175957001', 'Jacob Cook', NULL, '12-1-25 Deb was referred by Krista Rogers for Deb''s son Jacob. I happened to be driving when she called and couldn''t add my notes to the CRM. Her son is turning 26 in Feb. She''d like to get a Jan. 1st start date. He''s away this week and coming home next week. We have another appt scheduled for Wed. Dec. 10th upon his return. They are considering the Care+ $2500 IUA at the moment. They need to figure out who and how they will pay. I''ll share the video for him to watch as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-02 09:22:12', '2025-12-02 21:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175054001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146703002', 'Marcus Muirhead', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to switch to the Secure Membership eff 1/1/26.  I will process.  After looking at this members entry in A123 they already have the Secure membership changing to this eff 1/1/24.  Jane has been informed of this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 09:20:22', '2025-12-02 09:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175044025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172426001', 'Richard Sonnier', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:12:58', '2025-12-02 09:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175049015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Sunny called in to because she is unable to find a provider in network , It appears that Adam is working on this already. I let samuel i will have Adam call him back wit his findings AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:08:44', '2025-12-02 09:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175032009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174040002', 'Monika Franz', NULL, '12/2 member emailed that she couldn''t find prices on RX Valet. Sent her two new coupons from Single Care and explained<br>that this is the best prie as of today. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:07:50', '2025-12-02 09:07:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173176001', 'Christopher Von Handorf', NULL, 'Chris called because he missed the welcome call from Vanessa. I was able to transfer him to her when he called in to let us know he missed the call and he was able to get his welcome call then.<br>AJ 12/2/25', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:07:29', '2025-12-02 13:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171824002', 'Matthias Leibik', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Matthias called to see what he could do for dermatology. He wanted to know if there was any preventative benefit. I let him kno the only dermatology we have would be through the telehealth and then if he went to a dermatologists in person it would be an out of pocket costs.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:05:19', '2025-12-02 09:05:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677037', 'Stacy Otis', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Going back and fourth answering her questions through email about possibly changing her membership due to finanical reasons. Letting her know the options she has to save her some money<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:02:52', '2025-12-02 09:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148499103', 'Courtney Armen', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Courtney called in having some login issues. I was able to assist her in getting logged in and she was good to go from there<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:01:25', '2025-12-02 09:01:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175034011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152320002', 'Stephanie Watson', 'New Membership eff 1/1/26', 'Member &amp; Fam $1250 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-12-02 09:01:10', '2025-12-02 09:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175044006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173444041', 'Benjamin Larsen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 09:00:04', '2025-12-02 09:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175045001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155175002', 'Anthony Seabert', NULL, '12/2/25<br>Lindsay called to see what to do now that she is pregnant. I walked her through the maternity share request process and gave her some info on what to expect throughout this process. LEt her know to pay her IUa and get the share request started for maternity then go see her dr and do what they say. Also let her know to reach out if she has any questions or needs guidance.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 08:59:49', '2025-12-02 08:59:49'),
