  ('zcrm_1579374000175038001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078409064', 'Maria Blaettner', NULL, '12/2/25 - Notified member that invoice from Quest Diag. had not been sent to ARM. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 08:51:47', '2025-12-02 08:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000175032001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '12/2. Called PHCS directly. Their direct number was 800-950-7040. Their voicemail states that it takes 90 to 120 days to be approved on their network if a Dr applies. I sent an email to Trina explaining this is their policy. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-02 08:45:26', '2025-12-02 08:45:26'),
