  ('zcrm_1579374000174963024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155322082', 'Valerie Reynolds', NULL, '12-2-25 Valerie''s husband is aging into Medicare for Jan. 1st. I''ve sent her the intro to Alyssa and Andrea. We have an appt set for next week to review her C4 options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-01 16:05:11', '2025-12-01 16:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174963016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, '12-1-25 Ashley just had a colonoscopy that cost $8K!  I instructed her to go back and make sure they understand she''s self pay and can''t pay $8K for a preventive colonoscopy. They found an removed one cancerous polyp. The cash price in VT ranges from $1550-$5500 with $5K as the worst listed.  I told her to find out if it was done as diagnostic. If so, she can run it a new Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-01 15:22:47', '2025-12-01 15:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174941102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721041', 'Suzanne Finder', NULL, '12/1/25<br>Called back after speaking with the dermatologists and they said she needs a biopsy. I looked up some options for providers on the bluebook and sent them to her. Let her know to say she is cash pay to get that discount and save receipts in case she reaches the IUA with this.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-01 15:00:37', '2025-12-01 15:00:37'),
