  ('zcrm_1579374000174941097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '12/1/2025<br>called to see how exactly what to do for a cataracts surgery with sedera. Looked in the guidelines and quoted to him what he needs to do . Sedera does cataracts surgery as 2 separate needs (one for each eye). I let him know this and to get an estimate and treatment plan to begin a share request to get the process going so he can get his surgery taken care of. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-01 14:40:34', '2025-12-01 14:40:34'),
