  ('zcrm_1579374000174941072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721041', 'Suzanne Finder', NULL, '12/1/25<br>Suzanne called to see what to do after a telehealth derma visit. She got two separate emails saying two different instructions so she wanted to know what to do exactly. They told her they would call and they would send a treatment plan in the next 3 days. she wanted to know if she needed to look out for the call or not. telehealth let her know that since she requested it they will give her a call at sometime today. if she misses it to just call back to get re-connected with the dr to discuss the pictures suzanne uploaded.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-01 14:03:32', '2025-12-01 14:03:32'),
