  ('zcrm_1579374000174963006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863212', 'Hillary Thomas', NULL, '12-1-25 Tracy called bc Hillary''s tumor removal that was found in her annual visit was deemed pre-x according to Sedera. Her needs coordintator is Connie that they''re working with. Tracy will work with Connie to prove that it''s not pre-x. It''s brand new that nobody knew about until the wellness screening.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-12-01 10:55:19', '2025-12-01 10:55:19'),
