  ('zcrm_1579374000174941008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, '12/1/25<br>Susan called to verify if a prescription was sent to RX valet for them to ship it. We called RX valet together and they said they have not received the prescription yet. Susan said she would call the dr and get it re sent after rx valet sent her the info again to make sure she had the right info to give to the dr.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-12-01 09:51:23', '2025-12-01 09:51:23'),
