hange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 6609730238</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 12/01/25 - 12/31/25</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 11/30/25</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-30 20:53:39', '2025-11-30 20:53:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174894096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174894039', 'James Lerner', NULL, '11-30-25 James Lerner is Cari''s client!  James just turned 26 on the 26th of Nov. I believe. He will be kicked off his parent''s plan today. Cari helped them primarily and worked with his parents Andrew and Holly. James has epilepsy and seizures so C4 is the best option for him to include his Dr. and medications. They chose Anthem CO Option Gold Pathway Essentials Std for the mental health benefits and drug prices. We got him a Dec. 1st start date for $322.96 and Jan. 1st with the new plan for $392.97. He completed the application himself and submitted the first payment for Dec. 2025 but not the 1st payment for 2026 bc they are waiting to see if he qualifies for Medicaid. He has no income but it''s dependent upon the new work qualifications.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-30 20:50:35', '2025-11-30 20:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174894029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174722002', 'Ashley Harvey', NULL, '<span style="">11-26-25 Jim Harvey came to me via Christine Harvey to help take care of his 22 year old daughter, Ashley who is in Spain now. She''ll be coming back to CO and trying to get her visa to go back to Spain in 2026 sometime. She''s healthy. She just graduated from CU in May and is an oper in Spain under the table. Jim got Ashley enrolled in Premium Care since that has the best intl benefits. Chose $1000/$249. Jim is also going to be in Spain for about 6 months but might like to explore Secure HSA for himself and wife Bobbi. He lives in Naples, FL. So, Premium Care isn''t an option. He''ll be going back and forth between CO and Spain in 2026. It''s good that he has ins over there since Secure HSA isn''t quite as comprehensive as Premium Care for intl. He is using Faye for his travel insurance and it''s also good for extreme sports protection alongside the travel insurance.  Looks like a good idea for some. They work with travel agents, not health ins agents though.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-30 20:37:35', '2025-11-30 20:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174894011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163519006', 'Mary Steiner', NULL, '11-26-25 Left vm on Nov. 26th. Her vm says Aspire Pilates. She''s reviewing her C4 options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-30 19:30:34', '2025-11-30 19:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174881011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136403002', 'Duane Ellsworth', 'Voice message from Angie on 11/30', 'Angie left me a voice msg on 11/21 and Verizon didn''t deliver it to me until today.  Called her and LM. Also sent her an email (<a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://angiestarr18@yahoo.com/"><u>angiestarr18@yahoo.com</u></a>) and provided the latest Cognito form link to make the IUA change to 2500 for the upcoming year.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2025-11-30 10:20:44', '2025-11-30 10:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174877016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173666001', 'Angela Rothamp', NULL, '11-29-25 I just received a note from Jayson Garcia that Angie also reached out to me via the Naturally Inspired Health group. My link still does not work to notify me properly. But, she reached me previously and we already talked.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-29 18:06:21', '2025-11-29 18:06:21'),
