  ('zcrm_1579374000174776036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166638002', 'Joshua Tammen', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sent to member via vm<br>12/1-mrmber cancelled due to non pmyment<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:51:36', '2025-12-02 09:21:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174776029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172105002', 'Karen Escarcega Nunez', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sent to member via vm  Member called in and directed me to rerun pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:48:11', '2025-11-28 10:03:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174776022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155296002', 'Christopher Young', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sent to member via vm<br>12/1-member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/3- Member left a voicemail stating he never received any notification of decline, only the email that the Membership was cancelled.  <br>12/4-I forwarded him the email that was sent by Patti from her email on 11/27 and advised him to re-enroll with his advisor who was copied on all emails. Christopher Young called in to review this situation.  I reviewed the dates that we were notified and tried to reach him.  He will contact Jonathan Masters to re-enroll for January 1, 2026 start.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:41:44', '2025-12-04 10:11:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174776015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amoumt', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sen to member via vm<br>Member called in and told me that his business acct had been hacked and that he wiuld be submitting A CC for this months pmt and would submit a new Bank Acct later whenhe receives.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:35:56', '2025-11-28 10:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174776008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086960002', 'Thomas Worley', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sent to member via vm  I spoke to member and he was very indifferent said it was a timing issue and that there was no problem that they could get other insurance.  Member later emailed me to rerun pmt on 12/1.<br>12/1- Per Patti - rerun at Member''s direction.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:32:24', '2025-12-01 07:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174776001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '12/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor em<br>12/28-2nd notice left for member via vm<br>12/1-Member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>Member contacted us that they were involved in a need so I will contact Planstin and get them reinstated.  Member also submitted a new email that he monitors a little better.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:25:41', '2025-12-03 07:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174773015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125715002', 'Warithee Arancio', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '12/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/28-sopke with spouse John and he will update pmt to a CC his wife is from Tailand and appreciates us giving her coverage.  He will submit Cognito. Spouse submitted I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 07:00:51', '2025-11-28 10:20:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174773008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162402001', 'Ariel Tidwell', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sent via phone to member unable to leave vm mailbox full<br>12/1-member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 06:54:18', '2025-12-02 09:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174773001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amt', '11/27-1st notice to member &amp; advisor via em<br>11/28-2nd notice sen to member via vm Member hung up on me twice<br>12/1-Member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em<br>12/3-Kathleen left a voice message after hours.  I was waiting to call her back, because she is in AZ.  In the meantime, Kathleen called in stating they were out of town, stressful time of year, husband did something with the bank accounts.  Told her we tried to contact her on the day the ACH declined which was 11/27 via email and again via phone on 11/28 and was hung up on.  Therefore the Membership cancelled.  Explained that when a payment declines, we do not rerun the Share Amount without Member''s direction.  We did not hear anything so the membership expired at the end of the month.  She was frustrated but will contact her Advisor Kevin Michaels to re-enroll for Jan 1, 2026.  Patti spoke with Planstin.  Able to re-instate for December 1, 2025.  Member to call me back to let me know if I can rerun Bank or will submit another payment method.<br>12/3 @12:10PM Kathleen called in and directed me to rerun payment on Bank Acct ending 1189. She waited on the phone until it went through.  She has been reinstated for December 2025.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-27 06:48:10', '2025-12-03 10:11:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174703170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '11-26-25 Sheryl will keep Secure HSA. She''s going to submit some bills ofr lyme to keep the Need opened before Nov. 30th. She had some bill from May 30th. She also hates ACA plans and sees how terrible they are. She says she argues with people who try to convince her otherwise. But the plans were better before ACA came to fruition. She says Zion and/or MPB are great. Not sure who she was referring to. But, she''s happy and will stay on track for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 17:00:16', '2025-11-26 17:00:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174703165', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '11-26-25 Serious phone tag. I left her another vm. She has Secure HSA and just wants to understand HAB and those changes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 16:36:39', '2025-11-26 16:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174703157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, '11-26-25 Russell cancelled his Care+ membership and moved to Premium Care for Jan. 1st since he''s a pro cyclist. They don''t have limitations. His wife may choose to join at a later date as well. He''s also happy that this protects him internationally. He has an accident policy for $100 a  year that protects him up to $50K!  That''s incredible He will keep that and chose the $2500 IUA for $246. With ES it will be $487 if they choose to have her join.  <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"> He got the confirmation page with the cancellation.  He''s all set! He said his friend has MPB and alerted him about the Pro Sports limitation. He didn''t tell me his name and doesn''t know if I worked with him or not.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 16:31:06', '2025-11-26 16:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174703138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174154004', 'Jana Bravo', NULL, '11/26 update. IT informed me that the link for welcome call isn''t working. We will follow up on Monday. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 14:58:58', '2025-11-26 14:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174703133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174154004', 'Jana Bravo', NULL, '11/26 member sent a chat looking to fix problem. She needs to reschedule her welcome call. Informed her we will resend the link to her email. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 14:53:36', '2025-11-26 14:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174718011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174154004', 'Jana Bravo', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4578 Question : I need to reschedule my welcome call for 2026 since originally your calendar was open on 01/01/2026. When I click the link from the email, the calendar does not show up for me to schedule.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-26 14:46:50', '2025-11-26 14:46:50'),
