  ('zcrm_1579374000174717031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179001', 'Roxanne Olsen', NULL, '11/26/25 - Sent e-mail to member requesting that bill for her wellness check be sent by the provider. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 13:32:12', '2025-11-26 13:32:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174712010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109495026', 'Karen Luthart', NULL, 'Member called in to check in to see the status of her Membership.  I told her that she was cancelled on 10/31 and final notice of cancellation was sent out to her email on 11/3.  She is aware that we have been trying to reach her.  She has been digging herself out of a hole for the past 30 days and is just now able to get back to us. Said text is the best way to reach her. (we don''t have that yet) I told her she would have to contact Christine to re-enroll for Jan 1, 2026 start date.  She asked how it affects her taxes.  I told her to contact a tax advisor in CA for that.  She asked how our end of year form would look. I told her it would only show her the dates that her membership was active.  She will contact Christine to reenroll.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-26 13:27:21', '2025-11-26 13:27:21'),
