  ('zcrm_1579374000174711001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170553002', 'Leslie Peters', '11/26', 'confirmed coverage of her well womans visit, pap smear, mammograms etc, let her know her bone density would most likely be diagnostic and then also confirmed with her that her calcium heart scoring would be better priced at the cash pay she mentioned of 105', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-26 12:48:41', '2025-11-26 12:48:41'),
