  ('zcrm_1579374000174690012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '11/26/25<br>Sent email to follow up and see if she was able to log into telehealth AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 12:41:55', '2025-11-26 12:41:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174655093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177113120', 'Mark Micucci', NULL, '11-26-25 Mark and his wife are paying $813 for a Cigna Gold plan but it will be going up to $1120 or $1150 in 2026. Mark is 43 and wife is 41. They are self-employed and W2. He''s a realtor. They don''t use tobacco, no meds for Mark. His wife uses GLP1 for weight and purely vanity purposes. Otherwise, they are healthy, no -pre-x. He has to walk into an appt. So, I''ll send him the video and we have a meeting next Friday. He looked at indemnity plans, DPC memberships, US Health, UC Health and isn''t excited about any of them. He really wants to be protected for catastrophic scenarios. Secure HSA will be best for their age and they want wellness visits, etc. We will discuss this on Friday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 12:39:06', '2025-11-26 12:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174600077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174675024', 'Hans Ellis', 'Member & Family $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-26 12:37:26', '2025-11-26 12:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174693001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174681003', 'Diana Ball', NULL, 'I reached out to member because she had put "List Bil" as the method of payment.  She said that she wanted to be billed and not go through a credit Card.  I advised that we did not bill members.  I will send out Payment Update Link and Pend app until I receive', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-26 12:34:01', '2025-11-26 12:34:01'),
