  ('zcrm_1579374000174678087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175843021', 'Anna Levesque', NULL, '11-26-25 Andrew called me yesterday via Amos Shuman. He wants MPB and has been reviewing info and wants to read the guidelines. I left him a vm and let him know I can send all relevant guidelines once we determine the best membership for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 12:24:03', '2025-11-26 12:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174678077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '11-26-25 Deb called bc RMHP doesn''t show her in the system yet. She was a bit panicked. But, it might not show up yet. Perhaps they are pushing them all through on Dec. 1st as well. Not sure. She will call them next week and try again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-26 12:20:57', '2025-11-26 12:20:57'),
