  ('zcrm_1579374000174661005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', NULL, '11/26/25 Notified member that RX Valet had a reasonable price for her Estradiol Vaginal Cream. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 10:00:09', '2025-11-26 10:00:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174603386', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173925001', 'Jay Adams', NULL, '11/26 Followed up with member about his rx request quotes. Sent him single care quotes as well. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 09:58:09', '2025-11-26 09:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174655072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169726005', 'Gregory Walzer', NULL, '11/26/25<br>Janelle called in to say she was having issues logging into the telehealth so i tried to check for her since i was able to login for someone else recently and then i could not login. it was stuck loading. going to look into it to see if this is isolated or if multiple people are experiencing this by talking with IT. When i get an answer i will update Janelle and let her know what is going on . She has been experiencing this issue since last night so it seems like an issues isolated to her. <br><span><br></span>Called her back and left a VM to let her know IT said there are no major issues and things should be working. If she is still having issues i let her know to call so i could do a live troubleshoot with her and IT since i am not sure what the problem is for her. It seems like connectivity issues<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-26 09:53:07', '2025-11-26 11:36:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174600041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174665018', 'Gary Morgan', 'Member & Spouse $5000 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-26 09:51:38', '2025-11-26 09:51:38'),
