  ('zcrm_1579374000174603034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008568067', 'Andrea Williamson', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI.<br>11/26- Member replied to decline email stating to try again using the same account.  It was a few dollars short and she replenished it.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-26 06:50:51', '2025-11-26 12:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174603029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174162004', 'Marlo Torres-Strong', 'Decline of Enrollment Fee', '11/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI.  Member called into review payment decline due to No account.  She will submit a payment update form.<br>12/1- STM:  She left a voicemail to be sure her payment went through.  She was having a hard time completing the payment update form.  She was trying to complete it while I was on the phone to be sure it went through - she did not do it right and did not want me to hold - Said she would complete it and I told her to be sure to click the submit button and we will send her a confirmation after we process it.<br>12/3- Member called in to check the status of her payment.  She said she tried several times to complete the Payment Update Form but never received confirmation that it was processed.  I waited online while she retried to submit the form.  She finished it and it said "Thank you for filling out the form.  Your response has been recorded."  We never received the Cognito Form.  I told her to go to the MPB website to complete it there.  She did the same thing, with the same response.  We never received the Cognito Form.  I told her we would check into the problem and get back to her.  IN the meantime, she gave me her bank info to rerun the Enrollment Fee when the system comes back up.  The System is working now:  I reran the Enrollment Fee of $125 with bank ending 1670 and it was approved.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-26 06:49:40', '2025-12-03 14:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174603024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129966002', 'Allyson Crow', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/1-member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-26 06:48:30', '2025-12-02 09:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174603019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/26-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/1- Member left voicemail from billing messages.  Contacted her bank.  Short of payment.  Time of year is hard.  May be able to make payment by this evening. Husband gets paid next Thursday.  Wants us to hold off canceling her for a few days?  Leo to contact.<br>12/2- Leo stm.  Said we can rerun payment on Thursday 12/4.  OK per Patti.<br>12/4- I reran. Approved', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-26 06:47:20', '2025-12-04 07:00:04'),
