  ('zcrm_1579374000174525142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124104002', 'Sherwin Miguel', NULL, '11/25/25<br>Sherwin called to say his therapist from MSEAP did not receive the forms for him to get reimbursed for the last visit they had like he usually does. Sherwin says he has 4 visits left and wants to make sure the contract is being honored until the end of the year as promised. Going to escalate his case and see who we would need to talk to to get this taken care of for him. will f/u tomorrow<br><span><br></span>Therapists name is Kris sheets- thrive counseling services  <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 13:54:16', '2025-11-25 14:01:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174555015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171959002', 'Autumn Jones', '11/25/25', 'Mental health provider inquired whether member has coverage or is it self-pay. It''s self-pay. Not covered by Zion. Provider needs to be in-network with Lyric. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 13:10:03', '2025-11-25 13:10:03'),
