  ('zcrm_1579374000174525090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', NULL, '11/25/25<br>Went to f/u up with Jennifer and realized she has reached out and had her situation handled by the rest of the awesome concierge like tupac and susan. The thing i had a task set for is now not relevant so i will close the task<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 11:20:17', '2025-11-25 11:20:17'),
