  ('zcrm_1579374000174503075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127155017', 'Michael Couris', NULL, '11/25 Erika call. She inquired about a labcorp billing issue. Said she had a pap smear. I returned her phone call.<br>Recommended to her to check with Dr to see if it was coded as a preventative test.  If coded as preventative, I informed her to put it in her chart with correct coding or to send to ARM directly.<br><span><br></span><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 10:44:01', '2025-11-25 10:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174525039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081351009', 'Brian Egan', NULL, '11/25/25<br>Shannon called to just take some notes and find out how the membership works. I explained the IUA and how the membership is responsible for the first three then the first $500 on any need for the rest of the year after that. Let her know how the process goes with a medical need reaching the IUA. And also explained how we do not use deductibles and max out of pocket numbers.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 10:35:04', '2025-11-25 10:35:04'),
