  ('zcrm_1579374000174525015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169910081', 'John Carlock', NULL, '11/25/25<br>called to get more info on how her membership works for an upcoming procedure. She thought since the year is starting over so would her share request. I let her know if she starts the share request now then the new year would not effect it and the share request can continue to the new year for her procedure since it goes by the treatment course and not the year. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-25 09:57:09', '2025-11-25 09:57:09'),
