  ('zcrm_1579374000174464089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140562002', 'Cynthia Farrell', NULL, '11-24-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">"Hi Wendy - Wanted to confirm that I upgraded to the Premium HSA and also added the Dental 500 Series plan."</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 22:21:02', '2025-11-24 22:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135858012', 'Jessica Vollmer', NULL, '11-24-25 She''s letting her Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 auto renew. It''s showing $387.65 per month with $80 from CAP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 22:03:56', '2025-11-24 22:03:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135858012', 'Jessica Vollmer', NULL, '11-24-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi wendy, </span><br><br>I think I am going to stay with the same plan this year and let it auto renew.<br><br>Thank you!<br>Jessica Vollmer', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 22:02:48', '2025-11-24 22:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134767002', 'Kara Weld', NULL, '11-24-25 Kara has determined that she can cancel her employees from the group plan. She wants to move forward with a Jan. 1st start date with HA Co-Op. Andrea will take over the account. They are at the final phase of enrollment.  I just left Kara an vm to hand it off.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 16:00:16', '2025-11-24 16:00:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '11-24-25 Traci plans to upgrade from Premium Care to Premium HSA to get her annual wellness screenings. She knows she''ll have a card and needs to go in network unlike HAB. She''ll follow my instructions and proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 15:06:53', '2025-11-24 15:06:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161417043', 'Janet Romano', NULL, '11-24-25 Janet has a Select Health plan now and is just worried if she needs an ER visit for  a health issue she has called SVT or something like that. I missed the letters. While she had employer coverage she had an ER visit that was $22K but her insurance refused to pay for it. After much back and forth battling with the insurance company, the hospital just dropped the prive for her to $1400 without insurance!  She couldn''t believe it. She entered about $50K for 2025 and thinks it might be more. 2026 she thinks her retirement income will be about $80K to be safe. She will be over the $62K threshold. We will need to look at her options for 2026 more closely. She''ll have her income stuff prepared when we talk on Dec. 5th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 15:01:14', '2025-11-24 15:01:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, '11-24-25 Russell called to ask questions about the Premium memberships to remove the professional sports limitations since he''s a pro cyclist. I left him  a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 14:43:39', '2025-11-24 14:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174464001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148475239', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '11-24-25 She chose to keep her plan. She was considering a Bronze plan to fund the HSA. But, they are comfortable with the Gold plan and with the 30% coins instead of 50%. Her husband will be moving to Medicare in June and we will need to revisit her plan options bc her cost may leap to $1100 at that time. She''s healthy. She just needs breast MRI''s due to dense breasts. She''s doing them every year for 5 years or something like that. The last one was showing at $17K and her cost was about $1.50. It''s nuts!  Even one month with MCS her savings can pay for the breast MRI which is showing around $588 in Denver. They are all set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 14:40:54', '2025-11-24 14:40:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174463001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179018', 'Annie Fisher', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4566 Question : I recently changed my request for banking. I wanted my monthly payment to be pulled from my savings account. The money was pulled from my checking account. What should I do for next month?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-24 14:39:44', '2025-11-24 14:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174461001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152324020', 'John Weller', NULL, '11/24/25<br>called to verify if a provider was still in network to make an appointment for a colo. Let her know i will validate for her and if not find her a different one<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 14:33:25', '2025-11-24 14:33:25'),
