  ('zcrm_1579374000174449001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172900002', 'Geoffrey House', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he wanted to  cancel his member prior to start on 1/1/26.  He had not spoken to Wiley.   I will send out Cancellation link and refund Enrollment Fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-24 14:16:10', '2025-11-24 14:16:10'),
