  ('zcrm_1579374000174359091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122227001', 'Mary Jane Morris', NULL, '11/24 chatted with member and then called her. Seemed to be confusion as to her having coverage for all labs.<br>She claims that someone informed her they would be covered a few months ago when she called. Gave to Julia to research. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 13:56:39', '2025-11-24 13:56:39'),
