  ('zcrm_1579374000174372095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144180003', 'Robert Hogan', NULL, '11/24/25 - Spoke with member regarding upcoming surgical procedure (gall bladder removal). Informed her she needs to satisfy her $1,000 IUA and to collect all receipts in order to send them to Zion. Also, to get a Good Faith Estimate from her surgeon, hospital, etc. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 13:52:04', '2025-11-24 13:52:04'),
