  ('zcrm_1579374000174372055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, '11/24/25<br>Tessa called in to get more clarity on preventative care and how all that works. Explained that and things like colonoscopies to her<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 13:25:41', '2025-11-24 13:25:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174372050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '11/24/25<br>Jillian called in to see if a colo would be preventative based on the code the dr gave her. i let her know that code is for diagnostic so she will be rescheduling her colo since it will not be covered at 100% under preventative care<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 13:24:44', '2025-11-24 13:24:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174433001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128686021', 'Toni Denise Boucher', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4562 Question : Hi, I need to follow up on some lab work that was completed and get some specific additional tests that require a doctor order. What is the best way to proceed? Can I go through my portal and set up a call through primary care? It isn''t an emergency, or life threatening.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-24 13:20:20', '2025-11-24 13:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174363087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, 'Member''s spouse Martha called in and she told me that Daniel is set to go on Medicare eff 6/26.  He just got the news that he has an elevated PSA score and also his employer is offering him United Heath care Coverage.  We discussed the Pro''s &amp; Con''s of Traditional Healthcare Coverage.  she had a great experience with us when she broke her wrist and she wants he husband to stay with us until Medicare.  Went over the logistics and sent her the google review.  She loves us.  Very willing to do this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-24 13:19:53', '2025-11-24 13:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174430003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168094002', 'Maria Marshall', NULL, '11/24/25 - Sent member name and contact information for imaging center (mammography) (SimonMed Imaging 90-4-638-0217) SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 13:17:51', '2025-11-24 13:17:51'),
