  ('zcrm_1579374000174395053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071246', 'Ann Inai', NULL, '11-24-25 Ann is choosing Premium HSA $1500/$267. She''s a business owner and wants all of the wellness that she couldn''t get with the other options she found that were health shares but more expensive also. She''s very pleased!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 12:46:57', '2025-11-24 12:46:57'),
