  ('zcrm_1579374000174350189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166776002', 'Raymond Urciuoli', '11/24', 'followup up on his issue again today and left another voicemail.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-24 12:33:30', '2025-11-24 12:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174359074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166640019', 'Jeanne Jambor', NULL, '11/24 Member requested for us to schedule an appointment at Montrose hospital. Called them and they said Debbie is the contact. I left her a voicemail. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 12:13:34', '2025-11-24 12:13:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174350155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170783021', 'Hari P Cheedella', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form. After review, it is the same card that is currently active on file.  I will email Member.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-24 12:13:22', '2025-11-24 12:46:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174359069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093012', 'Yuwen Cen', NULL, '11/21 Yuwen emailed again asking to forward her documents directly to Staford health center. I called ARM and they said:<br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Stanford Health Center should contact them directly at 847-394-1700</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">or they can follow the instructions on the back of your ARM card.</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 11:58:46', '2025-11-24 11:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174395043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177113120', 'Mark Micucci', NULL, '11-24-25 Diane Border sent him to me since he''s in CO and was asking about tax credits and C4. Diane and I talked. Even if MCS is best she will happily have me help him since he''s local to me. She''s not sure how he connected with her. Here''s the information she gathered.<br><span><br></span><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"><b><i>Dates of Birth for everyone seeking coverage: </i></b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>6/29/1982 - Mark; 10/16/1984 - Rebeca</i></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"><b><i>-Home Address, including zip and county:</i></b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i> 4615 w 63rd pl, Arvada, CO 80003 (Jefferson County)</i></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>-Size of tax household (i.e. spouse and/or dependents that you include on your tax return, regardless of whether they are seeking coverage): 2</i></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"><b><i>-In order to assess whether you qualify for a premium subsidy (Advance Premium Tax Credit) , estimate your 2026 </i></b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>household</i></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"><b><i> income: </i></b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>last year was $160k, this year will be closer to $120k</i></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"><b><i>-If there are healthcare providers that you wish to have in-network, please provide their names or practice names: </i></b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>none</i></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>-What type of healthcare consumer are you and anyone seeking coverage (i.e. do you see the doctor for other than preventive care or go to urgent care frequently)?  Being treated for chronic and/or pre-existing   conditions?  Taking prescription meds (what meds and why)?: </b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">we do our annuals, I may see a specialist or, have an MRI or an xray; Rebeca goes to a therapist 1 or 2x month; no chronic or pre existing conditions, infrequent medical needs</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"><br></span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;"><i>- Do you currently have health insurance?  If so, is it from an employer or from the marketplace?  Who is your carrier and what is your monthly premium?: Marketplace, Cigna Connect CO Gold plan, $813/mo</i></span></p></li></ul><br><b>I have an LLC, if we wanted to purchase a "business plan," not sure if that is a better option...I''m also interested in understanding options for a catastrophic plan in CO - I''m getting mixed messages about the existence/availability of these plans...</b><br><br><b>Thanks for your time, looking forward to hearing more :)</b><br><br><b>Mark</b><br>720 334 7032<br><span><br></span>I just left him  a vm and responded via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 11:57:45', '2025-11-24 11:57:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174395033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '11-24-25 Cindy needs  a colonoscopy and lives in CB. She has the MPB/PHCS card and will toss the Planstin card that was confusing her. She will do her colonoscopy in Louisville in the PHCS network. If there''s any overage for payment or any problems she knows she can use HAB as back up. She said Robert did this last year and it all worked out well. She understands now. She also refreshed her memory to not show a card for any health issues beyond wellness screenings. She''s good to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 11:34:41', '2025-11-24 11:34:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174363062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541176', 'Megan Bush', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 1/1/26 due to going on the ACA.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-24 11:27:57', '2025-11-24 11:27:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174395021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154585008', 'Nicole Boye', NULL, '11-24-25 Nikki is upgrading to Premium HSA from Premium Care for Jan. 1st effective date. She completed the Cogniro form with me on the line. Eric is a realtor and they own some rental properties through an LLC. Their son Ian did a wellness check recently and he told her since he was so healthy, they didn''t even charge him as  a cash pay patient. She wasn''t sure if he did that on campus or what but she was surprised.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 11:19:48', '2025-11-24 11:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174353562', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174108005', 'Jennifer Barnes', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call after the start date of December 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 11:03:57', '2025-11-24 11:03:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174359062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107954002', 'Joshua Jones', NULL, '11/24 Spoke with Rebecca at Zion. She said she emailed the member a password reset form. DM<br>Guest sent an email to request this.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 10:38:51', '2025-11-24 10:38:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174353500', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173524002', 'Christopher Murphy', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call after the start date of December 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-24 10:36:47', '2025-11-24 10:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174395016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154481402', 'Oscar Stevenson', NULL, '11-24-25 They called t get help in keeping their plan for 2026. Oscar wants to keep his income at $67,600. His plan will go to $343.01 with Cigna Connect CO Option Bronze that they are happy with already and his dr. is in the network. They also have a pediatric dental plan for $0. They were very nice and are good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-24 10:33:48', '2025-11-24 10:33:48'),
