  ('zcrm_1579374000174350004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174259001', 'James Sheehan', 'Decline of 01/26 Enrollment Fee', '11/21- Member reran enrollment fee with new bank info by website.  No record of payment in FTNI.  Pending for review.<br>11/24- Member called in to check on the enrollment fee.  He updated the payment to ACH and it shows pending on his side.  However, we do not see it in FTNI.  Told him we would contact him if it does not go through on our end.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-24 07:55:02', '2025-11-24 12:38:35'),
