  ('zcrm_1579374000174205033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107954002', 'Joshua Jones', NULL, '11/21 responded to member email and sent him link to login to portal and upload documents because he exceeded his IUA. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 12:22:52', '2025-11-21 12:22:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174206071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '11/21/25<br>Tried calling a couple times and got disconnected. Sounded like she answered and hung up once then could not connect afterwards. Will try again later and possibly send a text to get her attention, so she would be willing to talk to me about her bad experience with the concierge, and so i can figure out who she was speaking to since the last person she spoke to was rude to her. Will let her know that is not how our concierge operates and would like to find out who exactly she was speaking to, Also to answer any questions that were not answered and assist her with anything from there,<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 12:17:22', '2025-11-21 12:17:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174207237', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174258005', 'Brigitte Bebey', 'Member & Spouse $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-21 12:12:08', '2025-11-21 12:12:08'),
