  ('zcrm_1579374000174206060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128543002', 'Eugene Small', NULL, '11/21/25<br>Spoke with Roi after she got a bill for a preventative visit. I looked it up and could not see the bill for the amount she mentioned. We tried to call ARM together but they were at lunch so i gave her their number since she said she would be pretty busy for the rest of the day. LEt her know she can also just call us back up as well to assist her with this bill.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 12:04:29', '2025-11-21 12:04:29'),
