  ('zcrm_1579374000174205023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, '11/21/2025 Answered chat inquiry by email about how to create an ID for her husband. DM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 11:49:35', '2025-11-21 11:49:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174198128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161590011', 'Laura Garran', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 11:38:00', '2025-11-21 11:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174224011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4552 Question : My plan is a family plan. Can my husband create his own separate account under my ID number?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-21 11:23:07', '2025-11-21 11:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174239016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564305', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '11-21-25 Rob had a brutal year with a major ski accident in the back bowls. When they did a cat scan they discovered a mass on his kidney! It was lucky that they found it early and addressed it immediately. They''ve removed it and he had a partial nephrectomy, took half of his kidney out. He had surgery on May 27th. Then Aug. 27th he had a knee surgery due to the ski accident his knee was pretty messed up. So he wants to keep 6 drs which he''s reviewing through the Estimator tool.  For Maggie and Sam we''re exploring Premium HSA or Secure HSA. Sam has asthma and ADD and Maggie has just some dermatology issues. We might want to go the Secure HSA path just bc of Steadman''s as the option. I only thought if this after we talked. They ski, mtn bike, play hockey, XC, etc.Their income will be about $150K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-21 11:03:36', '2025-11-22 13:35:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174198104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170822008', 'Joanna Hunter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 10:50:57', '2025-11-21 10:50:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174202189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to raise her IUA due to the price increase.  I will send out Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 10:48:37', '2025-11-21 10:48:37'),
