  ('zcrm_1579374000174207108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064231002', 'Alexandra Goldburt', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- Member left voicemail after hours to review her payment.  I left Member voicemail to call back.Member called back. I reviewed the differences in the payment amount were the 3% processing fee for a card and the annual membership fee of $25.00.  She will send in an update payment form to change back to a bank account.  She also inquired about changing her IUA amount.  I advised her to speak with her healthcare advisor to review. Member called back and submitted a payment update form back to ACH and asked if she will be charged the processing fee - I told her no.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-21 09:41:09', '2025-11-25 06:31:16'),
