  ('zcrm_1579374000174207103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155432001', 'Carla Herriges', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/1-member cancelled due to non pmt.  Membership was reinstated at the last minute and payment was run on 12/1/25', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-21 09:40:25', '2025-12-22 10:44:06'),
