  ('zcrm_1579374000174202055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099826002', 'Ramon Gines', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24-2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/26- Voicemail from Member stating he lost his wallet and does not have the full card number. Supposed to receive a card this week to get up to date with payment.  <br>12/1-Left voicemail for Member to get a firm date or provide an alternate form of payment method for this month and then update it when he receives the new card.<br>12/4-Called Member to follow up on receiving his new card.  He did receive the new card. I directed him to the website to the Update Form of Payment link to submit.  Sent a follow up Final Notice email  at 12:33 PM to send the Payment Update Form by 3PM EST today or his Membership will be cancelled.<br>12/5- Final notice of cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em.<br>12/5- Member submitted Payment Update Form at 10:28 AM after the Final Notice of Cancellation email was sent out today at 8:32 AM.  I replied to the Member with the email that was sent to him on 12/4 stating that if we did not receive the form by 3PM EST on 12/4 that the membership will be cancelled.  Stated that Member must contact Advisor to re-enroll and that his Payment Update Form will not be processed, as the Membership is cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 09:24:29', '2025-12-05 08:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174202050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085590002', 'Mike Goldstein', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>12/1-Member cancelled for non Pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 09:23:17', '2025-12-02 08:21:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174235001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174151001', 'Adam Stratton', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4551 Question : Good morning. I downloaded the "The Health Wallet" app. It did not find my phone number. Is this because my enrollment has not yet begun?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-21 09:22:49', '2025-11-21 09:22:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174202045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173836001', 'Martin Byford', 'Decline of Enrollment Fee', '11/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24-Member submitted corrected ACH info I will rerun Member left off 1 digit on Acct number I reran Enrollment Fee &amp; 1st months Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 09:22:00', '2025-11-24 07:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174207023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172130019', 'Nelson Muller', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/26- Charlotte - Member''s mom called in regarding the email and voice message for her sons'' account.  I told her that there is an invalid ABA number.  She wanted me to take it over the phone, because they are not internet savvy, nor do they have smart phones.  I told her that I could not do that.  I directed her to the website or for Nelson to check the decline email to update the payment with the correct bank info.  She will work with her son over the weekend to get it done.<br>12/1-member cancelled due to non pmt<br>12/2- Final Notice of Cancellation sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-21 09:21:35', '2025-12-02 08:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174202040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173757019', 'Heidi Queen', 'Decline of Enrollment Fee', '11/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- Member submitted payment update form. I will process. Reran- Enrollment Fee &amp; Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 09:20:59', '2025-11-24 07:11:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174211006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154385002', 'Cassidy Aiken', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4550 Question : Hello! My cirrusMD is saying my account is inactive, could you help me with that?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-11-21 09:20:56', '2025-11-21 09:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174207018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212040', 'Kevin Sather', 'Decline of 12/25 Share Amount', '11/21- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- 2nd notice sent to member &amp; advisor via AI<br>11/24- Member submitted payment update form. I will process. Payment declined due to invalid ABA.<br>Kevin called in and gave us an updated Routing number. I will reprocess.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-21 09:20:48', '2025-11-25 06:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174206014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137105002', 'Christopher Ferritto', NULL, '11/21/25<br>Chris called to get more info on how his membership works. i explained how he would use it and what to do in different scenarios such as preventative and non. Let him know what to do to start a share request. Then just gave him some general education on how to use all of those features<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 08:48:18', '2025-11-21 08:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174198038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170719002', 'Mark Heider', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 08:38:48', '2025-11-21 08:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174202030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163473002', 'Tammy Chiarelli-Kelling', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after we billed on 11/20 effective 12/25 Due to financial reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-21 08:37:24', '2025-11-21 08:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174206009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160473002', 'Lindsay Kline', NULL, '11/21/25<br>Sent email to answer her questions about having insurance and MPB at the same time. At first i thought she had the health share portion based on the questions she was asking and the info she was asking for. I misunderstood and explained to her how that would work with having both and that the cost share would get in line behind any other coverages. After realizing she is only in the MEC + essentials i reached out and let her know that unfortunately she does not have the cost share aspect in her membership so she only has her other insurance for this surgery she is asking about. Let her know to reach out with any other questions on what exactly her membership includes and how it all works so there will be no confusion in the future on what she can do with the features of her membership along with her current insurance through her employer. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-21 08:34:49', '2025-11-21 08:34:49'),
