  ('zcrm_1579374000174142110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071198', 'John Tompkins', NULL, '11-20-25 Cal is 27 and Izzy is 28. They live in NY now and just moved from MT. They were referred by their mom Penny who was referred by Julie Perington. Cal is self-employed and Izzy has a W2 job with benefits. She doesn''t know what she pays. She thinks only about $50 and the company pays the rest possibly. The only health issue was Cal had a snowboarding injury last winter and is completely healed now. Izzy takes Adderall, wellbutrin and spirnazalone (?). I looked all of them up on GoodRX and they were all super cheap with as low as $2 - $15.  Izzy wants her women''s wellness visits, mental health therapy and psychiatrist appointments and meds prescriptions. Izzy also wants dermatology appts and I let her know about the 3 virtual visits. Izzy will likely be best served by her work ins and Cal potentially Care+. Izzy might quit her job and then they are considering Secure HSA possibly for her to get wellness and HSA compliance. They know the Dec. 15th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 22:42:47', '2025-11-20 22:42:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174142100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175212001', 'Julie Barker', NULL, '11-20-25 Julie 57 is a retired school teacher in IL and her Cobra ran out. She has a BCBS HMO via Healthcare.gov. She has  a boyfriend and they are planning to get married. But, she needs something more affordable  and he might too. She''s tired of the current health insurance system that covers nothing. She does go in for her annual wellness exam, labs and thyroid check. She''s healthy other than a thyroid issue. She doesn''t take any meds. Her new plan looks like it will cost her $800. She substitute teachers but it''s W2. So, she can''t qualify for the HSA memberships. She takes some vitamins. We discussed Care+ and Premium Care. She might be more comfortable with Premium Care since it includes the mammo and colonoscopy and it''s cheaper. She will save $500 per month = $6000 per year. This can easily pay for her well checks.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 22:04:03', '2025-11-20 22:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174142084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044575094', 'Doug Klof', NULL, '11-20-25 Doug wants to clarify how Heather''s BRCA2 gene will be handles if he adds her to the membership. It was discovered 8 years ago and has been screened ever since. Nothing has ever changed and scans always come out showing no problems. I sent my inquiry to Sedera and will wait to see what they tell me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 16:00:02', '2025-11-20 16:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174096076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139736002', 'Francille Cash', '11/20', 'helped her open a sharing request for her endometriosis - Tupac', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-20 15:29:21', '2025-11-20 15:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174142076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '11-20-25 Christine called bc she couldn''t get her questions answered by the Concierge Team. She wanted to understand if she could submit a Need from an injection she had back in 2023 and needs another one now in 2025 for her knee. That''s related to an old knee issue, ie. pre-x. I let her know that won''t be shared at all unless she waits until Feb. which she''s not willing to do. She wants to ski. She also needs an injection in her hand which is  a new problem. I let her know it will be a new Need that she can submit if it exceeds $1000 IUA. I also explained HAB ending and she''ll just keep her membership as is.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 14:55:55', '2025-11-20 14:55:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174089040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', NULL, '11/20 Called member back from her voicemail. She asked many questions about her plan. We informed her that she can''t access telehealth until 12/01 which is her start date.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-20 14:48:59', '2025-11-20 14:48:59'),
