  ('zcrm_1579374000174096063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', '11/20', 'called about phcs provider status; provider name: boulder medical center, npi:1306820923, tin: 840834835, zip code: 80304. Women''s Imaging of Longmont, npi:1073247334, tin, 1380 tulip st suite 3 longmont. bouldr medical center works with phcs, womens imaging coudl not figure out but she has workaround already confirmed for reimbusement with arm', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-20 14:44:57', '2025-11-20 14:44:57'),
