  ('zcrm_1579374000174096058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', '11/20', 'called asking about breast pump eligiblity for sharing, i let her know they are not eligible', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-20 14:01:54', '2025-11-20 14:01:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174159071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165514003', 'Nicole Pingel', NULL, '11/20/25 Sent e-mail to member regarding Sterlara eligibility.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-20 14:01:40', '2025-11-20 14:01:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174159050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107954002', 'Joshua Jones', NULL, '11/20/25 Sent PT guidelines to member. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-20 13:40:42', '2025-11-20 13:40:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174142066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586130', 'Jane Pulliam', NULL, '11-20-25 Jane had their income at about $96K for 2025. The couldn''t remember where she came up with the $21K investment income and $23K capital gains or vice versa. She funds the HSA fully and has some other expenses. We chose to go back to her W2 income of $66,500 ish and included Drake''s income which was about $5725 and added those to be about $72K for 2026 as her best guess. This gives them a massive APTC of $3300ish!  She can choose a RMVHP Gold plan for only $4.04 or Bronze CoPay Focus for  $3.95 ish. Once Drake moves to Medicare for April 1st, this will change the equation and she may need to move back to MPB. Drake has back issues which is why they went to C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 13:38:50', '2025-11-20 13:38:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174079174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123074010', 'Caleb Vogtner', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-20 13:29:50', '2025-11-20 13:29:50'),
