  ('zcrm_1579374000174159001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166519002', 'Abby Hartmann', NULL, '11/20/25<br>Spoke with member re: submitting receipts to satisfy IUA. Suggested getting Good Faith Estimates from surgeon, anesthesiologist, hospital costs, etc ,  submit them to Zion for sharing., SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-20 12:12:33', '2025-11-20 12:20:13'),
