  ('zcrm_1579374000174096046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612001', 'Jennifer Speed', '11/20', 'had a mammogram, two months ago maybe, they were not able to get in contact with arm, paid for it self pay and sent bill to alt risk, called last week to check on reimbursement, arm said check was sent out in mail and to call back in 2 weeks if check not received, called back cause check not received - mammo date of service: october 15th, arm told me check was mailed out and it should be there any day now. 2 annnual wellness visits for children(Princeton Lakes Pediatrics  - july 22nd 2025 for both skyla\ and scottie), submitted to arm for reimbursment, wants update, had a gyno visit in march (well womans visit + pap smear - March 19th - Dunwoody OBGYN). both claims paid - 05-20, edited claims , came in 11/03 - her 168 cost is oop(n92.1, n93.9 atlanta women''s pathology), date: 05/14/24 (it''s diagnostic) ,$ 859.25 bill - oop - date: 05/20/2024 (diagnostic) (atlanta womans specialists, edited - diagnosis code : n92.1 , n93.9)was prior to effective date: can apply for discount or self pay, discount is 300 - solution was to let her know to call doctors offices for reimbursment of checks since arm and her both paid.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-20 12:04:02', '2025-11-20 12:04:02'),
