  ('zcrm_1579374000174142044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174097018', 'Stephanie Markham', NULL, '11-20-25 This is Analisa''s client that Patti helped to re-enroll onto Secure HSA bc Glen is aging into Medicare. She has an open Need it sounds like. So, she can''t have a lapse. She''s all set for now. I have a vm into Analisa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 11:56:57', '2025-11-20 11:56:57'),
