  ('zcrm_1579374000174142039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154481201', 'Tammy Steele', NULL, '11-20-25 Tammy thought the entire APTC was going away. She was going to choose a bronze plan, if so. However with the current APTC remaining and CAP included they are very happy to keep their plan for 2026. I pushed through the auto-renewal and let her know to check in with Anthem after 2 weeks to make sure payment is all in order. It should be good to go. She was super nice and relieved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-20 11:48:04', '2025-11-20 11:48:04'),
