  ('zcrm_1579374000174006050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', '11/18', 'Has a question about getting her annual wellness visit taken care of 18 days early from her last one, (she is 3 hours away from her pcp and will only be in town on the 6th, which is when scheduled, need to confirm with lori and give her answer back) - confirmed with lori, she''ll be fine to go for visit. I left her a voicemail to let her know the update.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2025-11-19 13:25:14', '2025-11-19 13:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173955288', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'tried to call back. got disconnected a couple of times. will try and email or text to speak to her also.<br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-11-19 13:15:56', '2025-11-19 13:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173974072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129038011', 'Matthew Mason', NULL, '11-19-25 Matthew was upset bc he definitely can''t afford C4 with his price doubling since he''s on the cusp of no APTC. We put in $88K up from about $66K. He has to pay back $2300 last year due to his income being more than expected. He doesn''t want that to happen again in 2026. He and his wife are both 36. They are paying $400 now but can''t afford $700 thorugh C4. They are young and don''t do much for wellness and he understands they will have to pay for that on their own cash pay without reimbursement. He''s not thrilled about any of it but he doesn''t have many other options. I shared Care+ with him and that will get the monthly back to a level they can handle $387 + 3% = $398.61. He needs to put it on a cc and knows of the fees. This is best since the timing of checks can be tough with autopay. He chose to enroll for a Jan. 1st start date and I''ll send him the overview and video for his wife to watch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-19 13:08:02', '2025-11-19 13:08:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174003040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '11/19/25<br>spoke to his wife about an upcoming procedure and she wanted to know exactly how it would all play out. i let her know she would need to begin a share request because it is possible that they might look at as pre ex. they should not but this has been going on for a while so i was not exactly sure how the share requestt would be handled. So i recommended to get that going and let her know what she would need in order to do so . <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-19 12:54:10', '2025-11-19 12:54:10'),
