  ('zcrm_1579374000173957089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120422026', 'Carolyn Berryman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 12/25 due to getting other coverage.  Karina processed removal frm List Bill.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-19 12:12:28', '2025-11-19 12:12:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173957083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808001', 'Glen Markham', NULL, 'Member called in and had some questions around his transition into Medicare.  He has a couple of needs open and wanted to know how these would be handled.  I told him to reach out directly to Zion as they will probably shut down his portal when he cancels.  He also asked about his wife continuing on the membership. She alos has an open need.  I advised that she will would have to re-enroll and that the deadline was midnight on the 20th (tommorow) to avoid a gap in coverage.  If so that would be considered Pre-Ex and not shareable.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-11-19 11:58:18', '2025-11-19 11:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173953094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174004005', 'Jessica Litton', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-19 11:53:37', '2025-11-19 11:53:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173953086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174025002', 'Melissa Martin', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2025-11-19 11:48:36', '2025-11-19 11:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000174003029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168615016', 'Jeri Roper', NULL, '11/19/25<br>Geoffrey called in to say while trying to enter info for his share request he is experiencing delays with the site. Let him know several people have been experiencing delays today so it might be due to the same reason. Let him know to keep attempting and to reach back out tomorrow if he is still experiencing these lag issues. Will also give him the number for Sedera in case we can not solve his issue or find out what it is so he can call them or we can call them together and figure out the nature of the issues. <br><br>We spoke to sedera together and they let him know to use a different browser and that helped with the share request.<br><br>Also had questions about a recent ER visit where he stayed 2 night due to heart issues. due to a continuing issue. Let him know he would need to begin a share request for sedera to let them know their decision on what will and will not be shared on. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-11-19 11:43:15', '2025-11-19 12:06:52'),
