  ('zcrm_1579374000173955210', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099847002', 'Dena Pierre', NULL, '11/19/25<br>Member sent in consultation request and is listed as sales for their advisor. Will reach out in my concierge capacity and see what she needs. If she wants to I can set myself as advisor if she wants to make some sort of change to her membership so i can personally educate her since she does not have an advisor. Called her but she did not answer so i left a VM<br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-11-19 11:20:49', '2025-11-19 11:33:30'),
