  ('zcrm_1579374000173933107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171217095', 'Megan Hubbard', NULL, '11-15-25 Plan ID <span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">97879CO0440018-01.  DOB </span><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);">10/21/1984</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 21:34:32', '2025-11-18 21:35:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128033', 'Stephen Whitelande', NULL, '11-18-25 Emma found me via Eric Peirson as the primary person and Tess Weaver also! Emma is 36 and husband is 40 and kids are 5 and 2. They live in Snowmass, CO and are active in sports, skiing, etc. They will use preventive care for the kids and adults. She definitely likes to fund an HSA. They don''t have any pre-x for anyone. They are facing an $8050 ded, $16K family ded. and $1900 per month!  I quoted her Secure HSA at $1250/$817 and $125/$25. I''ll send her the video and written overview once I get her email address. I had to hop off the phone abruptly due to my other appt. They are very interested and looking at Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 20:49:22', '2025-11-18 20:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '11-18-25 Hilary and Michael are possibly changing their minds to keep their MPB membership for Michael and the kids once they say the $10,600 MOP per Individual whereas one incident is $1250. Hilary asked for all of the price comparisons for just her now. I redid all of them and sent them her way. She''s most concerned about a possibly hip surgery. But, now she has no desire to do it. So, she''s pondering MPB for her but will likely choose Cigna or Select Health. We are meeting one more time in Dec.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 20:23:05', '2025-11-18 20:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175202002', 'Gregory Hubachek', NULL, '11-17-25 Dave 62 was referred by Kim and Dave Carpenter. He lives in Nevada and spends a lot of time in Truckee for skiing, biking, etc. outdoor activities. He takes a statin, high blood pressure med and ace inhibitor. He does an annual cardiology exam, wellness check and thyroid check. He had a silent heart attack in 2016, hence the annual checks. I ran out of time. We have a call on Thursday to further discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 19:59:46', '2025-11-20 15:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '11-18-25 Michelle needs to sort out the bills discussed above still. She was on vacation and just returned. Once that''s sorted out then she can think about 2026. She also referred her boyfriend Dave Gerber to me and he may reach out very soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 16:54:16', '2025-11-18 16:54:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '11-18-25 Left vm', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 16:50:11', '2025-11-18 16:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173933001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '11-18-25 Kallie decided to upgrade to Secure HSA for wellness and HSA. They know it will be $1250/$1070 for EF Jan. 1st. She completed the Cognito form and got to the confirmation page. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-18 15:51:20', '2025-11-18 15:51:20'),
